<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Salm</book>
  <para style="h">Salm</para>
  <para style="toc1">Salm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Salm</para>
  <para style="mt">Salm</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna khuakhannak ah aa tel lo i Misual hna lam zong a zul lo i Pathian a nihsawhmi hna sinah a ṭhu lomi cu Thluachuakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An i lawmhnak cu Bawipa nawlbia tu ah khan a si i cu nawlbia cu chunzan in an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tiva kamah a khomi thingkung, a caan hmaan tein a thei a tlai i a hnah a uai bal lomi bantuk an si. An tuahmi thil kip ah khua awng an tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu hi bangin an si lo, Thli nih a chawihmi favai bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cucaah miṭhalo hna cu Pathian nih sual a phawt hna lai, misual mi cu miding mi bu chungah an i tel kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa nih miding cu an lam kha a hngalh, Sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu an lam kha a rawk lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zeicahdah miphun hna nih ral thawhnak khua an khan i An mi hna nih thil ṭhahnem lo dohnak khua an ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An siangpahrang hna le an uktu bawi hna nih Bawipa le Bawipa nih a thimmi siangpahrang doh awk khua an khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An i thawh i, “An kan ṭemnak hri kha chat u si law hlonh u sih,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nih vancung i a bawiṭhutdan cung khin a run nih hna i capo ah a saih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thinhung ngaiin an sinah bia a chim i a thinhunnak nih cun an thin a phanter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aa thawh i, “Zion ka tlang thiang cungah ka siangpahrang cu ka chiah cang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Bawipa nih a chimmi cu ka thanh lai,” tiah siangpahrang nih a ti. Cu a chimmi cu hihi a si: “ Bawipa nih a ka thawh i, ‘Nangmah cu ka fapa na si, nihin ni ah hin kan hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hal law, miphun vialte hi nangmah kan pek dih lai; vawlei hi a dihlak in nangmah ta a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thirfung in na uk hna lai i tlak um bangin na khuai dih hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cucaah siangpahrang hna, ka bia ngai tuah u, uktu bawi hna, hngal cang tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa cu ṭih bu tein a rian ṭuan tuah u, therphang in um u law
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hmaiah kun tuah u. Cu ti a si lo ahcun, a thinhunnak kha khulrang in a alhmi a si caah, a thin a hung lai i nan thi sual lai. Amah chungah aa dormi cu thluachuakmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka ral an tam tuk hringhran, a ka dohtu an tam tuk hringhran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An ka thangchiat i, “Pathian nih a bawm lai lo,” an ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa, nangmah nih phaw bantukin na ka huhphenh zungzal i teinak kha na ka pek i ka lung na ka ṭhawnter ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa kha ka auh i a tlang thiang cungin a ka leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih a ka thlim i kaa hngilh, Bawipa nih a ka ven caah him tein kaa hlau ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ka kulhtu ka ral thong tampi hi ka ṭih hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa, ra ko sawh! Ka Pathian, ka khamh ko! Ka ral vialte cu na tei dih hna i miṭhalo vialte cu na hrawh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khamhnak cu Bawipa sinin a rami a si, Bawipa nih a mi cu thluachuah pe ko hna seh.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka au tikah ka let tuah, maw Pathian a ka chanhtu, Harnak chung i ka um tikah nangmah nih na ka bawmh tawn. Atu zong ka zaangfah law ka thlacamnak hi ka theihpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nannih minung hna, zei can dah na ka serhsat lai? Zei can dah santlailo thil kha nan duh lai i lihbia kha nan dawi lai? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa nih amah ta si awkah a ka thim i ka auh tikah a ka theih ti kha philh hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭihnak ngei u law nan sualnak kha ngol hna u; hi thil hi nanmah lawng tein nan inn khaan chungah thuk piin ruat tuah u. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu a hmaanmi raithawinak kha pe u law amah cu i bochan tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thluachuahnak hmu u si law kan hei duh hringhran dah,” a timi tampi an um. Maw Bawipa, kan cungah zaangfahnak run ngei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah nih lawmhnak na ka pekmi cu, din awk zu tampi a ngeimi le ei awk rawl tampi a ngeimi hna an i lawmhnak nakin a ngan deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnangam tein ka it lai i kaa hngilh fawn lai, Bawipa, nangmah lawnglawng nih him tein na ka umter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka bia hi ka ngaihpiak hna law ka aihramnak hi ka theihpiak tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Siangpahrang le ka Pathian, ka thlacamnak hi ka ngaihpiak tuah. Bawipa nangmah sinah thla ka cam lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zinglei ah ka aw kha na ka theihpiak: nichuak kate ah na sinah thla ka cam tawn i na ka lehnak kha ka hngah tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang cu ṭhat lonak tuahnak ah aa lawmmi Pathian na si lo i na hmaika ah ṭhat lonak umter kha na duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miporhlaw cu na ing kho hna lo i miṭhalo cu na huat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lihchim mi cu na hrawh dih hna i mipuarhrang le mihlenhmang cu na nautat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu na dawtnak a nganmi thawngin na inn chungah ka ra lut kho; a thiangmi na biakinn chungah nangmah kan bia kho i na hmaiah ka kun kho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, ral tampi ka ngei, na duhnak tuah awkah ka hruai law na lam cu ka zulh khawh nakhnga ka hmaiah na lam cu pheiter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ral nih an chimmi bia cu zeitikhmanh ah zumh khawhmi bia an si lo, Zeicahtiah annih cu mi hrawh lawnglawng kha an duh; an kaa cu chilh lomi thlan bantuk a si i an bia cu hlennak bia le nal bia lawnglawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, annih cu sual phaw hna law dantat hna, an i timhmi thil ṭhalo cu tlinter hlah. An sualnak a tam ca le nangmah an in doh caah annih cu na hmaika in ṭhawl hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmah ah himnak a hmumi cu an i lawm lai i lawmhnak in hla an sa zungzal lai. Nangmah an dawmi cu na huhphenh hna, nangmah thawngin lawmhnak taktak an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, na nawl a ngaimi cu thluachuah na pek hna, na zaangfahnak nih phaw bantukin a huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, na thinhung hlah law, ka si hlah! Na thinhun in dan ka tat hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka baat cang caah ka cungah zaangfahnak ngei ko, ka tha a dih cang caah thazang thar ka pe ko sawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka nunnak hi a ning piin a fak, zei can dah hitihin ka um lai, maw Bawipa ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka khamh tuah; na ka dawt caah thihnak chungin ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithi khua ah ahohmanh nih an in hngal lo, Sheol ah ahohmanh nih an in thangṭhat kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungfahnak in ka baa tuk hringhran cang; zanfate ka ṭahnak ah ka ihkhun cu a cin dih i ka chantling cu ka mitthli nih a ciah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka ṭah tuk caah ka mit an phing dih i khua hmanh ṭha tein ka hmu kho ti lo — hi ti i ka umnak cu ka ral hna ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nannih ṭhat lonak a tuahmi hna, ka kaltak ko u, Bawipa nih ka ṭahnak kha a theih cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />bawmh hal in ka aunak kha a theih i ka thlacamnak kha a ka leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ral cu an sung lai i vansang au in an um lai, lungmit in chikkhatte ah an zam lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, nangmah cu ka himnak na si; a ka dawitu vialte hna sin hin ka khamh law ka chanh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu ti na ka khamh lo ahcun ahohmanh khamhtu ngei loin, chiandeih bantukin an ka hnuh lai i an ka thleh an ka baoh dih ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ka Pathian, mi cungah ṭhat lonak tuah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hawikom rawi le zei ruangah ti awk um set loin ral cungah ṭhat lonak tuah hi, hi hna lakah hin pakhatkhat ka tuah a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral nih ka dawi hna seh law ka tlai hna seh, ka tu hna seh law ka that hna seh, vawlei ah nunnak ngei loin ka hril ta hna seh! Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thinhun in tho tuah, maw Bawipa, ka ral hna thinhunnak kha doh awkah dir tuah. I hlau law ka bawm tuah, zeicahtiah na duhmi cu ding tein biaceih kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi vialte kha na velchum ah pumhter hna law annih cu cunglei khan run uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu mi vialte biaceihtu bawi na si. Kei cu miṭha le a sual lomi ka si caah keimah lei ṭanh in biakhiahnak kha tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna ṭhat lonak cu kham law miṭha cu laksawng in lehrul ko hna. Nang cu a dingmi Pathian na si i minung lungthin le duhnak vialte a hngal dihtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ka hupphengtu cu Pathian a si, amah nawl a ngaimi cu a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian cu a dingmi biaceihtu a si, miṭhalo kha sual a phawt zungzal hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi cu an i ngaihchih lo ahcun Pathian nih a nam aa tat lai. A likuk kha aa hruai i kah colh dingin aa tim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmual a fak ngaimi a hriam kha aa lak hna i meialh bantuk a simi a cantiang kha aa tinh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih thil ṭhalo a tuaktanning kha ruat hmanh; harnak chuahter ding kha khua a khan i hlennak kha a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vawlei ah khan khor thukpi a cawh i amah lila kha a cawhmi khor ah cun a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuticun amah ṭhat lonak lila nih khan harnak a pek i amah puarhrannak lila nih khan fahnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu dinnak a tuahmi ruangah ka lawmh lai, Cung Nung Bik Bawipa cu hla in ka thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan Bawipa, Na lianhngannak cu vawleicung dihlak ah hin a lang ko! Nangmah thangṭhatnak hi van tiang a phan i;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ngakchia le bawhte nih hla in an sak. Na ral hna khamkanhnak ah ralhruang na ser i, na ral le nangmah an huatu hna rak donhnak ah ralhau na ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah na sermi van le an hmun ciote ah na chiahmi thlapa le arfi hna khi ka zoh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />minung hi zeidah a si i na hnakkar ah na tenh? Minung menmen a simi hi zeidah a si i a zawn na ruah? ti hi ka ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah lawnglawng hi a cungah a ummi na si i sunparnak le upatnak cu a lu ah na chinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sermi thil vialte a uktu ah na ser i zeizong vialte hna dihlak cungah khan na chiah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuu le caw le ramlak saram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />va le nga le rili chung thilnung vialte zong, an dihlak in a tangah na chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan Bawipa, na lianhngannak cu vawleicung dihlak ah hin a lang ko!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, ka lungthin dihlak in nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai, nangmah nih khuaruahhar thil na tuahmi vialte cu ka chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah thawngin lunglawm in hla ka sa lai, maw Cung Nung Bik, nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah na langh tikah ka ral cu an i let, an tlu i an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dingmi biaceihtu bawi bantukin na bawiṭhutdan cungah na ṭhu i keimah lei ṭanh in biakhiahnak kha na tuah cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawkihmi kha sual na phawt hna i miṭhalo kha na hrawh hna, annih cu hngalh ṭhan, ti a um ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan ral cu an dih cang, an khua cu na hrawh cang hna i a philh in philh an si dipdep cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa cu zungzal in siangpahrang a si ko; biaceihnak tuah awkah a bawiṭhutdan cungah cun a ṭhu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dinnak in vawlei kha a uk i biading in mi kha an bia a ceih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hremnak a ingmi hna caah Bawipa cu himnak hmun a si i harnak caan ah ralhruang fek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah an hngalmi nih cun an in bochan lai, nangmah sinah a rami cu ahohmanh na dawn bal hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion ah a ummi Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat u, a tuahmi thil kha miphun kip chim hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian nih hremnak a ingmi kha a philh hna lo i an aunak kha a philh lo: an cung i ṭhat lonak a tuahtu kha dan a tat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka zaangfah ko! A ka huatu nih zeitluk in dah ka cungah ṭhat lonak an tuah kha ka hmuhpiak tuah. Bawipa, thihnak chungin ka chuah law
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem khuami hna hmaiah ka dir lai i nangmah kha zei ruangah dah kan thangṭhat ti vialte kha ka chimh hna lai. Nangmah nih na ka chuah caah ka lung aa lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lawkihmi nih khor an cawh i anmah an tla; rap an chiah i anmah an i foih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ding tein bia a ceihnak ah khan Bawipa cu amah le amah aa phuang i miṭhalo hna cu anmah tuahnak lila ah khan an i foih. Higgaion. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Miṭhalo vialte hna le Pathian a hlawmi vialte an donghnak cu thihnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipam cu hrelh an si zungzal lai lo i hremmi cu ruahchan awk ngei lo an si zungzal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa, ra tuah, mi nih zeirello in in um hna hlah seh! Lawkihmi cu na hmaiah chuahter hna law an bia ceih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, annih cu an thinphanter hna, minung menmen an si kha hngalhter hna. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, zeicahdah lamhla tuk ah na um? Zeicahdah harnak caan ah naa thuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu an ruam a kai i misifak kha an hrem hna; anmah nih an chiahmi rap ah khan i foih hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih a duhnak ṭhalo kha aa porhlaw i hakkaumi nih Bawipa kha a vawlhpamh i a hlawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ruam a kai caah miṭhalo nih cun aa thawh i, “Pathian nih cun dan a ka tat lai lo, ka duhnak ṭhalo kha a zeihmanh a poi lem lai lo,” a ti. Miṭhalopa nih a ruahmi cu cucu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A rianṭuannak ah a hlawh a tling. Pathian biaceihning kha a hngalthiam lo; a ral kha a nih in a nihsawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah le amah cu, “Ka sung bal lai lo; harnak ka tong bal lai lo,” aa ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A bia cu chiatserhnak le lih le hronak in a khat; huat awk bia le bia ṭhalo chim ah khan a khul a rang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuate ah khan aa thup riangmang i a sual lomi kha a nawn hna. Thah a duhmi kha aa ngiat hna i;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chiandeih bantukin a bawh hna, a rap in a foih hna i a kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vanchiapa cu a ril ko, miṭhawngpa nih a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miṭhalopa nih cun aa thawh i, “Pathian cu a zeihmanh a poi lai lo, a mit aa chinh i a ka hmu bal lai lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ra law ka khamh tuah! Hremmi kha philh sawh hna hlah, Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeitindah miṭhalo hna nih cun Pathian cu zeirello in an um khawh lai i? “Dan a kan tat bal lai lo,” an ti khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang nih cun na hmuh ko hna; temhinnak le ngaihchiatnak a ingmi cu na hngalh ko hna i bawmh awkah naa tim zungzal ko. Bawmhnak a herhmi kha na bawmh zungzal hna caah vanchiami nih nangmah kha an in fuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miṭhalo le misual cu an ṭhawnnak kha hrawk hna law an ṭhat lonak ruangah khan tling khitkhet in dantat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa cu zungzal in zungzal tiang siangpahrang a si i a ram chung hin lawkihmi cu an lo lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa, minauta cu an thlacamnak kha na ngaihpiak hna i lungṭhawnnak na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hremmi hna le ngakṭah cu an aunak kha na theihpiak hna i anmah lei ṭanh in bia na ceih, cucaah a thi khomi minung nih hin thil ṭihnung kha an umter ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka himnak dingah Bawipa cu kaa bochan. Nang nih naa thawh i, “Va bantukin tlang ah zuang tuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zeicahtiah miṭhalo nih an likuk kha an i hruai i muihnak i a ummi miṭha kha kah awkah an cantiang cu an i tinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil aa nincan lo tikah hin miṭha nih an tuah khawhmi zeihmanh a um lo,” tiah na ka ti tikah hin zeitluk in dah na hruh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu a biakinn thiang chungah a um ko i a bawiṭhutdan cu van ah khin a um ko. Mi vialte kha a zoh hna i an tuahmi vialte kha a hngalh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miṭha zong, miṭhalo zong ṭha tein a dothlat hna; zaang-ennak a duhmi kha a thinlung dihlak in a huat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miṭhalo cungah meiṭil le kaat kha a surter; a alhmi mei in dan a tat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ding i tuahsernak ding kha a duh, mi dingmi nih a hmai kha an hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka khamh tuah, maw Bawipa ! Miṭha an um ti lo i lihchim lomi an um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat an i hleng i hlepar faknak hmur le lung hnih ngei in bia an chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, hlepar fak thiam lei cu daihter law tluang a khawng lengmangmi kaa cu phit hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih nih an i thawh i, “Kan duhmi paoh kan chim ko lai, ahohmanh nih an kan kham kho lai lo. Aho nih dah, cucu nan chim awk a si, tiah an kan chimh khawh lai?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih aa thawh i, “Sifakmi cu an hrem hna i retheimi cu aihram lengmang in an tuah hna caah atu cu ka ra lai i an ngaihmi himnak cu ka pek hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa biakamnak cu zumhawktlak an si; somei chungah voi sarih tiang erletmi ngun tlukin an thiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu a kenkip ah an um i mi zeipaoh nih thilṭhalo kha an hlawrh, Maw Bawipa, hi mi hna sin hin kan kilveng law him tein kan umter zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zei can dah na ka philh lai, maw Bawipa ? Na ka philh zungzal ko lai maw? Zei can dah na ka thuh tak rih lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zei can dah fahnak hi ka in lai? Zei can dah ngaihchiatnak in ka lung hi chun he zan he a khah lai? Zei can dah ka ral hi ka cungah a lek in an i lek lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, ka zoh law ka let tuah. ka thih nakhnga lo, ka thazang kha ka pe ṭhan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu ti na ka tuah ahcun ka ral nih, “Amah cu kan tei cang,” an ti kho lai lo i ka sunghnak ah khan an di a riam kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a fekmi na dawtnak kha kaa bochan i na ka khamh lai ti ka zumh caah kaa lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka cungah a ṭhat zungzal caah amah cu hla in ka thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihrut nih cun an i thawh i, “Pathian a um lo,” an ti. An dihlak in an thu, thil ṭhalo kha an tuah; ahmaanmi thil a tuahmi ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minung lakah hin a fimmi le keimah a ka biami an um hnga maw ti hngalh duh ah Bawipa nih vancung khin a run zoh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an dihlak in an tlau cang, an dihlak in an chiatnak aa tluk dih, Pakhat hmanh thil hmaan a tuahmi an um lo, pakhat taktak hmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nih, “An hngal hnga lo maw? Ṭhat lonak a tuahmi vialte hi mihrut maw an si dih hnga? ka mi kha an ramh hna i cucu an i cawmnak, ka sinah thla an cam bal lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian cu a nawl a ngaimi hna sinah a um caah annih cu an thin a phang ngaingai lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna nih sifakmi an khuakhannak cu dawnkhan hna hmanh seh law a humhaktu hna cu Bawipa a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel khamhnak cu Zion in ra seh ti ka hei duh hringhran dah! Bawipa nih a mi cu luatnak a pek ṭhan hna tikah, Jakob tefa cu an lung aa lawm lai, Israel mi cu an tha a nuam lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, na biakinn chungah ahodah a lut lai? Na tlang thiang Zion cungah ahodah a um lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A um ding cu, zeizong vialte ah Pathian nawl a zul i a hmaanmi thil a tuah zungzal i a bia biahmaan le biatak a si i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mi congoih a hmang lo i hawikom cungah ṭhat lonak a tuah lo i a innpa a congoih lo i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian nih a hlawtmi kha zeirello in a um i Bawipa nawl a zulmi cu a upat i Zeitluk in a har hmanh ah a biakam ningin a tuah zungzal i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a karh la loin mi tangka a cawih i a sual lomi hna sual phawt awkah ziknawh pek khawh lomi cu an si. Hi thil a tuahmi hna cu an i hnin bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah cu kan fuh ko, ka huppheng ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka thawh i, “Nangmah cu ka Bawipa na si; thil ṭha ka ngeihmi vialte hi nangmah sinin ka hmuhmi an si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa mi, zumhawktlak a simi hna cu, zeitluk in dah an ṭhat! Anmah he um ṭi cu kaa lawmhnak ngan bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian dang a zuan lengmangmi nih cun, an cungah harnak an i tlunter. An raithawinak ah kaa tel duh lai lo i an pathian cu ka bia hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah dah ti lo cu ka ngeihmi dang zeihmanh a um lo, maw Bawipa, ka herhmi vialte cu nangmah nih na ka pek, ka nunnak cu na kut chungah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Laksawng na ka pekmi cu zeitluk in dah khuaruahhar an si, zeitluk in dah an ṭhat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa nih a ka hruai caah amah cu ka thangṭhat, zan ah ka lungthin nih ralrinnak a ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ka sinah a um cu ka hngalh zungzal, amah cu keimah he naihte ah a um i zeihmanh nih an ka hnin kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah lawmhnak le thanuamnak in ka khat i him tein ka um zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cu ti ka si cu Mithi khua ah khan na ka kaltak lai lo le na dawtmi cu Khor Thuk chungah na ka chiahtak lai lo caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nunnak lei kalnak lam cu na ka hmuhsak lai; ka sinah na um caah lawmhnak in ka khat i na ka bawmh caah nuamhnak ka hmu zungzal.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan nawlnak a dingmi hi ngai tuah, nangmah bawmh hal in ka aunak hi ka theihpiak tuah. Ka chungah hlennak zeihmanh a um lo caah ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahmaanmi thil kha nangmah nih na hngalh caah keimah lei ṭanh in bia na ceih lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lung cu na hngalh, zan ah ka sinah na ra. Ṭha tein na ka hneksak cikcek i ka chungah duhnak ṭhalo zeihmanh a um lo kha na hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midang bantukin ṭhat lonak bia zeihmanh ka chim lo, na nawl kha ka zulh i puarhrannak lam kha ka zul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lam kha ka zulh zungzal i zeitikhmanh ah ka pialtak bal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na sinah thla ka cam i na ka leh: cucaah atu zongah hin keimah leiah i mer law ka bia cu ka ngaihpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Khamhtu Bawi, na dawtnak khuaruahhar cu langhter ko; na kiang kan um ahcun kan ral hna kut chungin kan him.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ka dohtu miṭhalo hna sin hin Na mitfang bantukin ka veng law Na thlazung in ka hup tuah. Huatnak in a khatmi ka ral nih khan an ka dum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zaangfahnak zeihmanh an ngei lo i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kaa mernak lei paoh ah khan an rak um dih, keimah thluk khawhnak ding caan ṭha kha an bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chiandeih bantuk an si i thleh dih le baoh dih kha an ka duh, an i thuhnak hmun in chiandeih no bantukin an ka bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ra law ka ral hi do hna law tei hna! Miṭhalo hna kut chung hin na vainam in ka chanh tuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na ṭhawnnak in an kut chungin ka khamh tuah, hi vawlei cung nun chung i an duhmi thil vialte tling tein a ngei khomi hna kut chung hin ka khamh tuah. An caah na khonmi dantatnak kha an cungah tlunter law an tefa hna ca zongah i za seh law an tefa hna tefa chin hna ca zongah i za rih seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei tu nih cun ka sual lo caah na hmai kha ka hmuh lai i cun ka hun i hlauh tikah nangmah ka sin i na um caah lunglawmhnak in ka khat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka ṭhawnnak, nangmah cu kan dawt hringhran ko! Nangmah cu a ka chanhtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka khamhtu a si, amah cu a fekmi ka ralhruang a si. Ka Pathian cu a ka hupphengtu a si, amah sinah cun him tein ka um. Phaw bantukin a ka huhphenh, a ka ven i him tein a ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka auh i ka ral hna kut chungin a ka khamh. Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thihnak nih a hri in a ka ṭem, rawhralnak tilian nih a ka tlunhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thihnak nih a hri in a ka ṭem, thlan nih a rap kha a ka chiahhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka harnak chungin Bawipa cu ka auh; bawmhnak hal in ka Pathian cu ka auh. A biakinn chungin ka aw kha a theih, bawmhnak ka halnak ka aw cu a hna a phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Pathian cu a thin a hun caah vawlei cu aa hnin i a ther; tlang hram hna cu an i hnin i an i sai dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnar chungin meikhu an chuak i a kaa chungin a hliau in aa hliaumi meizik an chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Van khi a run baoh i a rung ṭum, a ke tang i a ummi khuadawm nakpi he a rung ṭum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherubim kha aa cit hna i a rung zuang, thlitu kha a thla in aa cit i khulrang in a choi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Muihnak in amah le amah cu aa tuam, ti a khatmi khuadawm nakpi nih khan a zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmai i aa lekmi nimtlau chungin rial le meiṭil an tla, khuadawm nakpi chung khan an rung tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Bawipa cu vancung in khuari bantukin a rung ri i Cung Nung Bik aw cu a rung thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thal cu a thlah hna i a ral cu a ṭhek hna; ṭek kha a tlakter i an zaam dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah nih na ral cu na sik hna i na thinhun in na onhhnawh hna tikah rili tawne cu a lang i vawlei hram cu a chin kha aa hung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa nih vancung khin a run ka banh i a ka tlaih; ti thuk chungin a ka chuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ṭhawngmi ka ral hna kut chungin a ka chuah, a ka huami vialte hna kut chungin a ka chuah — annih cu ka caah a ṭhawng tukmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Harnak ka ton tikah an ka doh, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih cun a ka huhphenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ṭihnung chungin a ka chuah; ka cungah a lung a tlin caah a ka khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka din caah Bawipa nih laksawng a ka pek, a sual lomi ka si caah thluachuah a ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa nawlbia cu ka zulh; ka Pathian cu ka doh lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A phunglam vialte kha ka zulh i a nawlbia kha zul loin ka um hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Palhnak ka tuah lo kha a hngalh, thil ṭhalo ka hrial kha a hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cucaah cun ka din caah khan laksawng a ka pek i ka sual lo a hngalh caah khan ṭuan man a ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa, nang cu zumhawktlak a simi sinah zumhawktlak in na um ve i a ṭhami sinah na ṭha ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thiangmi sinah na thiang i asinain miṭhalo cu na huat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi toiah aa dormi cu na khamh hna i miruamkai cu na ṭhumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa nih ceunak a ka pek, ka Pathian nih muihnak cu a ka dawipiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ral hna doh khawhnak thazang a ka pek, an ralhau baoh khawhnak ṭhawnnak a ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi Pathian hi, zeitluk in dah a tuahmi kha a tlin i zeitluk in dah a bia kha i bochan awk an si! A huhphenhnak a kawlmi hna caah cun phaw bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa lawnglawng hi Pathian cu a si, Pathian lawnglawng hi kan ralhau cu a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah hi a kan ṭhawntertu Pathian cu a si, kan kalnak lam a himtertu cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sazuk ke bantukin ka ke cu a khul a ranter i tlang cungah him tein a ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Raltuk a ka cawnpiak i cucaah a ṭhawng bikmi likuk hmanh kha ka hman khawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih na ka huhphenh i, na ka khamh; na ka zohkhenhnak nih mingan ah a ka ser i na dawtnak nih him tein a ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangmah nih na ka huhphenh caah an ka tlai kho lo i a tluk zong ka tlu bal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ral cu ka dawi hna i ka tlaih hna, Ka tei hna hlantiang ka ngol hna lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka tuk hna i an tho kho ti lo, ka kehram ah an ril ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Raltuknak hmun caah thazang na ka pek i ka ral hna teinak ah ṭhawnnak na ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka ral hna cu keimah hnulei chit in na zamter hna i a ka huatu cu ka hrawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bawmhnak hal in an ai, sihmanhsehlaw ahohmanh nih an khamh kho hna lo; Bawipa kha an auh, sihmanhsehlaw a let hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Dip cikcek in ka rial hna i thli nih a choihmi leidip bantuk ah an cang, lam i leicet bantukin ka lamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ral thawh hmangmi miphun chungin na ka khamh i miphun hna uktu ah na ka ser: ka hngalh bal lomi kha ka kut tangah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka bia an theih tikah ka nawl an ka zulh, ramdangmi kha ka hmaiah an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />An hnabei a dong i an ralhau chung khan ther lengmang in an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Bawipa cu a nungmi Pathian a si, ka khamhnak lungpi cu thangṭhat ko u! Pathian cu ka khamhtu a si, a lianhngannak kha thanh tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ka ral hna teinak kha a ka pek i miphun tampi kha ka kut tangah a chiah hna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka ral hna kut chungin a ka khamh. Bawipa, nangmah nih ka ral hna teinak cu na ka pek i mipuarhrang mi hna kut chungin na ka huhphenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cucaah miphun kip sinah nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai i na thangṭhatnak cu hla in ka sak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Pathian nih a siangpahrang cu teinak nganpi a ka pek; a fekmi a dawtnak kha a thimmi keimah David le Ka tefa hna cungah zungzal in a langhter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van nih khin Pathian sunparnak a langhter i a tuahmi thil kha a kan hmuhsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chun nih a hun changtu chun sinah khan a chim i zan zong nih a hun changtu zan sinah khan a nolh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bia siseh holh siseh an hmang lo, aw thawng zong zeihmanh theih a um lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />asinain an aw cu vawlei khuazakip ah a thang i an bia cu vanhramdeng a phan. Bawipa nih ni cu van ah khin thlam a sakpiak i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nupi ṭhi tlangval a inn in a hung chuah bantuk khin a hung chuak, tlik aa zuammi tlik zuamnak i an hung chuah bantuk khin a hung chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanhramdeng khattelei khin aa thawk i khattelei ah a kal. A linhnak in aa thup khomi thil zeihmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa phung cu a ṭhat a tling, nunnak thar petu a si. Bawipa nawlbia cu bochan awk a tlak, fimnak a baumi fimnak petu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa phunglam cu ahmaanmi an si, cu phunglam a zulmi cu an lung aa lawm. A nawlbia cu dinnak leiah a tlingmi an si i hngalhthiamnak lungthin pe khotu an si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa biak cu a ṭha, cu biaknak cu zungzal in a hmun lai. Bawipa biakhiahnak cu an ding, zungzal in ahmaanmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sui nakin duh deuh awk an si, sui thiang bik phun nak hmanh in duh deuh awk an si, Khuaihliti nakin an thlum deuh, khuaihliti thiang bik nakin an thlum deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sal hi hngalhnak an ka pek i ka zulh hna caah laksawng ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahohmanh amah sualnak aa hmu khomi an um lo; a thli tein ka tuahmi ka sualnak chungin ka thianh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lenglang sualnak chung zongah ka luh nakhnga lo ka kham law cu sualnak cu keimah uktu siter hna hlah; cu tikah ṭhatnak leiah mitling ka si lai i sualnak ṭihnung chungin ka luat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka kaa chung bia hna le ka lung chung ruahnak hna cu, nangmah cohlan awk tlak si ko hna seh, maw Bawipa, ka lungpi le ka tlantu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Harnak na ton ni ah Bawipa nih in let ko seh. Jakob Pathian nih in huppheng ko seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A biakinn chungin bawmhnak in pe seh law Zion Tlang cungin in pe ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pekchanhmi thil vialte kha in cohlanpiak seh law na raithawinak vialte nih khan a lungtong ko seh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na duhmi kha in pe seh law na timhmi vialte kha tlinter ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun teinak na hmuhmi ruangah khan lunglawm in kan au lai, teinak na hmuhmi cu kan Pathian thangṭhat in kan conglawmh lai Na halmi vialte cu Bawipa nih in pe ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atu cu Bawipa nih a thimmi siangpahrang kha teinak a pek ti ka hngalh cang; a thiangmi a vancung khin a run leh i a ṭhawngmi a lianhngannak in teinak kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi a cheu nih an raltuknak rangleng kha an i bochan; a cheu nih an rangtum kha an i bochan hna; sihmanhsehlaw kannih cu Bawipa kan Pathian ṭhawnnak kha kan i bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih cu an ril i an tlu lai. sihmanhsehlaw kannih cu kan tho lai i, fek tein kan dir lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, siangpahrang cu teinak pe ko; kan auh tikah Bawipa nih a kan leh lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih thazang na pek caah siangpahrang cu aa lawm; teinak na pek caah lawmhnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A duhmi kha na pek i an halnak kha na leh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thluachuahnak tampi he na len i a lu ah suiluchin na chinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nunnak an hal i na pek, nun sau le chan sau na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah nih na bawmh caah a sunparnak cu a ngan, minthannak le lianhngannak na pek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na thluachuahnak cu a hmuh zungzal hna i nangmah a sin i na um caah lawmhnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih Cung Nung Bik cu aa bochan i Bawipa dawtnak a fekmi thawngin siangpahrang a si zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih a ral kha a tlaih dih hna lai i a huatu vialte kha a tlaih dih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hung chuah tikah meizik bantukin a hrawh dih hna lai. Bawipa nih a thinhun in a kangh dih hna lai i mei nih a kangh dih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih an fale kha a thah dih hna lai i an tefa kha a nawn dih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A cung i ṭhat lonak tuah kha an i tim lai i khua an khang lai, sihmanhsehlaw an khuakhanmi le an timhnak cu an tling kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thal in a kah hna lai i an i mer lai i an thi lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, na ṭhawnnak he ra tuah. na ṭhawnnak cu hla in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, zeicahdah na ka hlawt? Ka bawm ko sawh, tiah fak piin ka au, sihmanhsehlaw bawmhnak cu a ra hlei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chun ah nangmah cu kan auh, maw ka Pathian, sihmanhsehlaw na ka let lo; zan zongah kan auh, sihmanhsehlaw dinh ka hmu kho hlei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw nangmah cu Israel Mi Thiang, Israel mi nih an thangṭhatmi na si i na bawiṭhutdan cungah khan na ṭhu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan pupa nih an in bochan, nangmah cu an in bochan i na khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah kha an in auh i ṭih awk chungin an luat, nangmah kha an in bochan i na khel hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu minung ka si ti lo, cangcel ka si ko cang; mi vialte nih an ka serhsat i an ka nihsawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ka hmumi paoh nih capo ah an ka saih, an lei an ka chakhnawh i an lu an ka thinhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An i thawh i, “ Bawipa naa bochan ṭung, zeicahdah an khamh kun lo? Bawipa nih an dawt ahcun, zeicahdah an bawmh kun lo?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Him tein a ka chuahtertu cu nangmah na si i bawhte ka si lioah ṭha tein a ka zohkhenhtu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka chuah ri in nangmah cu kan bochan zungzal i ka chuah ri in ka Pathian na si zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hung ka hlaat sawh hlah! Harnak nih a ka naih i a ka bawmtu ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ral nih cawtum bantukin an ka kulh, Bashan ram cawtum ṭihnung pipi bantuk nih khan an ka kulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chiandeih bantukin an kaa an ka anhnawh, an awn i an kaa balh hiamhuam in an i an.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thazang a dih cang, vawlei i thletmi ti bantukin a dih cang. Ka ruh vialte kha ka hliahhlok in an pong dih, ka lung cu ka chungah a timi khuailul bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hrom cu leidip ro in a ro, ka lei cu ka dang cunglei ah aa beh. Leidip lak i hung thi dingah na ka kaltak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miṭhalo bu nih an ka kulh, uico run bantukin an ka zuanhnawh; ka kut le ka ke ah an ka seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ruh vialte an lang dih. Ka ral nih khan an ka zoh i an di a riam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ka hnipuan kha an i phaw i ka puan caah khan voihfung an zuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hlaat sawh hlah, maw Bawipa ! Khulrang in ra law ka bawm tuah, maw ka Khamhtu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vainam chungin ka khamh law kha uico hna sin khan ka nunnak cu khamh ko,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kha chiandeih hna sin khan ka khamh ko; kha cawtum hrang hna hmaiah khan kei cu zeihmanh a tuah khomi ka si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na tuahmi kha ka mi cu ka chimh hna lai, an i pumhnak ah kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Annih cu ka thawh hna lai i, “ Bawipa sal hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u! Jakob tefa hna, amah cu upat tuah u. Israel mi hna, amah cu bia tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sifakmi kha anih nih cun a hrelh hna lo i an nganfahnak kha zeirello in a um lo; annih kha a hlaat hna lo i bawmhnak hal in an aunak kha a leh hna,” ka ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aa pummi dihlak hmaiah, nangmah cu na tuahmi ruangah kan thangṭhat lai; nangmah nawl zulmi an dihlak hmaiah kaa kammi raithawinak kha kan pekchanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sifakmi nih an duh zat in an ei lai, Bawipa sinah a rami nih Bawipa cu an thangṭhat lai. Zungzal in thluachuak in um ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Miphun vialte nih Bawipa cu an hngalh camcin lai, vawleicung khuazakip in amah leiah an i mer lai; miphun zakip nih an biak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si i amah nih miphun vialte cu a uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miporhlaw vialte kha a hmaiah an kun lai, a thi khomi minung, a thi ding a si komi vialte hna kha a hmaiah an kun lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmailei chan mi nih a rian an ṭuan lai; a ra lai ding chan sinah Bawipa kong cu mi nih an chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A chuak rih lomi minung kha, “ Bawipa nih mi a khamh hna,” tiah an chimh hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu tuukhal bantukin a ka vengtu a si, ka herhmi vialte kha a ka pek dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ramhring lakah a ka bawhter, dinh hmun ti pawngah a ka hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thazang thar kha a ka pek i a rak ka kamh bantukin ahmaanmi lam ah a ka hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thuk bikmi muihnak horkuang chungin kal hmanh ning law, Bawipa, zeihmanh ka ṭih lai lo, zeicahtiah nangmah nih na ka umpi. Na ṭhiangṭhunh le na tanbo nih ka hna an ka ngamter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral hna hmaika ah rawl na ka dangh, ka lu ah chiti na ka toih i ka hrai cu a liam in a liam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhatnak le na dawtnak nih ka nun chung vialte an ka umpi lai i na inn cu a zungzal in ka inn a si lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vawlei le a chung i a ummi thil vialte hi Bawipa ta an si, vawlei le a cung i a ummi minung vialte zong hi amah ta kan si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rili cungah vawlei cu a dirter i a hram cu rili thuk chungah khan a bunh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa tlang ah ahodah a kai kho lai? A biakinn thiang chungah ahodah a lut kho lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuahnak le lungthin in a thiang i siasal kha a bia lo i hlennak biakam a tuah lomi kha an kai kho lai i an lut kho lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih thluachuah a pek hna lai i annih a khamhtu hna Pathian nih, nan sual lo, a ti hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cu bantuk mi cu Pathian sin i a ra khomi an si, Jakob Pathian hmaika i a chuak khomi an si. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kutka hna, kau piin i hung u, zungzal in a ummi innka hna, kau piin i hung u; a liannganmi siangpahrang cu a lut lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A liannganmi siangpahrang cu ahodah a si? A liannganmi siangpahrang cu a ṭhawng i a lian a nganmi, raltuknak hmun in teitu a simi Bawipa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kutka hna kau piin i hung u, zungzal hmunmi innka hna, kau piin i hung u; a liannganmi siangpahrang cu a lut lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A liannganmi siangpahrang cu ahodah a si? Amah cu ralkapbu Bawipa, a liannganmi siangpahrang kha a si! Selah a si! Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah sinah thla ka cam, ka Pathian, nangmah cu kan bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sungh ningzahnak chung khan ka khamh law ka ral cu ka cungah an di riamhter hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah an bochanmi cu an sung lo i, asinain nangmah doh ah a khul a rangmi cu sunghnak kha an phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na lam kha ka cawnpiak hna law ka hngalhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka khamhtu na si caah na biatak ningin nun cu ka cawnpiak tuah. Chun nitlak in nangmah kha kan bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, hlan piin ka cungah na rak langhter tawnmi na dawtnak fek le na zaangfahnak cu philh hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tlanval lio ka sualnak le ka palhnak kha ka ngaithiam ko hna. A fekmi na dawtnak le na ṭhatnak ruangah keimah cu ka philh hlah, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ding i a ṭha: misual mi kha an zulh awk a simi lam cu a cawnpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi toi i aa dormi kha lamding in a hruai hna i a duhnak kha a cawnpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A biakam le nawlbia a zulmi vialte cu, dawtnak in a hruai hna i zumhawktlak tein a kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka sualnak cu zeitluk hmanh in ngan seh law, na min ruangah ka ngaithiam ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nawl a zulmi nih an zulh awk hnga lam kha an hngalh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nun nuam tein an um lai i an fale cu hi ram chungah hin him tein khua an sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu a nawl a zulmi hna hawikom a si i a biakam kha a cawnpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa cu kaa bochan zungzal i thil ṭihnung chungin a ka chuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, keimah lei hoi law, ka zaangfah tuah, zeitintiah ka um a har i ka thazang a der.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lung retheihnak vialte cu ka chawng law ka harnak dihlak chungin ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka retheihnak vialte le ka innak vialte kha ka ruahpiak hna law Ka sualnak vialte cu ka ngaithiam ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ral vialte hi zoh tuah hna, zeitluk in dah an ka huat hi hmu tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka huppheng law ka khamh tuah, himnak hmuh duh ah nangmah cu kan fuh caah mualpho in ka umter sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah kha kan bochan caah ka ṭhatnak le ka lih chim lonak nih ka huppheng ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na mi cu kan harnak chung hin kan khamh ko!
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah kha ka lung a dih-umnak in kan bochan i a dingmi thil kha ka tuah caah, misual lo ka sinak kha ka thanhpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hneksak law ka hlathlai cikcek tuah, Maw Bawipa, ka lung duhnak le ruahnak hi zoh tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak nih lam a ka hmuhsak i zumhawktlak na sinak nih a ka hruai zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlen hmangmi kha ka kom hna lo i mihrokhrawl zong kha ka kom hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miṭhalo bu kha ka huat hna i ṭhat lonak a tuahmi kha ka hrial hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka sual lo langhnak caah ka kha kaa ṭawl i nangmah biak awkah na biakṭheng velchum ah kaa chawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lunglawmhnak hla kha ka sa i khuaruahhar thil na tuahmi vialte kha ka chim hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, na umnak inn kha ka tlaihchan i na sunparnak a umnak hmun kha ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misual hna sinah ka thah chih hlah, lainawngmi hna sinah ka hlonh chih hlah —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />annih cu ṭhat lonak kha zungzal in a tuah i nawhthuh pek aa tim zungzalmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei tu cu ahmaanmi thil kha ka tuah; ka zaangfah law ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Him tein hmun rawn ah ka dir i zapi pumhnak ah Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat!
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka ceunak le ka khamhnak a si; ahohmanh ka ṭih hna lai lo. Bawipa cu a ka hupphengtu ralhruang a si, ka thin a phang lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih an ka doh i thah an ka zalh tikah, an ril tawn i an tlu tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ralkapbu nganpi nih ka kulh hna hmanh seh law ka thin a phang lai lo; ka ral nih ka doh hna hmanh seh law Pathian cu kaa bochan ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu thil pakhat ka hal, ka duhmi thil cu pakhat lawnglawng a si ko; cucu ka nun chung vialte Bawipa inn chung i um le a ṭhatnak kha khuaruahhar in zoh le amah kha lam ka hruai tuah tiin hal cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harnak caan ah him tein a thla tangah a ka dorter; a biakinn chungah him tein a ka chiah i a sangmi lungpi cungah a ka chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah ka velchum i a ummi ka ral cu ka tei hna lai. Lunglawmhnak au thawng he a biakinn chungah ka raithawinak cu ka pekchanh lai; hla ka sa lai i Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat lai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah kan auh tikah ka bia ka theihpiak tuah, ka zaangfah law kan halnak cu ka let tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka sinah ra tuah,” tiah na ti. Bawipa, na sinah ka ra lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />keimah cu ka thuhtak sawh hlah. Ka cungah na thinhung hlah, na sal hi ka ṭhawl sawh hlah. Maw Pathian, ka Khamhtu, nangmah cu a ka bawmtu na si, ka kaltak hlah, ka chia ta sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu le ka pa hmanh nih khin hei ka hlaw hna seh law, Bawipa nih cun a ka zohkhenh ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka ral an um caah hin, a himmi lam in ka kalpi law na duhnak kha ka cawnpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lih le hro in a ka tlerh lengmangmi ka ral hna lakah hin ka chia ta hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mi hna cung i Bawipa a ṭhatnak hi ka hmuh hrimhrim lai tiah ka zumh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu i bochan u! Zumhnak ngei u, nan lung dong hlah u! Bawipa cu i bochan ko u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah cu kan auh, ka himnak lungpi, ka aunak cu ka theihpiak tuah. Na ka leh lo ahcun mithi khua i a kalmi hna bantuk ka si ve sual lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah bawmhhal awkah ka au i na biakinn thiang lei hoih in ka kut ka hler tikah ka aunak kha ka theihpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna, thil ṭhalo a tuahtu hna sinah khan sual ka phaw hlah — annih cu a bia a thlum ṭung i an lungthin vial huatnak in a khatmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An tuahmi thil ruangah khan dantat hna, thil ṭhalo an tuahmi vialte ruangah khan, dantat hna. An rianṭuanning in lehrul ko hna hmuh awk an i tlakmi kha pe ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil kha zeihmanh ah an rel lo i a sermi thil zong kha zeihmanh ah an rel lo; cucaah dan a tat hna lai i zungzal in a hrawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u; bawmh hal in ka aunak kha a theih cang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa nih a ka huh i a ka phenh; amah cu kaa bochan ko. A ka bawmh i kaa lawm, cucaah amah thangṭhatnak hla ka sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi kha a huhphenh hna; a thimmi a siangpahrang kha a chanh i a khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mi cu khamh ko hna, Maw Bawipa ; nangmah ta a simi cu thluachuah pe ko hna. An tuukhal si law zungzal in veng ko hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nannih pathian hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u; a sunparnak le a lianhngannak cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa min sunglawi cu thangṭhat u, A Thiangmi Bawipa cu a langh tikah a hmaiah kun u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa aw cu rili cungah a thang, a sunglawimi Pathian cu khuari bantukin a ri i a aw cu rili cungah khan a thang dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa aw cu a than khawh chung le a ṭhawn khawh chungin a thang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa aw nih cun sidar thing kha a khiah dih hna, Lebanon tlang sidar hmanh kha a khiah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lebanon tlang cu cawfa bantukin a pehter hna i Hermon Tlang cu fungtum no bantukin a choiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa aw nih ṭek kha a tlakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A aw nih thetse ram kha a hninh hna, Kadesh thetse ram kha a hninh in a hninh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u,” tiin a biakinn chungah an au lioah, Bawipa aw nih cun sakhi kha fa a hrinter hna i thingkung kha an hnah vialte a choih dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rili thuk pipi kha Bawipa nih a uk hna, siangpahrang bantukin zungzal in a uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi cu thazang a pek hna i thluachuah daihnak a pek hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah nih na ka khamh i ka ral kha ka cungah diriam in na umter hna lo caah kan thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa, ka Pathian, nangmah sinah bawmhnak hal in ka au i na ka damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mithikhua in na ka kirter ṭhan. Khor Thukpi chung i a vung kalmi hna sinah kaa tel ve nain, ka nunnak cu na ka pek ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nannih a mithiang hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u; A Thiangmi Pathian nih a tuahmi kha philh hlah u law amah kha lawm u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thinhun cu caan tawite chung lawng a si; a ṭhatnak tu nih cun chantlung a nguh. Zan ah mitthli tlaknak um hmanh seh law zinglei ah cun lawmhnak a ra ṭhan ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Him tein ka um kha ka hngalh i “Ahohmanh nih an ka tei bal lai lo,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa, ka cungah na ṭha ko; tlang cungah a ummi ralhruang a him bantukin him tein na ka umter. Sihmanhsehlaw na ka thuhtak tikah ṭihnak in ka khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu kan auh, a bawm ko sawh, tiah kan nawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thihnak cun zei ṭhatnak dah a chuak lai? Thlan i ka va kalnak cun zei miaknak dah a chuak lai? Mithi nih an in thangṭhat khawh maw? A dong lomi na ṭhatnak cu an chim khawh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, Ka bia cu ka theihpiak law ka zaangfah tuah! Bawipa, ka bawm tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngaihchiatnak cu lunglawmh lamnak ah na ka thlenpiak cang, ka mithi ngaihnak puan cu na ka lakpiak i lunglawmhnak puan kha na ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah dai tein ka um lai lo; nangmah cu kan thangṭhat ko lai. Bawipa, nangmah cu ka Pathian na si, a zungzal in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himnak hmuh duh ah kan fuh, Maw Bawipa, ka sunghter sawh hlah. Nangmah cu a dingmi Pathian na si, ka khamh ko sawh, tiah kan nawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak law ka khamh ko sawh; ka himnak lungpi si law ka khamhnak ding caah a fekmi ralhau si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka lungpi le ka ralhruang na si, bia na ka kamh bangkhan lam ka hmuhsak law ka hruai tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ka chiahhnawhmi rap khan ka veng ko; nangmah cu ka himnak hmun na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah kut chungah ka thlarau ka chiah, Bawipa, nangmah nih na ka khamh lai, nang cu zumhawktlakmi Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siasal santlailo a biami cu na huat hna, asinain kei cu nangmah kha kan bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak ruangah ka lung aa lawm lai i ka tha a nuam lai. Ka temhinnak kha na hmuh i ka harnak kha na hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ral hna kut chungah na ka phakter lo, himte tu in na ka zohkhenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Harnak chung i ka um caah, Maw Pathian ka zaangfah ko; ka ṭah tuknak ah ka mit zong a phing dih i ka tha zong a dih cikcek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nun chung kum hna cu ngaihchiatnak in a liam i hrum ainak in an khat, Harnak tam tuk ka inmi ruangah ka thazang cu a lo dih i ka ruh hna cu an rop thluahmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ral nih capo ah an ka saih, ka innpa nih an ka nihsawh; a ka hngalmi nih an ka ṭih i lam i an ka hmuh tikah an ka lektak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rak thi cang ning law cu bang, mi vialte nih an ka philh i hlonhmi thil bantuk ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ral tampi nih a thli tein an ka congoih, ṭihnak nih a dum in a ka dum. ka loh nakhnga ding khua kha an khan i keimah thahnak ding khua kha an ruat lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kaa bochanmi cu nangmah na si, maw Bawipa ; nangmah cu ka Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka caan cu na kut chungah a um dih, ka ral hna kut chungin ka khamh law a ka hremtu hna kut chungin ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei cu na sal ka si, ka cungah zaangfahnak ngei ko; a fekmi na dawtnak ruangah ka khamh tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah kha kan auh; ka sunghter sawh hlah! Miṭhalo cu sung hna seh, mithikhua ah dai tein um hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lihchimmi kha daihter hna — annih cu miporhlaw, miruamkai, bia songpuam in miding mi kong ceih a hmangmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmah an ṭihtu hna caah na chiahmi thil ṭha cu zeitluk in dah khuaruahhar an si. Mi kip hmuh ah na tuahmi thil ṭha cu zeitluk in dah khuaruahhar a si, nangmah an bochanmi cu na huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi nih thah an timh hna caah na thlam chungah khan na thuh hna i an ral pawl nih an nihsawh khawh hna nakhnga lo na thla tangah na chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u! Ka ral nih an ka kulh i an ka tuk tikah a dawtnak cu khuaruahhar in ka cungah a langhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka thin a phang i na sinah umter ti loin na ka dawi cang rua tiah ka ruah. Sihmanhsehlaw nangmah sinah bawmhnak hal in ka au tikah ka aunak kha na rak theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nannih a mithiang vialte hna, Bawipa cu daw ko u! Bawipa nih zumhawktlakmi cu a huhphenh hna, sihmanhsehlaw miporhlaw cu fak piin dan a tat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa cungah a ruahchannak a chiami vialte hna, lungṭhawng le thazang ṭhawng in um ko u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A sualnak ngaihthiam a si i a palhnak maimilh a simi cu a lung aa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih, sual a phawt lomi le a lung chungah hlennak a ngei lomi cu a lung aa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sualnak kha ka phuan hna lo tikah chun nitlak in ka ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, chunzan in dan na ka tat i ka thazang cu a dihlak in a zor, ṭhal ni lin nih khua a roter bantuk khin ka thazang cu a ro dih. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khi tikah ka sualnak cu nangmah sinah ka phuan hna; ṭhat lonak ka tuahmi cu ka thup hna lo. Nangmah sinah khan ka phuan dih hna i ka nawlbuarnak vialte cu na ka ngaihthiam dih. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah zumhawktlak a simi vialte hna nih cun, herhnak caan an ton tikah na sinah thla an cam awk a si; tilian a tlun tikah a phan hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah cu kaa thuhnak hmun na si, harnak chungin na ka khamh lai. Nangmah nih na ka huhphenh caah fak piin na khamhnak cu hla in ka thangṭhat. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih, “Na zulh awk hnga lam kha kan hmuhsak lai, kan cawnpiak lai i lungthin kan cheuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na duhnak zulhter awkah chak le kaahlawmh a haumi rang le laa bantukin hrut hlah,” a ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih cun temhnak an in a hau ko lai, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa aa bochanmi cu a dawtnak fek nih khan a huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil ruangah, miding vialte hna, i lawm u law thanuam in um tuah u. Amah a nawl a zulmi vialte hna, lunglawm in au tuah u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miding vialte hna, Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil ruangah i lawm tuah u; amah a nawl a zulmi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tingtang in Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u, hri hra ngeimi tingtang in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla thar in thangṭhat u, dawh ngaiin hri hra tingtang cu tum u law fak piin hla sa u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa bia cu biatak an si, a ṭuanmi rian cu zumhawktlak an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih dinnak le ṭhatnak cu a duh; vawlei cu a fekmi a dawtnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa nih a nawlbia in van khi a ser hna, ni le thlapa le arfi khi a bia in a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rili vialte kha hmunkhat ah a pumh hna; a thukmi rilipi cu thil khonnak inn chungah a khumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawlei vialte, Bawipa cu ṭih tuah; vawleicung mi vialte hna, Bawipa cu ṭih tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bia a chim i vawlei cu a hung um, nawl a pek i zeizong vialte an hung chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun dang nih tuah an i timhmi kha Bawipa nih pakpalawng ah a canter i tling kho loin a umter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw amah khuakhanmi cu zungzal in a hmun i amah timhmi cu zungzal in a fek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An Pathian ah Bawipa a simi miphun cu lunglawmmi miphun an si, Bawipa nih a mi ah a thimmi hna cu lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa nih vancung khin a run kan zoh i minung vialte hi a kan hmuh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A uknak hmun khin a run kan zoh i vawleicung mi vialte hi a kan hmuh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan ruahnak vialte hi amah sermi an si dih i kan tuahmi vialte cu a hngalh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih a ral a tei hna cu ralkapbu ṭhawngmi a ngeih caah a si lo ralkap nih a ral a tei cu a thazang a ṭhawn caah a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ral teinak caah ral tuknak rang hi san an tlai lo. a nganmi an ṭhawnnak nih a khamh kho hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa nih amah a ṭihmi cu a zohkhenh hna i a fekmi a dawtnak aa bochanmi cu him tein a umter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thihnak chungin a khamh hna i mangṭam tlun caan ah a nunter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan i bochan, amah cu a kan bawmtu le kan phaw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah thawngin kan lung aa lawm i a min thiang cu kan i bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah cu kan in bochan caah, a fekmi na dawtnak cu kan sinah um ko seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu a zungzal in ka lawmh lai, amah thangṭhat cu a ngol in ka ngol lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tuahmi thil ruangah khan ka thangṭhat lai; hremnak a ingmi nih thei u law i lawm tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa lianhngannak cu chim ṭi u si law a min cu thangṭhat ti u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa sinah cun thla ka cam i a ka leh; ka ṭihmi thil vialte in a ka luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hremnak a ingmi nih amah cu an zoh, zeitikhmanh ah a deuh hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Santlai lomi nih amah cu an auh i a leh hna; an harnak chungin a khamh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihmi cu a vancungmi nih khan an zoh hna i ṭihnak chungin an luatter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa hi zeitluk in dah a ṭhat ti kha nanmah tein va kawl cio hmanh u, amah chungah him tein a ummi cu a lung aa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mi vialte hna, Bawipa cu ṭih tuah u, amah a ṭihmi nih cun an herhmi thil vialte kha an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chiandeih hmanh hi rawl hmu loin an um tawn i rawlṭam in an vak tawn, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nawl a zulmi cu zeihmanh an baumi a um bal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hawile mino hna, ra u law, ka bia ngai tuah u; Bawipa ṭihzah ning cu kan cawnpiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nun nuam tein nun le chan saupi le lunglawm in nun cu nan duh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan duh ahcun, bia ṭhalo chim kha i sum u, lih kha chim hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak kha hrial u law ṭhatnak kha tuah u; daihnak kha duh u law nan hmuh khawh nakhnga fak piin i zuam u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A dingmi cu Bawipa nih a zohkhenh hna i an aunak kha a theih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw ṭhat lonak a tuahmi kha cu a ral hna i cucaah anmah mi lila hmanh nih khan an philh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Miding mi nih cun Bawipa kha an auh i an bia kha a ngaihpiak hna, an harnak chungin a chuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lung a dongmi kha Bawipa nih a umpi hna i ruahchannak a ngei lomi kha a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Miṭha nih harnak tampi a in tawn, sihmanhsehlaw harnak a inmi chung khan Bawipa nih a khamh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa nih him tein a zohkhenh i a ruh pakhat hmanh a kiak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu ṭhat lonak nih a thah hna lai, miding mi a huami hna cu dantatnak an ing lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa nih a sal cu a khamh hna lai; amah tangah aa dormi cu him tein an um lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ka dohmi kha do ve hna law a ka tumi kha tu ve hna, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na phaw le na ralthuam in i thuam law keimah bawmh ah i thawh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ka dawitu hna kha na fei le na hreitlung in rak kham hna. Ka Khamhtu na si kha nangmah nih keimah cu ka hngalhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thah a ka zalmi kha sung hna seh law ningzahnak phan hna seh. Keimah thah awkah khua a khangmi hna kha an khuakhanmi cu pakpalawng ah cang seh law
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />thli nih a choihmi capawl bantuk si hna seh, Bawipa vancungmi nih a dawimi bantuk si hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An lam cu mui in nal seh law Bawipa vancungmi nih cun deng len hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sullam zeihmanh um loin keimah foihnak ding caah rap an chiah i keimah tlaknak ding caah khor thukpi an cawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain anmah nih an hngalh hlanah rawhnak nih a phanh hna lai i anmah chiahmi rap ah khan an i foih lai, anmah cawhmi khor ah khan an tla lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cu tikah Bawipa ruangah cun kei cu kaa lawm lai i a ka khamh caah ka tha a nuam lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungthin dihlak in Bawipa cu ka thawh lai i, “Nangmah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo! A dermi kha a ṭhawngmi hna kut chungin na huhphenh hna i sifakmi le retheimi kha mi hrem mi hrem hmangmi hna kut chungin na khamh hna,” ka ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih sual an ka phawt i ka hngalh hrimhrim lomi sualnak kha an ka puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhatnak cu chiatnak in an ka lehrulh i ka hnabei a dong cikcek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw annih an zawt tu ah cun ngaihchiatnak thuam kaa hruk i rawl hmanh ka ei lo; ka hawikom ca le ka unau caah lu fakpi khun in thla ka cam tawn bantukin, annih ca zongah cun ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nu thih a ngaimi bantukin lukhun le ngaihchia in kaa chawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harnak ka ton tikah an i lawm i an ka dum i nihchuak ah an ka saih; khuai nih khan heh tiah ngol loin an ka tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Harnak kha an ka phakter i an ka nihsawh, an hacang lawng an ka rialhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa, zei can dah na zoh ko rih hna lai? An kut chungin ka chuah law hi chiandeih hna kut chung hin ka nunnak khamh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun mizapi pumhnak ah kan lawmh lai i mizapi hmaiah cun kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khi milihchim hna, ka ral hna khi, ka sungh ruangah an di riamhter hna hlah; sullam um loin a ka huami hna khi ka ngaihchiatnak an hmuh ruangah mit diriam in umter hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hawikom bantukin bia an chim lo, daihnak a duhmi hna kha lih a phunphun an puh lehlam hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Annih nih an au i, “Na tuahmi kha kan hmuh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa, nangmah nih hihi cu na hmuh cangmi a si. Cucaah dai tein um hlah, Maw Bawipa ; lamhlatpi ah um sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa, i hlau law ka chanh tuah; ka Pathian, tho law ka bia ka chimpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa, nang cu na ding, cucaah misual lo ka si kha ka thanhpiak tuah; ka Pathian, ka ral cu ka cungah diriam in umter hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A cungah tlung seh, ti kan duhmi te kha a cungah a tlung cang,” titer hna hlah. “Amah cu kan tei diam cang,” titer hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka nganfah innak i a di a riammi kha sung cikcek hna seh law khuaruahhar vansang au in um hna seh; amah nakin kan ṭha deuh aa timi kha ningzahnak le hmaichiatnak nih zual hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka luat caah a lung aa lawmmi cu lawmhnak in au hna seh law, “ Bawipa cu a lianngan ko, a sal nih hlawhtlinnak a hmuh i amah cu a lawmhpi,” tiah chim lengmang hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun na dinnak kha ka thanh lai i chun nitlak in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sualnak nih miṭhalo cu a lungchung thukpi ah bia a chimh i Pathian kha a hlawt i a ṭih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah le amah sang tuk i aa ruah caah cun Pathian nih ka sualnak kha a hmu lai lo i sual a ka phaw lai lo tiah a ruah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kaa chuak bia cu bia ṭha lo le lih lawng an si i mifim si i thil ṭha tuah kha a ngol cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ihkhun cung i a zau lio hmanh ah thil ṭha lo lawng kha a tuak, a tuahmi kha thil ṭha a um lo i thil ṭha lo kha a hua hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, a fekmi na dawtnak cu van a tawng i zumhawktlak na sinak cu van a phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na dinnak cu tlang nganpi bantukin a fek i na biakhiahnak cu rilipi bantukin a thuk. Bawipa, nangmah nih minung le saram cu na zohkhenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, zeitluk in dah na dawtnak hi a sun! Na thla tangah mi nih dornak an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na inn in a chuakmi rawl kha duhdim tein an ei i na ṭhatnak tiva chung khan ti na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang cu nunnak vialte hram na si; nangmah ceunak thawngin kannih nih ceunak kha kan hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah an hngalmi kha daw zungzal ko hna law a dingmi cungah khan ṭhatnak tuah zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miruamkai nih khan ka tu hna hlah seh, miṭhalo nih khan ka zamter hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miṭhalo an rilhnak kha zohhmanh! Khika ah khin an ril, an tho kho ti lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna ruangah awlokchong in um hlah, ṭhat lonak a tuahmi kha hngar hna hlah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a romi ramkung bantukin an lo lai i belhhring bantukin an uai lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu i bochan u law ṭhatnak kha tuah u; ram chungah hin um u law him tein khuasa u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa kha i bochan u law nan lungthli tum kha an pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nunnak kha Bawipa pe tuah, amah kha i bochan law amah nih an bawmh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhatnak kha ceunak bantukin a ceuter lai i na dinnak kha chunlai bantukin a ceuter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa hmaiah cun dai tein um ko law zeidah a tuah lai ti kha lungsau in hngak ko; thil ṭhalo an i tinhmi a tuah kho lengmangmi hna le an rian ṭuannak ah a hlawh a tlingmi hna kong ah zei poi loin va um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinhung in um hlah u, hrut sual hlah u! Lung rethei in um hlah u! Cu nih cun zeihmanh an ṭhathnem hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa aa bochanmi cu him tein ram chungah hin an um ko lai; sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu ṭhawl an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Luklak ah miṭhalo cu an lo ko lai, na kawl hna hmanh ah na hmu kho hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw mi toiah aa dormi cu ram chungah hin him tein an um lai i daihnak kha tlamtling tein an hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih miṭha hrawhnak ding khua kha a khan i a hacang a rialhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih cun miṭhalopa cu a nihsawh men ko, zeicahtiah luklak ah a rawh lai kha a hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih cun an nam kha an i zuh i an likuk kha an i hruai i sifak le retheimi kha thah le miṭha mi nawn kha an duh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw anmah nam lila nih an keng ah a chunh hna lai i an likuk cu an kiak dih lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miṭha nih a ngeihmi thil tlawmte cu miṭhalo nih a khonmi thil tampi nakin a ṭha deuh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />zeicahtiah miṭhalopa cu Bawipa nih a thazang a chuh lai i miṭha cu a huhphenh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa nih a nawl a zulmi cu a zohkhenh hna i ram cu anmah ta a si zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Caan ṭhalo a tlun tikah sifah an ing lai lo, mangṭam a tlun tikah ei awk a za an ngei lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu an thi lai; Bawipa ral cu ramlak pangpar bantuk in an lo lai; meikhu bantukin an ṭian lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih cun thil a cawi hna tikah a cham ṭhan ti hna lo, sihmanhsehlaw miṭha cu vel a ngei i nun a siang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa nih thluachuah a pekmi cu ram ram chungah hin him tein an um lai, sihmanhsehlaw chiat a serhmi cu ṭhawl an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minung hi a kalnak ding lam a hmuhsaktu cu Bawipa a si, Amah duhnak a tuahmi cu a huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tluk sual zongah a ril lan lo, zeicahtiah Bawipa nih a kut in a thawh ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka rak no i atu cu ka tar cang, asinain hi vialte chungah hin miṭha cu Bawipa nih a hlawt kha ka hmu bal lo i a fale zong rawl hal in an vah kha ka hmu bal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siang tein mi kha a pek zungzal hna i a coih zungzal hna, cun a fale kha thluachuahnak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak kha mertak u law ṭhatnak kha tuah u; cun hi ram chungah hin nan um zungzal lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />zeicahtiah a hmaanmi thil kha Bawipa nih a duh i zumhtlak a simi a mi kha a kaltak bal hna lo. Annih cu a huhphenh zungzal hna, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo mi hna an tefa cu ṭhawl an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A dingmi cu ram chungah him tein an um lai i ram cu zungzal in anmah ta a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mifim nih cun fimnak bia an chim i ahmaanmi bia kha an ka in a chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A Pathian nawlbia kha a lung chungah aa chiah i zeitikhmanh ah a kaltak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih cun miṭha kha aa ngiat aa ngiat i thah a zalh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih a ral kut chungah khan miṭha cu a kaltak lo, tazacuai a si zongah khan sual phawtnak a phakter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa cu i bochan u law a nawl kha zul tuah u; ram kha co awkah thazang an pek hna lai i miṭhalo cu pawnchuah an si kha nan hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Miṭhalopa pakhat, mipuarhrang ngai a si i Lebanon sidar thingkung bantukin mi vialte a iap dih hna kha ka rak hmuh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw tlawmpal ah khin cuka ah cun ka va kal ṭhan i cu pa cu a rak um ti lo; ka kawl len nain ka hmu kho ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Miṭha khi zohhmanh u, miding khi zohhmanh u; daihnak mi cu tefa an ngei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw misual cu hrawh an si dih, an tefa cu hloh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bawipa nih miding cu a khamh hna i harnak caan ah a huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A bawmh hna i a chuah hna; annih nih huhphenhnak hmuh awkah an fuh caah miṭhalo hna kut chung khan a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, na thinhung hlah law, ka si hlah. Na thinhun in dan ka tat hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan cu na ka tat cang i na ka hrem cang; na ka tuk cikcek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thin a hun caah ṭhalo tein ka zaw; ka sual ruangah ka pum cu a dihlak in a zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sualnak tilet chungah ka pil i ka sualnak cu an rih caah tangah an ka hnuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hruh caah ka hma cu a thu i a man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka keng zong a kul dih i ka ril ko; chun nitlak ngaihchia in ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tak cu fak piin a lin i zual ngaiin ka zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tha a dih cikcek i ka ril ko, lungrethei le sivang in ka hram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa, ka duhmi cu na hngalh; ka hramnak vialte cu na theih dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lung a tor, ka tha a dih i ka mit a maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hma le ka rung ruangah, ka hawi le ka innpa nih a naih hmanh an ka duh lo; ka chungkhat hmanh nih an ka hrial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thah a ka duhmi nih rap an ka chiahhnawh i ka cungah fahnak tlunter a duhmi nih khan, kan in hloh cang lai, tiah an ka tlerh; keimah hrawhnak ding kha chun nitlak in an tim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnachet bantuk ka si i khua ka thei kho lo, holh aa bantuk ka si i ka holh kho lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khua a theih lo ca i an chawnh tikah zeihmanh a let kho lomi hna bantuk ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah kha kan bochan; Bawipa ka Pathian, nangmah nih na ka leh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Harnak ka in ruangah ka ral hna hi diriam in umter hna hlah, ka tluk hi an i porhlawtnak ah canter hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tlu dengmang i ka nganfahnak nih hin a ka tlaih peng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu ka phuan hna. asinain lungrethei in ka um ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ral cu ngandam le thazang ṭhawng in an um ṭung; sullam um loin a ka huami an tam tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahmaanmi thil kha tuah kaa zuam caah ṭhatnak cu chiatnak in a lehrulmi pawl nih khan an ka doh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa, ka hlawt sawh hlah, ka Pathian, ka kaltak sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa ka khamhtu, atu ah ka bawm ko!
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka tuahmi ah khan kaa ralring lai ka lei kha sualnak ka tuahter lai lo; miṭhalo kha lamnai i an um lioah zeihmanh ka chim lai lo,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Holh loin ka um i bia pakhat hmanh ka chim lo, a ṭhami thil kong hmanh ka chim lo. Sihmanhsehlaw ka nganfah cu a karh chin i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka lungthin cu khuaruahharnak in a khat. Ka ruah deuh paoh ah ka lungretheihnak kha a zual chin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Bawipa, zei can dah ka nun rih lai? Zei tikah dah ka thih lai? Zeitluk tuan ah dah ka nunnak hi a dongh lai ka chim tuah,” ti hi hal loin ka um kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi zabok can men ah na ser! Nang na mit ah cun ka nun chung hi zei karlote bantuk a si ko. Minung hi voi khat thaw chem tluk men an si dih taktak ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thlahawm menmen an si ko. An tuahmi vialte hi pakpalawng an si dih; chaw le va kha heh tiah an khon, sihmanhsehlaw a cotu ding cu aho an si kha an hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu ti a si caah cun, Bawipa, zeidah kaa ruahchan khawhmi a um? Nangmah lawnglawng hi kaa ruahchanmi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sualnak vialte chung hin ka khamh law mihrut nih capo ah ka sai ti hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi tlukin nganfahnak na ka inter caah dai tein ka um lai i bia pakhat hmanh ka chim lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dan cu ka tat ti sawh hlah, na dantatnak in ka thi dengmang cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minung cu a sualnak kha dantat awkah na sik tikah. a iang vialte kha a lo dih, minung hi thaw menmen a si taktak ko. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak tuah, kan nawlnak cu ka ngaihpiak ko; nangmah kan auh tikah dai tein ka umtak hlah. Ka pupa vialte hna bantukin, kei cu caan tawite chung lawng na khualpa cu ka si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlan mual ka liam i ka um ti lo hlanah hin lunglawmhnak tlawmpalte tal ka hmuh nakhnga hnahnawk lo tein run ka umter ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa bawmhnak cu ka hngak lengmang i a donghnak ah ka aunak cu a ngaih i a theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭih a nungmi khor chung khan a ka chuah. nawncek khor chung khan a ka chuah Him tein lungpi cungah khan a ka ṭhutter i fek tein a ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla thar kha a ka cawnpiak, ka Pathian thangṭhatnak hla kha a ka cawnpiak. Hi thil cu mi tampi nih an hmuh lai i Bawipa kha an i bochan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa kha aa bochan i siasal leiah aa mer lo i pathian taktak a si lomi a biami hna sinah aa fon lomi cu lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, nangmah nih kan caah thil tampi na tuah; nangmah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo. Nangmah nih lam ṭhaṭha tampi khua na kan khanpiak. An dihlak in chim i tim ning law a chim hmanh ka chim cawk hna hnga lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Raithawinak le pekchanhmi thil hi na duhmi an si lo, biakṭheng cungah a pum in khanghmi thawinak sa hi na kan halmi a si lo, kan sualnak thianhnak ca i raithawinak tuah zong hi na kan halmi an si lo, asinain nangmah nih khan na bia kan theih khawh nakhnga ding caah hna tu kha na kan pek i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cucaah cun, “Hika ah hin ka um ko; keimah cawnpiaknak ding caah na chiahmi cu Nawlbia cauk chungah an um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka Pathian, zeitluk in dah na duhnak tuah cu ka duh! Na cawnpiaknak cu ka lung chungah kaa chiah hna,” tiah kan leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa na mi an i pumhnak ah, na kan khamhnak thawng ṭha kha ka chim. A chim cu a ngol in ka ngol bal lai lo, ti kha na hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khamhnak thawngṭha hi keimah ca lawngah kaa chiah bal lo, zumhawktlak na sinak le na kan bawmhnak hi ka chim zungzal. Na dawtnak a fekmi le zumhawktlak na sinak hi na mi vialte an i pumhnak ah chim loin ka um bal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa, ka cungah na zaangfahnak a dong lai lo ti kha ka hngalh. Na dawtnak le zumhawktlak na sinak nih him tein an ka umter zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Harnak tam tuk nih an ka dum — a rel in rel cawk an si lo. Ka sualnak nih a ka phak cang i khua ka hmu kho ti lo; ka lu cung sam nakin ka sualnak cu an tam deuh, ka lung ṭhawnnak a dih cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, ka khamh ko sawh, atu ah ka bawm ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thah a ka zalmi kha sung cikcek hna seh law i tuai dih hna seh. Harnak ka inmi ruangah aa lawmmi cu an hnulei ah i let hna seh law ningzak in um hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ka nihsawhtu pawl kha an sunghnak nih khan lungdong cikcek in umter hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmah sinah a rami vialte cu lunglawm le thanuam in um hna seh. Na khamhnak a duhmi vialte nih, “ Bawipa cu a lianngan hringhran ko,” ti zungzal hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei cu ka si a fak i ka re a thei, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa, nangmah nih na ka ruah ko. Nangmah cu ka Khamhtu le a ka Bawmtu na si — rau sawh hlah, Maw ka Pathian!
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sifak zawn a ruatmi cu lunglawmmi a si, harnak chung i a um tikah Bawipa nih a bawmh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih a huhphenh lai i a nunnak kha a zuah lai; ram chungah lunglawm in a umter lai i a ral hna kut chungah a kaltak lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zawt tikah Bawipa nih a bawmh lai i a damter ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangmah cungah ka sual cang, Bawipa ; ka zaangfah law ka damter ko,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral nih an ka congoih. An i thawh i, “Zeitik dah a thih lai i philh a si lai,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah zoh i a rami kha lung thiang in an ra lo, ka thangchiatnak lawng kha an hlat i an chuah tikah a kenkip ah an chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ka huami nih khan a thli tein an ka congoih, ka ca i a ṭha lo bik ding kha an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An i thawh i, “A zawt a zual ko, a ihkhun in a tho bal ti lai lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hawi ṭha bik, ka zumh bikmi, rawl a ka hrawng lengmangmi hmanh kha ka ral ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa, ka zaangfah law damnak ka pe ṭhan ko; cun ka ral cu teirul ka cham ṭhan hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cu tikah ka cungah na lung aa lawm ti le ka ral nih an ka tei lai lo ti kha ka hngalh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahmaanmi kha ka tuah caah na ka bawmh lai; na hmaika ah a zungzal in na ka umter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, Israel Pathian cu thangṭhat u sih! Atu le a zungzal in thangṭhat u sih? Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sazuk nih rial tidai a ngaih bantukin Maw Pathian nangmah cu kan ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw a nungmi Pathian, nangmah cu tihal in kan hal; zeitik ah dah na umnak ah ka hun khawh lai i kan biak khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chun nitlak zan khuadei in ka ṭap i ka mitthli lawng kha ka rawl cu a si ko; ka ral nih, “Na Pathian cu khuazei ah dah a si kun?” tiah atu le atu an ka ti lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlanlio kong kha ka ruah tikah ka lung a leng; Pathian inn i mi zapi he kan rak kal i kan kal tikah keimah i ka rak hrui hna i Pathian thangṭhat in lunglawm le thanuam in hla kan rak sak i kan rak au kha ka ruah tikah ka lung a leng hringhran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeicahdah ka ngaih a chiat? Zeicahdah ka lungre a theih? Pathian cu kaa bochan ṭhan lai i ka Khamhtu le ka Pathian cu ka thangṭhat ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungre a thei, cucaah cun amah cu ka hngalh ṭhan; kaa thuhnak Jordan tiva hrawn, Hermon Tlang le Mizar tlang pawngah amah cu ka hngalh ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tithuk nih tithuk kha a chawnh; Pathian tisor cu a huk in an huk! Annih cu ka nunnak a leh chihtu ngaihchiatnak tilet an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih a dawtnak fek cu nifa kan sinah langhter ko seh! Amah cu zan fate in hla in thangṭhat ning law ka nunnak a ka pe ṭhantu Pathian sinah cun thlacam ko ning.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ka lungpi cu ka thawh i, “Zeicahdah na ka philh? Ka ral nih an ka hremnak hi zeicahdah ka in zungzal ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ka nihsawhnak nih a ka hrilh cang, annih nih, ‘Khuazei ah dah na Pathian cu a um kun?’ tiah an ka ti chih lengmang,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zeicahdah ka ngaih a chiat? Zeicahdah ka lungre a theih? Pathian cu kaa bochan ṭhan lai i ka Khamhtu le ka Pathian cu ka thangṭhat ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian, ka sual lo kha ka thanhpiak law Pathian zei i a rel lomi hna lakah hin ka bia ka chimpi tuah; lihchim hmangmi le miṭhalo hna kut chung hin ka chuah tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah cu a ka hupphengtu Pathian na si; zeicahdah na ka kaltak? Ka ral nih an ka hremnak hi zeicahdah ka in zungzal ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ceunak le na biatak cu run thlah hna law, ka hruai hna seh na tlang thiang Zion ah cun ka kalpi ṭhan hna seh law na umnak na biakinn ah cun ka hruai hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Pathian, nangmah nih lunglawmhnak le thanuamnak na ka pek caah, na biakṭheng ah cun ka hung kal lai; ka tingtang cu kaa tum lai i nangmah thangṭhatnak cu hla in ka sa lai, Maw Pathian, ka Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeicahdah ka ngaih a chiat? Zeicahdah ka lungre a theih? Pathian cu kaa bochan ṭhan lai i ka Khamhtu le ka Pathian cu ka thangṭhat ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, hlan lio pi ah na rak tuah bantukin kan pupa hna chan ah thil lianngan na tuahmi kha kan hna hrimhrim in kan theih i kan pupa hna zong nih an kan chimh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu thil lianngan na tuahmi hna cu, zeitindah nangmah hrimhrim nih hi ram chung lawkihmi kha na dawi hna i an ram ah cun na mi kha nan umter hna ti le zeitindah phundang mi cu dan na tat hna i na mi tu cu na ṭhanchoter hna, ti hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ram cu na mi nih an nam in an teimi a si lo, anmah ṭhawnnak in an teimi zong a si lo; nangmah lianhngannak le ṭhawnnak in a si i nangmah nih na dawt hna langhternak caah an sin i na umhnawh hnanak tu nih khan hi ram cu a tei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka siangpahrang le ka Pathian na si; nangmah nih na mi cu teinak na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ṭhawnnak in kan ral cu kan tei hna; nangmah nih na kan umpinak thawngin kan ral cu kan tei hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah Khamhtu dingah ka li kha kaa bochan lo i ka thal zong kaa bochan lo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw nangmah nih kan ral hna sinin na kan khamh i a kan huatu kha na kan teipiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan in thangṭhat zungzal ko lai i kan in lawmh zungzal ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw atu cu maw Pathian, na kan hlawt cang i kan ral nih khan an kan tei cang; kan ralkap hna kha na kalpi ti hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan ral hna hmaiah na kan zamter i kan thil kha an i lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuu an thah hna bantukin an kan thah i ram dang ah na kan ṭhek dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mi cu man tlawmte ah na kan zuar i cu na kan zuarnak ah cun na miakmi zeihmanh a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan cung i na tuahmi kha kan innpa nih an hmuh i an kan nihsawh i capo ah an kan saih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miphun hna lakah zahpi awk thil ah na kan ser; kanmah serhsatnak ah an lu kha an ka thinhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan ral hna le a kan huatu hna nih an ka nihsawhnak le an ka zawmhtaihnak ka theihmi ruangah hin, hmaichia in ka um zungzal i ningzahnak nih a ka khuh zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kannih nih cun kan in philh lo na le kanmah he na sermi na biakamnak kha kan rawk lo nain. hi thil vialte hi kan cungah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na sinah zumhawktlak loin kan um lo, Na nawl ngai loin kan um fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain sahrang lakah na kan kaltak i a thuk bik muihnak chungah na kan chiahtak ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian kha biak kan in ngol i ramdang pathian sinah thla kan cam a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nangmah nih na hmuh ṭheoṭheo hnga, zeicahtiah minung lungthin chung biathli cu na hngalh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain thah kan si thluangthluan cu nangmah ruangah a si i thah awk tuu bantukin tuah kan si cu nangmah ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa, i hlau tuah! Zeicahdah naa hngilh? Tho tuah, a zungzal in kan hlawt hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeicahdah na kan thuhtak? Kan inmi temhnak le harnak kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawlei ah na kan hrilh cang; leidip lakah kan ril ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tho law kan bawm tuah! A fekmi na dawtnak ruangah kan khamh tuah!
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi hla siangpahrang ka phuah ah hin, ka lungthin cu holh dawh in a khat; ka lei cu ca ṭial thiammi cafung bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa vialte lakah pa dawh bik na si, bia chim a thiam ngaingaimi na si; Pathian nih zungzal in thluachuahnak an pek!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ṭhawngmi siangpahrang, na vainam kha i bei tuah; nang cu a ṭhawngmi le a liannganmi siangpahrang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biatak le biading kha hmunhter awkah na tei tiang lianhngannak in hmailei ah kal tuah. Na ṭhawnnak nih teinak ngan pipi an hmuhpiak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thal cu an hriam i na ral cu an lung tiang a taih hna; miphun kip kha na hmaiah an tlu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian nih an pekmi bawiṭhutdan cu zungzal in a hmun lai! Na ram cu dinnak in na uk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a hmaanmi thil ṭha kha na duh i a ṭha lomi thil kha na huat. Cucaah cun Pathian, na Pathian nih khan a rak in thim i midang nakin tam deuh in lunglawmhnak kha an toih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mura zihmui le aloes zihmui le kassia zihmui in na puan cu na namter hna i vui ho in sakmi siangpahrang inn ah khan hla dawh tum thiam nih an in conglawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn i a ummi bawinu hna lakah khan siangpahrang fanu zong an um, cun na bawiṭhutdan orhlei kamah khan siangpahrang bawinu cu a dir, sui ṭha bik in sermi hlawn in aa ṭamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa i a ngaknu, ka chimmi hi ngai tuah — na mi le na rualchan kha philh ta hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naa dawh caah siangpahrang nih an duh lai, amah cu na bawi a si, a nawl kha va ngai tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tair mi nih laksawng an in put lai, mirum nih na lung tluanter an i zuam lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang fanu cu siangpahrang inn chungah cun a um — a vaa dawh hringhran dah, A puan cu sui la in an tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A puan dawh ngaimi he cun siangpahrang sinah khan an hei kalpi, a mawle nih khan an zulh i anmah zong cu siangpahrang sin tiang an kal ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lunglawm le thanuam in an ra i siangpahrang bawipa inn ah cun an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka siangpahrang bawipa, nangmah nih fapa tampi na ngeih hna lai i na pupa hna cu an hmun an rolh hna lai; nangmah nih vawlei dihlak uktu ah khan na ser hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na minthannak cu ka hla nih a nunter zungzal lai i mi kip nih zungzal thluangthluan in an in thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu kan i dornak le kan thazang a si, harnak caan ah a kan bawm zungzaltu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cucaah cun vawlei cu i hnin in tlang cu rili chungah tla hna hmanh seh law ka thin a phang lai lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />rili tilet cu tho in awn hmanh seh, tlang zong i hnin dih hna hmanh seh law ka thin a phang lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian khua, Cung Nung Bik Pathian inn thiang ah lawmhnak a ratpitu tiva pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian cu khuapi chungah cun a um i zeihmanh nih a hrawk bal lai lo; zingka tein amah bawmh awkah a ra lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun cu a ther in an ther, pennak ram cu an i hnin, Pathian aw cu a thang i vawlei cu ti ah a cang dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lian Ngan Bawipa nih a kan umpi, Jakob Pathian cu kan himnak a si. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ra law zohhmanh, Bawipa i a tuahmi hi; Zohhmanh zeitluk khuaruahhar thil hna dah leicung ah hin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi vawleicung pumpi ah ral cu a daihter dih ko hna, likuk cu a khiah hna i fei cu a hrawh dih hna, phaw hna cu mei in a khangh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Raldohnak kha ngol u” a ti hna, “Cun keimah cu Bawipa ka si hi hngal tuah u, miphun vialte hna a uktu cu ka si i, vawlei pumpi ah a ngan bikmi cu ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lianhngannak he a khatmi Bawipa cu kan sinah a um; Jakob Pathian cu kan himnak a si. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi vialte hna, lunglawm in nan zapei beng tuah u, hla dawhdawh in Pathian cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cung Nung Bik Bawipa cu ṭih awk a si, amah cu a liannganmi siangpahrang vawlei cung vialte uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi kip kha kan tangah a chiah hna i miphun hna uknak kha a kan pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan umnak ram hi amah nih a kan thimpiakmi a si; a dawtmi a mi nih kan i porhlawt ngaimi ram a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian cu a bawiṭhutdan cungah cun a hung kai; Bawipa a hung kai lioah cun lunglawmhnak au thawng le muko tum thawng a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian cu hla in thangṭhat tuah u, kan siangpahrang cu thangṭhat tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian cu vawlei cung dihlak siangpahrang a si; amah cu hla in thangṭhat tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thiangmi a bawiṭhutdan cungah Pathian cu a ṭhu, miphun kip kha a uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miphun dang hna an uktu bawi hna cu, Abraham Pathian mi hna bang khan hmunkhat ah an i pum. Ralkap vialte hna phaw cu Bawipa ta an si; amah nih zeizong vialte kha a uk dih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu a lian a ngan i fak piin thangṭhat awk a si; kan Pathian khualipi chungah le a tlang thiang cungah thangṭhat awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian tlang Zion cu a sang i aa dawh; a liannganmi siangpahrang khuapi nih vawlei cung vialte kha lawmhnak a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian cu a chungah a um caah a ralhau chungah khan himnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang kha an i pum i Zion Tlang tuk awkah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an hmuh tikah an lau i an thin a phang i an zam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭihnak le lungretheihnak nih a tlaih hna i nau nganfah a ingmi nu bantukin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian nih nichuahlei thli in lawng ngan pipi kha a hrawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Bawipa kan Pathian khualipi chungah, Pathian nih a tuahmi thil cu a theih in kan rak theih. asinain atu cu a hmuh in kan hmuh cang; khuapi cu him tein a zohkhenh zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, a fekmi na dawtnak kong kha, na biakinn chungah kan ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuazakip ah nangmah cu an in thangṭhat i na minthannak nih vawlei cung kha a cul dih. Dinnak in na uk hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion mi cu i lawm hna seh! Na biakhiahnak cu ahmaanmi an si, Judah ram chung khua ah lawmhnak um hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion tlang ah khan i chawk u law a inn sang kha rel hna u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a vampang kha ngia hna u law a ralhau kha ṭha tein zoh hna u; cu ti nan zoh i nan ngiat ahcun, nanmah nan tefa hna kha
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian cu a zungzal in kan Pathian a si i hmailei i a ra ding caan vialte ah a kan hruai lai, tiah nan chimh khawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi vialte hna, hihi thei tuah u, Khuazakip i a um mi hna, ngai tuah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a hme a ngan, a rum sifak, nan dihlak in ngai tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahmaanmi khua ka ruat lai i a fimmi bia ka chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bia thuk kha ka ruat hna lai i tingtang tum pah in a sullam kha ka fianter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral miṭhalo hna, an rumnak aa bochan i an chawva aa porhlawmi nih an ka dum tikah ka thin a phang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minung nih cun zeitikhmanh ah amah le amah aa tlan kho lo; a nunnak man kha Pathian a cham kho lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zeicahtiah minung nunnak man cu a sung tuk. A pek khawhmi cu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thlan chungin a luattertu le zungzal in a nuntertu ah a zaa bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hihi philh hlah: mifim zong mihrut bantukin an thi ve ko lai i an chaw le an va cu an fale kha an roh ve ko hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlan cu zungzal in an umnak ding hmun a si ko lai i cuka ah cun a zungzal in an um ko lai. Hmun le ram kha an rak ngei ko lai nain an chaw le an va cu midang sin i an kaltak a hau ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi cu a lianhngannak nih thihnak in a khamh kho lo; saram bantukin a thi ve ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anmah le anmah aa bochanmi, an rumnak cung i a hna a ngammi hna khi an cungah zeidah a tlung ti kha zoh hmanh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuu bantukin a thi dingin ruah an si cang i an tuukhal cu thihnak a si lai. Miding mi nih khan zinglei ah an tei hna lai i mithi hna ram ah an pum cu a thu a man lai, cuka cu an inn in aa hlatmi hmun a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu Pathian nih a ka khamh lai; thihnak ṭhawnnak chungin a ka chuah lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mizeimaw nih a rum i a chawva kha a ṭhan chin lengmang tikah, na thinphang hlah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a thih tikah zeihmanh aa phorh kho hlei lai lo, a chawva nih thlan ah an zul kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi vawleicung a nun chungah hin saduhthah in nung kho hmanh seh law khua awng a ton ruangah thangṭhatnak hmu hmanh seh law
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a thi cangmi a pupa hna sinah khan a kal ve ko lai i cuka cu zungzal in muihnak a umnak hmun a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi cu lianhngannak nih thihnak in a khamh kho lo; saram bantukin a thi ve ko lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Pathian Bawipa nih bia a chim; vawlei cu a dihlak in nichuahlei in nitlaklei tiang a auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian cu Zion in ni bangin a rung tlang, dawhnak ah a tlingmi khua chung cun a rung tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu a ra lio, sihmanhsehlaw dai tein a rat cu a si lai lo, a alh hluahmahmi mei a hmaiah khan a um i ṭih a nungmi thlichia nih a zual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mi kha bia a ceih hna i van le vawlei kha tehte ah a auh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aa thawh i, “Zumhawktlak a simi keimah sinah raithawinak in biakamnak a tuahmi ka mi hna kha ka sinah pum hna u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van nih khin, “Pathian cu a ding, amah hrimhrim kha biaceihtu a si,” tiah an chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka mi hna, ka bia ngai u law bia ka chim lai; Israel, nangmah cu fiang tein kan hngalhter lai. Pathian cu keimah hi ka si i keimah cu na Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan ka pek zungzalmi raithawinak le khanghthawinak ruangah kan sik hna a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan lo chung nan cawtum hna le nan meheh run chung meheh hna kha ka herhmi an si lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zeicahtiah ramlak i a ummi saram vialte hi keimah ta an si dih i tlang thong khat cung i a tlongmi saṭil vialte khi keimah ta an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ramlak i a ummi va vialte cu keimah ta an si i lo lak i a ummi thilnung vialte zong keimah ta an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka rawl ṭam seh law kan chim hna lai lo, zeicahtiah vawlei le a cung i a ummi thil vialte cu keimah ta an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cawtum sa cu ka ei hna maw? Meheh thi cu ka din maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian sinah lawmhnak chim cu nan raithawinak si seh law Lianngan Bik cu kan in pek lai tiah nan i kammi pekchanh awk vialte kha pechan ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harnak a phak tikah ka au u, kan khamh hna lai i nan ka thangṭhat lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian nih miṭhalo cu a thawh hna i, “Zeicahdah ka nawlbia cu nan ciah len ko? Zeicahdah ka biakamnak kong cu nan chim len ko?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan chimhhrin hna lai, ka ti tikah nan duh ṭung lo, ka nawlbia kha nan hlawt ko ṭung hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mifir nan hmuh tikah a hawi ah nan i cang i vacung pa duhmi hna he nan i kom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak bia chim kha nan i tim zungzal i lihchim kha a sum in nan i sum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanmah nan unau congoih kha nan i tim zungzal, midang sual kawl lawng kha nan duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi vialte hi nan tuah i keimah nih cun zeihmanh ka chim lo, cucaah nanmah bantuk ah nan ka ruah. Sihmanhsehlaw atu cu kan sik cang hna lai i thil kha fiang tein kan hngalhter cang hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Zei i a ka rel lomi hna, hihi ngai tuah u, nan ngaih lo ahcun kan hrawh hna lai i ahohmanh nih an in khamh kho hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lawmhnak chim hi keimah upatnak thawinak cu a si, ka nawl a ngaimi cu ka khamh hrimhrim hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian, a fekmi na dawtnak ruangah ka cungah zaangfahnak ngei ko; na zaangfahnak a ngan caah ka sualnak cu ka thianhpiak ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭhat lonak cu ka ṭawlpiak hna law ka sualnak cu ka thianhpiak ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka palhnak cu kaa hngal i ka sualnak cu kaa thei zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu, nangmah cungah, nangmah cung hrimhrim ah a si i a ṭhalo ah na ruahmi kha ka tuah. Cucaah cun bia na ka ceih tikah na hmaan ko i sual na ka phawt tikah na ding ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sual cia in hrin ka si, ka nu nih a ka pawi ah khan, misual ka si cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumhawktlak lungthin hi na duhmi a si, ka lung chung hi na fimnak in khahter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu ka hnawhpiak law ka thiang lai, ka ṭawl law hawhra nakin ka rang deuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lunglawmhnak le thanuamnak aw thawng cu ka theihter law na ka khiah i na ka hrilh cang nain ka lung aa lawm ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu na mit chinhkanh ko hna law ka ṭhat lonak vialte cu ka hnawhpiak dih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka chungah hin lungthin thar ka serpiak law a thar le zumhtlak a simi ruahnak ka chungah chia ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na umnak hmun khan ka ṭhawl hlah, na thiang thlarau kha ka lakkanh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khamhnak chungin a chuakmi lawmhnak kha ka pe ṭhan law ka lungthin cu nangmah nawl zulh duhmi ah ser ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu tikah misual mi kha na nawlbia cu ka cawnpiak hna lai i nangmah leiah an i mer ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka khamhtu, ka nunnak hi ka zuah ko sawh law, na dinnak hi lunglawm tein ka thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, biachim ka bawm law nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Raithawinak hi na duhmi an si lo, rak si hna seh law cu ka rak in pek ko hnga; na lawmhmi cu khangh thawinak zong hi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka raithawinak cu toidornak lungthin hi a si, maw Pathian, toidornak lungthin le nawl ngaimi lungthin hi na hlaw lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Pathian, Zion cu zaangfah law bawm tuah; Jerusalem kulhnak vampang cu remh ṭhan hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khi tikah ahmaanmi raithawinak le khangh thawinak hna ah cun naa lawm lai i na biakṭheng cungah cawtum cu an thawi hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi liannganpa, zeicahdah ṭhat lonak na tuahmi cu naa porhlawt? Pathian dawtnak cu a fek ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Midang hrawhnak ding caah khua na khang lengmang, na lei cu a harmi nam bantuk a si, lih lawng kha na chim ṭualmal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak kha ṭhatnak nakin na duh deuh i biatak chim nakin lih chim kha na duh deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na bia in mi fahnak pek kha na duhmi a si, nang cu milip na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cucaah Pathian nih an hrawh zungzal cang lai; an tlaih lai i na thlam chungin an chuah lai, a nungmi hna ram in an dawi lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miding nih hihi an hmuh lai i an ṭih lai, an in nihsawh lai i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Himnak hmuhnak caah Pathian aa bochan lomipa hi zohhmanh u, Pathian kha i bochan loin a rumnak pi tu kha aa bochan i a ṭhat lonak tu ah khan himnak a um, tiin a ruah,” an in ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu Pathian inn pawng i a khomi oliv kung bantuk ka si; a fekmi a dawtnak cu zungzal in kaa bochan zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na tuahmi thil ruangah kan lawmh zungzal lai; na mi hna lakah nangmah ṭhatnak kha ka chim zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihrut nih cun an i thawh i, “Pathian a um lo,” an ti. An dihlak in an thu, thil ṭhalo kha an tuah, ahmaanmi thil a tuahmi ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian nih vancung khin minung kha, Aho tal a fim i Pathian a kawlmi an um hnga maw tiin a run zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an dihlak in an pial cang, an dihlak in an chiatlei ah an i tluk; pakhat hmanh thil hmaan a tuahmi an um lo, pakhat taktak hmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian nih, “An hngal hnga lo maw? Ṭhat lonak a tuahmi hi mihrut maw an si dih ko hnga? Ka mi kha an ramh hna i cucu an i cawmnak ah an hman, ka sinah thla an cam lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian nih nan ral hna cu an ruh kha a ṭhek dih hna caah an thin a phang ngaingai lai; hmasa i an thin a rak phan tawnning bantuk sawhsawh kha si loin atu cu an thin a phang taktak lai. Annih cu a hlawt cang hna caah an sung cikcek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel khamhnak cu Zion in ra seh ti ka hei duh hringhran dah! Pathian nih a mi cu rumnak a pek ṭhan hna tikah Jakob tefa cu an lung aa lawm lai, Israel mi cu an tha a nuam lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na ṭhawnnak in ka khamh ko; na thazang in ka luatter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thlacamnak hi ka theihpiak tuah, ka chimmi bia hi ka ngaihpiak tuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi lungpuam hna cu keimah doh awkah an ra, mipuarhrang hna nih thah an ka zalh — Pathian zei i a rel lomi hna nih khan thah an ka zalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian cu a ka bawmtu a si kha ka hngalh, Bawipa cu a ka chanhtu a si kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian nih ka ral cu anmah ṭhat lonak lila khan dantat ko hna seh! Amah cu zumhawktlak a si caah a hrawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu na ṭhat caah lunglawm tein thawinak cu kan pek lai i na sinah lawmhnak ka langhter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka harnak vialte chungin na ka chuah i ka ral an sungh cu ka hmuh hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak law kan nawlnak cu ka hlonhpiak hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka bia kha ka ngaihpiak law ka let tuah; lungrethei in ka baa tuk hringhran cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ral nih an ka tlerhnak le miṭhalo nih an ka hremnak nih ka lungre an ka theihter. Ka cungah harnak an tlunter; ka cungah an thin a hung i an ka huat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lung cu ṭihnak in a khat, an ka thah sual lai ti kha ka phang tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ṭih tuk ah a ther in ka ther i ka luthlung in ka kechik tiang ka ther dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ṭhuro bangin thla cu ngei ning law ka zuang hnga i ka vaa din hnga!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lamhlapi ah khin ka zuang hnga i ramlak ah inn ka vaa sak hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlichia le ruahpi chung hin dornak hmun kha khulrang in ka hmuh ko hnga,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa, annih cu hrawk hna law an biachimmi cu tuainak ah canter; khuapi chungah ka hmuhmi thil cu zaang-ennak le i tuainak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chunzan in khuapi cu a kulhnak hau cungin an chawhhnawh lengmang; harnak le thil ṭhalo tuahnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kenkip ah rawhnak a um, a chung lam hna cu pakhat le pakhat i hremnak le hlennak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ka nihsawhtu hi ka ral si seh law cu, ka in khawh ko hnga, ka cung i tluang a khawng lentu hi a ka dohtu kha si seh law cu, a ka hmuh khawh lonak hmun ah ka thuhtak diam ko hnga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw hi bantukin ka cungah rian a ṭuantu cu ka hawi, ka rianṭuan hawi le keimah he aa naih ngaimi ka hawikom na si tikah hin a fak tuk hringhran in ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat bia ṭhaṭha kha kan rak i ruah i hawi zapi he hmunkhat ah biakinn ah kan rak kal ṭi tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ral hna cungah cun thihnak kha khulrang in tlung seh law mithi khua ah khan a nung in vung kal hna seh. An inn chung le an lung chungah ṭhat lonak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa Pathian cu ka bawm tuah tiah ka auh i a ka khamh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ainak le ka hramnak cu zing siseh, chun ah siseh, zan ah siseh, amah sinah an kai zungzal ko i ka aw cu a ka theihpiak ṭheo lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ral tampi hna he kan i tuknak hmun in him tein a ka kirpi ṭhan ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zungzal in uktu a simi Pathian nih ka bia cu a ka theihpiak lai i annih cu a sunghter hna lai; annih nih amah cu an ṭih lo caah an tuah khawhmi zeihmanh a um lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hlanlio ka hawi nih khan a hawi lila cu a tuk hna; a biakam cu a zul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chimmi bia cu thawhpat nakin a nal deuh sihmanhsehlaw a lung chungah cun huatnak a um; a bia cu chiti bantukin a nem, sihmanhsehlaw nam bantukin mi a chun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thilri cu Bawipa sinah ṭhum ta law amah nih an bawmh lai; miṭha cu zeitikhmanh ah a sunghter bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa, nangmah nih lainawng mi hna le lihchim mi hna cu vawlei tang khor thukpi ah khin an chan ṭim hlanah na thlak hna lai. Kei tu nih cun nangmah kha kan bochan lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ral nih an ka hrem thluangthluan i an ka cil lengmang caah hin Maw Pathian, ka zaangfah ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ka dohtu nih hin chun nitlak in an ka hrem i annih hi an tam hringhran ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thin a phan tikah, Maw Cungnung Bik, nangmah cu kan bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian cu kaa bochan i a biakam cu ka thangṭhat; amah cu kaa bochan i ka thin a phang lo. Minung menmen nih cun zeidah an ka ti khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ral nih cun ka tuahmi thil kip ah harnak an ka pek, zeitindah a cungah fahnak kan tlunter khawh lai ti kha an ruat zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi hmuh lonak hmun ah khan an i thup i ka tuahmi paohpaoh kha an ka ngiat dih, zeitindah kan thah khawh lai ti kha an i ruahchih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ṭhat lo ruangah cun, Maw Pathian, dantat ko hna; hi mi hna hi na thinhun in raltuknak ah cun, sunghter ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah harnak ka in kha na hngalh; ka mitthli cu na thawl chungah na rawn hna, na cauk chungah na ṭial hna a si lo mei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmah kan auh ni ah ka ral cu an kir lai, mah hi fiang tein ka hngalh — Pathian cu keimah leiah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian cu kaa bochan i a biakam cu ka thangṭhat, Bawipa biakamnak cu ka thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah cu kaa bochan i ka thin a phang lo, minung menmen nih cun zeidah an ka ti khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian, na sinah ka rak i kammi kha kan pek lai, thangṭhat thawinak cu kan pek lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />zeicahtiah nangmah nih thihnak chungin na ka chuah i ka ke kha rilhnak chungin na khamh. Cucaah Pathian hmaika ah cun kaa chawk i minung cungah a ceumi a ceunak chungah cun ka um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka zaangfah ko, Maw Pathian, ka zaangfah ko, himnak hmuh duh ah nangmah cu ka fuh. Thlichia ṭihnung a dih hlantiang, na thlazung in ka huppheng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cung Nung Bik Pathian cu ka auh, ka herhnak vialte a ka petu Pathian cu ka kawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vancung khin a run ka leh lai i a ka khamh lai; a ka dohtu kha a sunghter hna lai. Pathian nih cun a fekmi a dawtnak le zumhawktlak a sinak kha ka cungah a langhter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi seh hmang chiandeih hna lakah ka it, an ha cu fei le thal bantuk an si, an lei cu kawngthun har bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na lianhngannak cu van ah khin langhter law na sunparnak cu vawlei cung dihlak ah hin langhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ral nih keimah foihnak ah sur rap an chiah, lungretheihnak nih a ka tei; ka kalnak lam ah khor an cawh, sihmanhsehlaw anmah tu an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lung a hmun ko, maw Pathian, ka lung a fek ko; nangmah thangṭhatnak hla ka sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nunnak, i hlau tuah, ka tingtang le ka thonglawi hna, i hlau tuah u. Zinglei cu ka ṭhangh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, miphun hna lakah kan lawmh lai, mi vialte hna lakah kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak cu vancung tiang a phan, zumhawktlak na sinak cu van a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na lianhngannak cu van ah khin langhter law na sunparnak cu vawleicung dihlak ah hin langhter ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nannih uktu bawi hna, bia nan ceih tikah ding tein nan ceih taktak maw? Mi vialte kha aa ruang tein nan ceih hna maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan ceih hna lo. Ṭhat lonak tuah nan duhmi lawng kha nan ruat i ram chungah khan mithahnak le lainawnnak nan umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu an chan chung vialte palhnak a tuahmi an si, an chuah ni in lihchim an i thawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rul bantukin sivai an ngei, rawchok hnachet bantuk an si, zeihmanh an thei lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />rawchok hnachet nih cun rul camhthiam aw kha a thei kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Pathian, an ha cu khiak dih hna, Maw Bawipa, hi ṭihnung chiandeih hna hi an ho phawi dih hna!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlang pang i a luangmi ti a loh bantukin lo hna seh, lam i lamh chihmi belh bantukin lo hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawncek chungah a lo ralmi cengkeuh bantuk si hna seh, ni a hmu bal lomi fa rawk bantuk si hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hngalh manh hlanah Pathian nih burbuk sam in a sam hna lai, an nun ko lioah Pathian nih a thinhun in thli choih in a choih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misual mi nih dantatnak an hmuh kha miding mi nih an hmuh tikah an i lawm lai, miṭhalo mi hna thi cu ti tan bantukin an tan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi nih an i thawh lai i, “Miding mi cu laksawng an hmu taktak ko; vawleicung ah hin Dingthlu Lairel Pathian a um taktak ko,” an ti lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ral hna sin hin ka khamh tuah, ka Pathian; a ka dohtu hna kut chung hin ka huppheng tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna kut chung hin ka khamh law lainawng hna kut chung hin ka chuah tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zohhmanh, keimah cu thah awkah an ka bawh, keimah doh awkah mipuarhrang pawl cu an i pum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak le sualnak ka tuah ruangah si loin ka sual ca le ka palh ca zongah si loin, Maw Bawipa, an ka bawhnak hmun ah khan khulrang in an va tli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa, tho law ka bawm tuah; maw Israel Pathian, nangmah hrimhrim nih ra zoh tuah. I hlau law miphun kha dantat hna, mi rawi hmang, miṭhalo mi hi, zaangfah hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zanlei fate an ra kir i uico bantukin an au i khua chungah an i chawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An chimmi bia cu ngai tuah! An lei cu an kaa chungah vainam bantuk an si nain an i thawh i, “Aho nih dah a kan theih lem lai?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Maw Bawipa, nang nih cun na nihsawh ko hna; miphun vialte cu capo men ah na saih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw a ka Vengtu, nangmah nih na ka huhphenh; Maw Pathian, nangmah cu ka ralhruang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ka dawtu ka Pathian nih a ka don lai, ka ral cu a ka teipiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih cu that hna hlah, ka mi hna nih an philh sual ai hnga, na ṭhawnnak in ṭhek hna law hrawk hna, Maw Bawipa kannih kan phaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kaa chungah sualnak a um an bia cu bia sual lawngte an si; an i porhlawtnak ah cun anmah lila i foih hna seh. Annih cu chiatserhnak bia a chimmi le lihchimmi an si caah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na thinhun in hrawk dih hna, hrawk dih cikcek hna. Cu tikah Israel uktu cu Pathian a si i vawleicung vialte zong a uk chih dih ti kha an hngalh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ral cu zanlei fate an ra kir i uico bantukin an au i khua chungah an i chawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rawl kawl ah an vak i a za an hmuh lo tikah an zai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei tu cu na ṭhawnnak kha hla in ka thangṭhat lai; zing fate in a fekmi na dawtnak kong kha hla in ka sa lai. Nangmah cu ka caah himnak na si, harnak caan ah dornak lungpi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw a ka Vengtu, nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai; Pathian cu ka ralhruang na si, a ka dawtu Pathian cu ka himnak na si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na kan hlawt cang i kan ralhau kha na chim dih cang hna; kan cungah na thin a hung — sihmanhsehlaw atu cu kanmah leiah i mer ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawlei kha na hninhter i na kahter; atu cu a hma kha damter ṭhan ko, zeicahtiah kuai dih aa zal cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mi cu temhnak tampi na kan inter, a kan rittertu zu kha na kan dinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah an ṭihmi hna caah hmelchunhnak na phun, sihmanhsehlaw an i let i an ral hna sin khan an zam ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ṭhawnnak in kan khamh tuah; kan thlacamnak kha kan let tuah, cuticun na dawtmi hna hi kan luat kho lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian nih a hmunthiang chungin aa thawh i, “Shekhem cu ka tei lai i ka cheu lai, cun Sukkoth Nelrawn cu ka mi kha ka phawt hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead cu keimah ta a si, Manasseh zong keimah ta a si, Efraim cu ka luchin a si i Judah cu ka bawifung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Moab cu ka kut ṭawlnak kheng ah ka hman lai i Edom cu ka kedan chiahnak kuang ah ka hman lai. Filistin nih hin, amah cu ka tei lai i ka au lai, tiin aa ruah dahra?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, aho nih dah ralhau a ngeimi khua chungah a ka luhpi lai? Aho nih dah Edom ah a ka kalpi lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kan hlawt taktak ko cang maw? Kan ralkap cu na kalpi ti hna lai lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minung bawmhnak cu zeihmanh a ṭhathnem lo caah kan raldohnak ah hin nangmah nih kan bawm ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian kan sinah a ṭan caah kan tei hna lai; kan ral cu amah nih a kan teipiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka aunak cu ka theihpiak ko, ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak ko
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inn in hlapi ah ka um i khuaruahhar vansang au in ka umnak hmun hin nangmah cu kan auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himnak hmun ah ka kalpi tuah, nangmah cu keimah nakin a sang deuhmi lungpi na si, ka ral hna sinin a ka hupphengtu a fekmi innsang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thlam chungah a zungzal in ka umter tuah, na thla tangah him tein i dor ko ning.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah nih bia kaa kammi kha na theih i nangmah an upatmi hna ro kha na ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu a nunnak ah kum tampi bet ko, sau piin nunter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian, na hmaika ah cun zungzal in uktu si seh law a fekmi na dawtnak le zumhawktlak na sinak khan amah cu kilveng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah ni khat hnu ni khat, na sinah bia kaa kammi ka tlinter pah in nangmah thangṭhatnak cu hla in ka sa zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian lawnglawng kaa bochan, amah sinin ka khamhnak cu a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah lawnglawng hi a ka hupphengtu le ka Khamhtu a si, amah cu ka ralhruang a si i ahohmanh nih an ka tei bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aa sawnmi vampang bantuk le baohmi hau bantuk a simi pa cu, nannih nih nan dihlak in zei can dah nan doh lai i thah nan i zuam lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan duhmi cu upatnak hmun i a ṭhutnak khan ṭhumh hi a si ko i lihchim zong hi nan duh hringhranmi a si fawn. Nan kaa cun thluachuahnak bia nan chim, sihmanhsehlaw nan lungchung cun chiat nan serh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian lawnglawng kha kaa bochan, amah lawnglawng kha kaa ruahchan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah lawnglawng hi a ka hupphengtu le Khamhtu a si, amah cu ka ralhruang a si i ahohmanh nih an ka tei bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khamhnak ka hmuhmi le upatnak ka hmuhmi cu amah thawng lawnglawng in a si; amah cu a ṭhawngmi lungpi ka him a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mi hna, Pathian cu i bochan zungzal u! Amah cu kan himnak a si caah nan harnak vialte kha chim dih u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi vialte hi thaw bantuk menmen an si, a thi khomi minung hi zeihmanh an man lo. Cuaithlainak cungah chia hna u law zeihmanh an tlai lai lo, thaw nak hmanh in an zaang deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zaangṭhawnnak le puarhrannak hi i bochan hlah u, mi thil chuh khawh hi i ruahchan hlah u; na rumnak hi karh lengmang hmanh seh law i bochan hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian nih, ṭhawnnak cu keimah ta a si i dawtnak ka ngeihmi cu a fek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a ti kha voi khat nak tam ka theih. Bawipa, nangmah hrimhrim nih mi cu, an rianṭuanning in na lehrulh ko hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah cu ka Pathian na si, nangmah cu kan ngai. Ka nunnak nih hin an hlam i ka thlarau nih tihal in an hal; vawlei ro nih ti a duh bantuk khin an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmunthiang ah cun in hmu ning law zeitluk in dah na lianhngan le na sunpar kha in hngal ning, ti ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak cu nunnak nakin a ṭha deuh, cucaah cun nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nun chung paohpaoh cu kan lawmh lai; nangmah leiah ka kut ka hler lai i thla ka cam lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu rawldangh bantukin aa dang lai i a khim lai, cun nangmah thangṭhat lawmhnak hla kha ka sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ihkhun cung i ka ih tikah nangmah cu kan thei, zan khuadei nangmah kha kan ruat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />zeicahtiah nangmah cu a kan bawmtu na si zungzal. Na thla tangah lawmhnak in hla ka sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah kha kan tlaihchan i na kut nih him tein an ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah thah a ka zalmi kha mithi khua ah an kal lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />raltuknak hmun ah khan an thi lai i an ruak cu cenghngia nih an ei hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thawngin siangpahrang cu aa lawm lai; Pathian min in biakamnak a tuahmi vialte hna cu an i lawm lai, sihmanhsehlaw milihchim hna cu an kaa phih a si lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, harnak ka tong, ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak tuah! Ka thin a phang, ka ral hna kut chungin ka khamh tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miṭhalo hna khuakhannak chungin ka khamh law misual bu hna sinin ka huppheng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei kha nam bantukin an i tat i bia ṭhalo kha thal bantukin an kah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miṭha kha lamhruang an ah hna i chikkhatte ah i sumṭhen loin an thal cun an kah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil ṭhalo tuahnak ding khua an khanmi ah khan, pakhat le pakhat thazang an i pe, khuazei ah dah kan rap kha kan chiah hna lai tiah an i ceih. “Kan rap cu ahohmanh nih hmu hna hlah seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhatlo tuahnak ding khua cu an khan i “Ṭhatlo tuahnak ding khua kan khanmi cu a ṭha tuk,” an ti. Minung lungthin le ruahnak hi khuaruahharmi thil thuk a si hrimhrim ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian nih a thal in a kah ciammam hna i chikkhatte ah khin hma an pu ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An bia nih khan rawhnak a phakpi hna lai i a hmumi paoh nih an lu an thinhnawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An dihlak in an thin a phang lai; Pathian nih a tuahmi kha an chim lai i a tuahmi kong cu an ruat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil ruangah khan miding mi vialte cu an i lawm lai; Bawipa chungah cun himnak an hmuh lai i miṭha vialte nih amah cu an thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nang cu kan thlacamnak a kan lettu na si caah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion ah kan in thangṭhat lai i na sinah bia kan i kammi kha kan in pek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi vialte nih an sualnak cu na hmaiah an phuan lai: kan sualnak cu kan caah a rit tuk hringhran, nangmah lawnglawng nih na kan thianhpiak khawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah nih na thimmi hna cu an lung aa lawm, na hmunthiang ah na umtermi hna mi lunglawm an si! Na inn chung i a ummi thil ṭha cu kan khim lai i a thiangmi na biakinn chung thil ṭha cu kan i zaa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan Khamhtu, thla kan cam tikah na kan leh i khuaruahhar thil na tuahmi in na kan khamh. Vawleicung mi vialte le a hla bik rili ral i a ummi hmanh nih an in bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhawnnak in tlang pipi hna cu an umnak hmun ah khan na umter hna i a ṭhawngmi na lianhngannak cu na langhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rili thawng cu na daihter i tilet thawng cu na nemter; mi au thawng cu na daihter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil lianngan na tuahmi hna ruangah vawlei cu a dihlak in a thin a phang. Vanhramdeng in vanhramdeng tiang na tuahmi thil kha mi nih an thangṭhat i an lawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram cu na dawt caah a cungah ruah na surter; na rumter i a vawlei na ṭhatter. A chung i na umtermi tiva cu an kao bal lo, cu tiva hna nih cun rawl a phunphun an chuahter — cucu nangmah tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An thuanmi lo cu ruah ti na pek i ciap tein ruah nih cun a surh; vawlei cu na nemter i thlaikho kha na ṭhanter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ṭhatnak nih kum ṭha a vuiter. Na kalnak paoh ah rawl tampi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saṭil tlonnak hmun cu saṭil run in an khat i tlangpang hna cu lawmhnak in an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram hnonak hmun cu tuu in an khat i nelrawn cu facang in an khat; lunglawmhnak in an au i hla an sa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi vialte hna, Pathian cu lunglawmhnak in thangṭhat tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sunglawimi a min kha hla in thangṭhat u, sunparnak in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian sinah cun, “Na tuahmi thil hi zeitluk in dah khuaruahhar an si. Na lianhngannak kha a ngan tuk caah na ral cu na hmaiah therphang in an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vawlei cungmi vialte nih an in biak i hla in an in thangṭhat, na min kha hla in an thangṭhat,” tiah chim u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ra u law Pathian nih a tuahmi thil hi zoh hna hmanh u, minung sinah a tuahmi thil khuaruahhar hi zoh hna hmanh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rili cu vawlei ro ah a canter i kan pupa hna nih tiva cu an ke in an tan. Cuka ah cun, a tuahmi thil ruangah khan kan i lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhawnnak in a uk zungzal i miphun hna cu a ngiat zungzal hna. Ahohmanh amah doh awkah ral tho hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miphun vialte hna, kan Pathian cu thangṭhat tuah u; nan thangṭhatnak cu thanter u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah nih nung dam tein a kan umter i tlu loin a kan umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah nih na kan hneksak; ngun cu mei in an thianh bantukin kannih zong na kan hneksak ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rap ah na kan foihter i kan keng ah thilrit na kan khinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan ral nih khan an kan lamh beh; tilian le meisul lakah na kan kalter, asinain atu cu himnak hmun na kan phakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na inn ah khangh thawinak kha ka rak put lai; bia kaa kammi kha kan pek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Harnak chung ka rak um lio i kan pek lai ka timi kha kan pek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakṭheng cung i khangh awkah tuu kha ka rak put hna lai, meheh khanghmi rim thaw kha aa zel lai i, cawtum le meheh kha raithawinak ah kan pek chanh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian a upatmi vialte hna, ra u law ra ngai tuah u; Pathian nih ka ca i a tuahmi kha kan chimh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian cu bawmhnak duh ah ka rak auh; amah cu hla in ka rak thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka sualnak kha rak thup ning law ka thlacamnak cu a rak ka ngaihpiak hnga lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian nih cun a ka theihpiak i ka thlacamnak cu a ka ngaihpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian nih ka thlacamnak kha a ka hlawtpiak lo i a fekmi a dawtnak kha ka sinin ṭhial loin a um caah, amah cu ka thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, vawleicung mi vialte nih na duhnak kha an hngalh i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />miphun vialte nih na khamhnak kha an hngalh nakhnga, kan zaangfah law thluachuahnak kan pe ko, kan cungah na hmai tlanter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Pathian, miphun kip nih in ṭhangṭhat hna seh, miphun vialte nih in thangṭhat hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah nih miphun vialte cu dinnak in bia na ceih hna i mi vialte cu na hruai hna caah miphun vialte cu i lawm hna seh law lunglawmhnak in hla sa hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kip nih in thangṭhat hna seh, Maw Pathian; miphun vialte nih in thangṭhat ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vawlei nih rawl kha a chuahter cang, Pathian kan Pathian nih thluachuah a kan pek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian nih thluachuah a kan pek; vawleicung mi zakip nih upat hna seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu tho seh law a ral kha ṭhek dih hna seh! Amah a huatu cu zam dih hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu kha thli nih a choih bantukin a choih dih hna lai, khuailul kha mei nih a emh tikah a tit bantukin miṭhalo cu Pathian hmaika ah an rawk lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw miding mi cu an i lawm lai i a hmaiah khan an tha a nuam lai; lunglawm ngaingai in an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian cu hla in thangṭhat u, a min cu thangṭhat u; khuadawm aa citmi caah cun lam kha ser tuah u. Amah a min cu Bawipa a si — amah hmaiah cun i lawm tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A biakinn thiang chungah a ummi Pathian nih, ngakṭah le nuhmei kha an zawn a ruah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungleng le umhar in a ummi kha umnak inn a pek hna i thongtla kha luatnak lawmhnak chungah a chuahpi hna; sihmanhsehlaw ralthawh hmangmi cu ramcar ah an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na mi na hruai hna tik le thetse ram tan in na kalpi hna tikah khan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />vawlei cu aa hnin i van in ruahpi a sur; cu bantukin a si cu Sinai Tlang Pathian a rat ca le Israel Pathian a rat ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruah tampi in na surter i a fe cangmi na ram kha na ṭhatter ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuka ah cun na mi nih innlo an khuar i na ṭhatnak thawngin sifakmi kha rawl ei awk na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nih nawlbia cu a chuah i cu thawng cu nu tampi nih an kalpi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Siangpahrang hna le an ralkap hna cu an zam cang,” an ti. Inn i a ummi nu hna nih khan, hranchaw an tlaihmi kha an rak i phaw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cu hranchaw hna cu ngun in tuammi ṭhuro milem tete an si, an thla cu sui bantukin a tleu. (Zeicahdah a cheu cu raldoh ni ah tuu kawm chungah nan um ko?)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Pathian nih siangpahrang hna cu Zalmon Tlang ah a ṭhek dih hna tikah khika ah hawhra kha a surter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bashan tlang hi zeitluk in a nganmi tlang dah a si! Tlang zum tampi a ngeimi tlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeicahdah cu bantuk tlang ngan, tlang zum tampi a ngeimi tlang nih, Pathian nih umnak ah aa thimmi tlang cu na nihsawh? Cuka ah cun Pathian cu, zungzal in a um ko ṭung lai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ṭhawngmi a rangleng thong tampi he Bawipa cu Sinai Tlang in a ra i a hmunthiang ah cun a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlang sang par ah cun a hung kai i sal tlaihmi tampi aa hruaih hna; amah a dohtu hna nih khan amah cu laksawng an pek. Cuka ah cun Bawipa Pathian cu a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khat hnu ni khat kan thilrit a kan changtu Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u, amah cu a kan khamhtu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu mi a khamhtu Pathian a si, amah cu Bawipa kan Bawipa, thihnak chungin a kan chuahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian nih a ral pawl cu an lu a khuai hrimhrim hna lai, an sualnak lam a zul pengmi hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa nih, “Nan ral cu Bashan in ka rak kirpi ṭhan hna lai; rili thukmi chungin ka rak kirpi ṭhan hna lai i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />an thisen chungah cun nan i chawk lai i nan uico nih an duh chungin an liah hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Pathian, teinak in na kal cu mi vialte nih an hmuh, Pathian ka siangpahrang a hmunthiang chung i a luh cu an hmuh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hlasatu pawl kha hmaisuang ah an um, aw dawh tum thiam pawl kha hnulei ah an um, an karlak ah khan khuang tumtu nu pawl kha an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“A mi an i pumhnak ah Pathian cu thangṭhat u; Israel tefa vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hmasa ah an lak i phun hme bik Benjamin kha a ra, cun Judah phun hruaitu pawl kha an mi hna he cun an ra i Zebulun le Naftali phun hruaitu pawl nih khan an zulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na ṭhawnnak langhter ko, kan ca i na hmanmi na ṭhawnnak kha langhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih laksawng an in putnak Jerusalem khua chung i na biakinn khan langhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Izipt cu mawhchiat ko, phaikung lak i a tlongmi sahrang kha mawhchiat ko, miphun cu chimhring ko hna, an fale he a ummi cawtum hna kha; annih nih na hmaiah an kun i an ngun cu an in pek hlantiang annih cu chimhring ko hna. Ral thawh a duhmi kha ṭhek ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Izipt ram in cozah nih thlahmi lamkaltu an ra lai; Ethiopia mi nih Pathian sinah thlacam in an kut an hler lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vawleicung ram hna, Pathian cu hla in thangṭhat u, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Van a citmi, a hlunmi van aa citmi cu thangṭhat u. Aw thang piin a au cu ngai tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ṭhawnnak cu thanh tuah u a lianhngannak cu Israel mi cungah a um, a ṭhawnnak cu van ah khin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian, Israel Pathian, a hmunthiang chung in a rami cu zeitluk in dah ṭihnung a si! A mi cu ṭhawnnak le lianhngannak a pek hna. Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka khamh ko sawh! Ti nih ka hngawng tiangin a ka phum cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thukmi nawncek chungah ka pil cuahmah i lamh awk a fekmi hmun a um lo. A thuhnak hmun ka phan cang i tilet nih an ka phum dengmang cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka bawm tuah tiin ka aunak ah ka baa cang i ka or zong a fak dih cang; bawmhnak a ka pe lai maw tiin ka mithram cat in kan zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zei ruang lo ah a ka huatu hna cu ka lu cung sam nakin an tam deuh, ka ral an sinak kongah lih a chimmi hna cu an ṭhawng i thah an ka duh. Ka fir lomi thil kha an ka chamter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka sualnak cu nangmah sinin an i thup kho lo; zeitluk in dah ka hruh cu na hngalh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Pathian Bawipa, nangmah an bochantu hna cungah ningzahnak ka tlunter nakhnga lo ka bawm. Maw Israel Pathian, nangmah an biatu hna cungah hmaichiatnak ka tlunter nakhnga lo ka bawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah ruangah nihsawhnak ka hmuh hi a si i nangmah ruangah ningzahnak nih a kan khuh hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unau hna sinah khual ah ka cang i ka nufale hna sinah ramdangmi ah ka cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na biakinn ka ṭanhnak hi ka chungah mei bantukin a alh i nangmah an in nihsawhnak kha keimah cungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rawl ulhnak in toidornak lungthin ngeih kaa zuam i asinain mi nih an ka nihsawh ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zuun ngaihnak thuam in kaa thuam i capo ah an ka saih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zatlang lam ah ka kong an ka ceih i zuri nih hla an ka phuah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain kei cu na sinah thla ka cam ko lai, Maw Bawipa ; a nganmi na dawtnak ruangah ka let law, kan khamh lai tiah na ka kammi ruangah ka let ko sawh, na duh tik caan ah nangmah nih ka let ko, Maw Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawncek chung ka tlaknak khan ka chuah ko, ka ral hna kut chungin ka huppheng ko law a thukmi ti chungin him tein ka chuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tilian cu ka fenhter sawh hlah; a thukmi ti chungah cun ka pilter sawh hlah, thlan chungah cun ka tlakter sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, a fekmi na dawtnak ṭhatnak thawngin ka thlacamnak cu ka let law, zawnruahnak ngan na ngeihmi thawngin keimah leiah i mer ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sal hi ka thuhtak hlah; harnak nganpi ka tong — atu hrimhrim ah ka let ko sawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ra ka zuanhnawh law ka khamh tuah; ka ral hna kut chungin ka chuah tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah an ka nihsawh i hmaichiatnak le ningzahnak ka huah kha na hngalh; ka ral cu na hmuh dih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An ka serhsat tuk caah ka lung zong a rawk dih; zeihmanh ka tuah kho ti lo. An ka zaangfah rua lai tiah ka rak ruah, sihmanhsehlaw zaangfahnak zeihmanh ka hmu lo; a ka hnemtu an um rua lai tiah ka rak ruah, sihmanhsehlaw ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka rawl a ṭam tikah sivai tu an ka pek, ka ti a hal tikah ti thor an ka dinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An puai cu anmah rawhnak ah cang seh law an i nuamhnak cu anmah tluknak ah cang ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An mit cawtter hna law khua hmu kho hna hlah seh; an keng cu derthawm zungzal hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thinhunnak cu toih hna law na thinlinhnak nih phan hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An riahhmun cu chuahtak hna seh law an thlam chungah a nungmi pakhat hmanh tang hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dan na tat cangmi kha an hrem chinchin hna i nganfahnak na inter cangmi hna kha an thangchiat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An sualnak kha cazin chungah i khumh dih law na khamhnak chungah covo zeihmanh ngei hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An min cu a nungmi minung cazin khan hloh si hna seh; na mi hna min cazin chungah i tel hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu harnak chung le temhinnak chungah ka um i cucaah cun ka cawi law ka khamh tuah, Maw Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian cu hla in ka thangṭhat lai, a lianhngannak cu ka thanh lai i amah cungah kaa lawmhnak cu ka chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi nih hin Bawipa cu cawtum pekchanh nakin a lawmhter deuh lai i cawtum kum tlingmi pekchanhnak hmanh in a lawmhter deuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cu thil cu serhsatnak a ingmi nih an hmuh tikah an i lawm lai; Pathian a biami cu lung ṭhawnnak thar an hmu lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sifahnak le retheihnak a ingmi hna thlacamnak cu Bawipa nih a ngaih i thong chungah a ummi hna kha a philh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Van le vawlei hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u, rili le a chung i a ummi thil vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zion cu a khamh lai i Judah ram chung khua cu a remh ṭhan hna lai; a mi cu cuka ah cun khua an sa lai i ram cu an co lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a sal hna an tefa nih an co lai i amah a dawmi kha cuka ah cun an um lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka khamh tuah, Maw Bawipa, atu ah ka bawm tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thah a ka zalmi kha sung hna seh law i tuai dih hna seh. Harnak ka inmi ruangah aa lawmmi cu an hnulei ah i let hna seh law ningzak in um hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ka nihsawhtu pawl kha an sunghnak nih khan lungdong cikcek in umter hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah sinah a rami vialte cu lunglawm le thanuam in um hna seh. Na khamhnak a duhmi vialte nih, “ Bawipa cu a lianngan hringhran ko,” ti zungzal hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei cu ka thazang a der i zeihmanh ka tuah kho lo; cucaah run ka zuanhnawh ko, Maw Pathian. Nangmah cu a ka bawmtu le Khamhtu na si — rau sawh hlah, Maw Bawipa! rau sawh hlah, Maw Bawipa!
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah cu kaa dornak hmun na si, zeitikhmanh ah ningzahnak ka phakter hlah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na din caah ka hram law ka chanh ko, ka bia ka ngaihpiak law ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka caah himnak lungpi si law a fekmi ralhruang a ka hupphengtu si ko; nangmah cu ka himnak lungpi le ka ralhruang na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pathian, miṭhalo hna kut chungin ka khamh tuah, mipuarhrang le miding lo hna kut chungin ka khamh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cungah ka ruahchannak vialte kha ka chiah, ka no lio tein nangmah cu kan bochan zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nun chung vialte nangmah cu kan hngatchan; ka chuahka in nangmah nih na ka huhphenh zungzal; nangmah cu a zungzal in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi mi tampi caah cun khuaruahhar a si, sihmanhsehlaw nangmah cu a ṭhawngmi a ka hupphengtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chun nitlak in kan thangṭhat i na sunparnak cu ka chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu cu a tar cang aipat tiin ka hlaw sawh hlah, san a tlai ti ualpat lo tiin ka kaltak hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ral nih cun thah an ka duh, an i ceih i keimah thahnak ding khua kha an khaan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An i thawh i, “Pathian nih a hlawt cang, dawi u sih law tlai u sih; zeicahtiah a chanhtu ding ahohmanh an um lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Pathian, lamhlatpi ah ka umtak hlah; ka Pathian, atu ah ka bawm ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ka dohtu pawl kha sung hna seh law rawk hna seh. Ka cungah fahnak tlunter aa zuammi kha ningzahnak le hmaichiatnak phan hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah cungah ka ruahchannak vialte cu ka chiah dih ko lai, nangmah cu kan thangṭhat chin lengmang lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na dinnak kong kha ka chim lai i na khamhnak kha chun nitlak ka thanh lai; na khamhnak cu ka hngalh khawh leng a si nain ka thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian, na ṭhawnnak cu ka thangṭhat lai, na dinnak, nangmah dinnak lawnglawng kha ka thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka no lio tein nangmah nih na ka cawnpiak i atu tiangin khuaruahhar na tuahmi kha ka chim lengmang ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atu cu a tar i a sam a par cang aipat tiin ka kaltak hlah, maw Pathian. Hmailei chan a ra ding vialte sinah na ṭhawnnak le na lianhngannak ka chimnak dingah hin nangmah nih ka umpi ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na dinnak cu van khi a phan. Thil lianngan tampi na tuah hna, nangmah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka cungah harnak le nganfahnak kha na tlunter, sihmanhsehlaw nangmah nih ka thazang kha na ka pek ṭhan lai i thlan chungin na ka khamh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmasa nakin a ngan chinchin ah na ka ser lai, nangmah nih hnangamnak na ka pek ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tingtang in nangmah cu kan thangṭhat lai, Ka Pathian, zumhawktlak na sinak cu ka thangṭhat lai. Maw Israel Mi Thiang, ka tingtang in nangmah thangṭhatnak hla cu ka sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah thangṭhat in tingtang ka tum pah in lunglawm in ka au lai, nangmah nih na ka khamh caah ka minung sinak a dihlak in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chun nitlak in na dinnak kha ka chim lai, zeicahtiah harnak pek a ka duhmi kha an sung cang i ningzahnak an phan cang. ningzahnak an phan cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, siangpahrang nih hin bia ka ceih tikah na dinnak kha ka hman nakhnga, ka cawnpiak ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cun na mi cu dinnak in ka uk hna nakhnga le sifakmi kha ding tein an bia ka ceihpiak hna nakhnga na dinnak kha keimah cu ka hrawm ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram nih hin rumnak i lawmhpi seh law dinnak kha a chungah leng seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang nih khan sifakmi kha an bia duhdanh lo tein ceihpiak hna seh law retheimi kha bawm hna seh law mi hremtu kha tei hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni a ceu chung paoh le thla a ceu chung paoh cu na mi nih a zungzal in in bia hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu lo a surhtu ruah bantuk si seh law vawlei a cawmtu ruah bantuk si seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A chan chungah dinnak kha karh seh law thlapa a ceu chung paoh cu siṭhatnak kha hmun ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A penmi ram cu rili pakhat in rili pakhat tiang a si lai i Zufrates tiva in vanhramdeng tiang a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thetse ram mi kha a hmaiah an kun lai i a ral kha leidip lakah an bawk lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Spain ram siangpahrang le tikulh ram siangpahrang hna nih khan laksawng an rak put lai; Arabia ram siangpahrang le Ethiopia ram siangpahrang hna nih khan laksawng an ra ṭhenh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang vialte kha a hmaiah an kun lai i miphun vialte nih a rian an ṭuan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah a autu sifakmi hna le retheimi hna, mi nih zei ah an rel lomi hna kha, a chanh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A dermi le sifakmi cungah zaangfahnak a ngei i retheimi kha an nunnak kha a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hremnak chung le serhsatnak chungin a khamh hna; an nunnak kha a caah thil sung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu saupi nung ko seh! Arabia ram in sui rak pe hna seh; a zungzal in thlacampiak hna seh; Pathian nih a zungzal in thluachuahnak pe seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram chungah rawl tam piin um ko seh; Lebanon tlang i a ummi rawl kung ṭha bantuk nih tlang vialte cu tuam dih hna seh. Ramlak i a khomi ram bantukin khuapi cu minung in khat hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A min cu zeitikhmanh ah philh si ti hlah seh; a minthannak cu ni a um chung paohpaoh dai loin um zungzal ko seh. Miphun zakip nih amah cu thangṭhat hna seh, mi vialte nih Pathian cu, siangpahrang thluachuah na pek bantukin kannih zong ka pe ve, tiin nawl hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa Israel Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u, amah lawnglawng cu, hi thil khuaruahhar a tuah khotu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A sunglawimi a min cu zungzal in thangṭhat ko u, a sunparnak cu vawleicung dihlak ah khat seh. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hihi Jesse fapa David thlacamnak an donghnak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hi Israel mi hna cungah a ṭha taktak ko, lung thiang a ngeimi hna cungah a ṭha taktak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu ka rak tlu dengmang, ka rak nal dengmang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />zeicahtiah miṭhalo hna an huncho kha ka hmuh i an i porhlawt kha ka theih tikah cu nih cun ka nah a ka chuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih cu fahnak zeihmanh an ing lo, an ngan a dam i an ṭhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midang bantukin harnak zeihmanh an tong lo, midang bantukin temhinnak zeihmanh an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah cun ruamkai kha ṭhi bantukin an i oih i puarthau cu puan bantukin an i aih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An mit pawt lellul pipi in an um i an lungthin cu ṭhat lonak khuaruahnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midang kha zeihmanh ah an rel hna lo i thil ṭhalo lawng kha an ceih. An ruam a kai i zeitindah midang kha kan hrem khawh hna lai ti lawng kha an ceih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancung i a ummi Pathian kha an thangchiat i vawleicung i a ummi minung kha an duhduh in an ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cucaah cun Pathian mi hmanh nih an merhnawh hna i an chimmi paoh kha an zumh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An i thawh i, “Pathian nih cun a hngal lai lo, Cungnung Bik nih cun a hmu lem lai lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miṭhalo mi cu hi bantuk hi an si ko. Thil tampi an ngei i an ngei chin luaimai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A si kun ahcun, thiang tein nun kaa zuam i ka kut in sualnak tuah lo kaa sum hi pakpalawng maw a si ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian, chun nitlak in harnak na ka inter i zing fate in dan na ka tat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cu bantuk bia cu rak chim ning law na mi hna cungah rawitu ka rak si ṭung hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cucaah cun hihi hngalh a har tuk ko nain, hngalh awkah kaa zuam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na biakinn chung i ka luh tik ceo ah miṭhalo hna cungah zeidah a tlung lai ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lam nal ah na chiah taktak hna i rawhralnak chungah na tlakter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chikkhatte ah an rawk i an donghnak cu ṭihnung ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa, annih cu zanmang bantuk an si, na hun i hlauh tikah annih cu an lo colh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka cekne tiangin a ka runh i ka thin a ka khenh tikah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hrut i zeihmanh ka hngalthiam lo; na cung i ka umtuning cu saram umtuning bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain nangmah sin ṭhiamṭhiam ah khan ka um i ka kut in na ka hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka kalnak dingah khan lungthin na ka cheuh i a donghnak ah cun upatnak he na ka cohlan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vancung ah khin nangmah hlei in ahodah ka ngeih? Nangmah kan ngeih cang caah vawlei ah hin zeidah ka herhmi a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka pum le ka ruahnak cu zorchuk hna hmanh seh law Pathian kha ka thazang a si; amah lawnglawng kha ka herhmi cu a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmah an hlawmi cu an thi hrimhrim lai, nangmah cungah zumhawktlak in a um lomi cu na hrawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei ca tu ah cun, Pathian pawng um le, Bawipa Pathian chungah i dor le a tuahmi thil thanh hi a va nuam hringhran dah!
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zeicahdah hitihin na kan hlawt, Maw Pathian? Na mi cungah hin zungzal in maw na thin a hun lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hlanlio piin na mi si awkah na kan thimmi hi kan philh hlah. Na rak umnak Zion Tlang zong kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ra law kan thil a rawkmi hi na ke hrimhrim in ra pal, kan ral nih biakinn chung thil vialte an hrawh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hmunthiang chungah na ral kha an au, biakinn kha an lak cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hreitlung in thing a hautu pawl nih thing an hau bantukin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thingphel vialte kha an hreitlung le an sobul in an khuai dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na biakinn kha an khangh; nangmah kan in biaknak hmun kha an thurhhnawmh; a dihlak in an hrawh dih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kanmah kha a rial in rial cikcek an kan duh, ram chung hmunthiang paoh kha an khangh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan thil thiang kha an lo dih, profet an um ti lo, hi bantukin thil kha zei can dah a um ti kha ahohmanh nih an hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan ral nih hin zei can dah an kan nihsawh lai? Na min hi a zungzal in maw an nihsawh ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zeicahdah bawmh na kan duh lo? Zeicahdah na kut cu na hnulei ah na chiah hna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian, a hramthawk tein nangmah cu kan siangpahrang na si i vawlei cungah hin nangmah nih ral kha na tei hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ṭhawngmi na thazang in rili kha na cheu i rili chung rulpi kha an lu na den dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leviathan rulpi lu kha na den hna i a ruak cu thetse ram mi kha ei awkah na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cerhti le tiput cu na luanter hna i tiva ngan cu na carter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chun le zan cu nangmah nih na ser hna, ni le thlapa cu an umnak hmun cio ah khan na chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawlei cu a donghnak ri kha nangmah nih na ser hna i ṭhal caan le khuasik caan cu na ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw maw Pathian, na ral nih an in serhsat kha philh hlah; annih cu mihrut an si i nangmah cu zei ah an in rel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Santlailo na mi hna hi a puarhrangmi an ral hna kut chungah kaltak hna hlah; hremnak a ingmi na mi hi philh hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kanmah he biakamnak na tuahmi kha philh hlah. Kan ram chung a muihnak hmun paoh hi zaang-ennak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hremmi kha sunghter hna hlah law sifak le rethei nih in thangṭhat ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Pathian, tho law na bia kha chim tuah! Nangmah zei ah an rel lomi nih chun nitlak in nihchuak i an in saih kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ral nih thinhun in an au len cu philh hlah, an dotu hna nih hnahnawhnak thawng an umter zungzalmi cu philh hlah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan in thangṭhat, Maw Pathian, nangmah cu kan in thangṭhat. Zeitluk in dah na lianhngan kha kan thanh i khuaruahharmi thil na tuahmi kha kan chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian nih, “Biaceihnak dingah caan ka khiah cang i aa buaktlak tein ka ceih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawlei le a cung i a ummi minung vialte hi lo dih hna hmanh seh law vawlei hram cu fek tein ka umter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miruamkai kha i porhlaw hlah u ka ti hna i miṭhalo kha nan lung puam hlah u, ka ti hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />i leksuai ti hlah u ka ti hna i i fak len ti hlah u ka ti hna,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biaceihnak hi nichuahlei in siseh nitlaklei in siseh a ra lo, chaklei in siseh thlanglei in siseh a ra lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bia a ceihtu cu Pathian a si i a cheu kha a ṭhumh hna i a cheu kha a cawi hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih a kut in hrai pakhat aa put, cu hrai cu zu hrim, a ṭhawng ngaingaimi in a khat, a thlet i miṭhalo vialte kha a dinter hna, a ne zongin an khawn dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu Jakob Pathian kong chim kha ka bang lai lo i amah thangṭhatnak hla sak zong kha ka ngol bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭhalo mi hna ṭhawnnak cu a hrawh lai, sihmanhsehlaw miding mi ṭhawnnak kha cu a karh chin lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu Judah ram chungah an hngalh ngaingai i Israel ram ah a min a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A umnak inn cu Jerusalem ah khan a si i Zion Tlang cungah khan khua a sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuka ah cun ral pawl an cantiang kha a khiah dih hna i an phaw le an nam zong kha a hrawh dih hna — an hriamnam vialte kha a hrawh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na sunparnak cu a lianhngan, maw Pathian! Na ral na tei hnanak tlang in na ra kir tikah khan, zeitluk in dah na rumra kha a ngan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ralkap ralṭha pawl cu an hranchaw kha na chuh hna i atu cu thihnak hngilh in an i hngilh cang; an hriamnam a run hmangtu dingah a tangmi pakhat hmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhih hna tikah maw Jakob Pathian, an rangtum vialte le an rangcung ralkap vialte cu an ril dih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw nangmah cu mi nih an in ṭih hringhran ko! Na thin a hun ahcun ahodah na hmaiah a dir ngam lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawleicung i hremnak a ingmi vialte hna khamh awkah; nangmah nih na biakhiahnak cu thanh awk i na thawh tikah, na biakhiahnak cu vancung khin na run langhter i vawlei cu a thin a phang i dai tein a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minung thinhunnak nih cun nangmah thangṭhatnak tu kha a karhter chin lehlam; ral chungin a nung in a tangmi hna nih na puai kha an tuah hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan in pek lai tiah nan i kammi kha Bawipa nan Pathian cu pe u; kan pawngkam i a ummi miphun hna, Bawipa cu laksawng ra pe u. Pathian nih minung cu amah ṭih dingin a ser hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a ruam a kaimi bawi kha a ṭhumh hna i siangpahrang nganngan kha therphang lengmang in a umter hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cu fak piin ka auh, fak piin ka auh i a ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harnak caan ah Bawipa sinah cun thla ka cam; zan khuadei thlacam in ka kut cu ka hler hna, sihmanhsehlaw hnangamnak ka hmu kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kha ka ruat i ka hram, khua ka ruat i ka lung a dong. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ka hngilhter lo, ka lungre a thei tuk i zeihmanh ka chim kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A liam ciami ni kha ka ruat hna i a luan ciami kum kha ka hngalh ṭhan hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zan khuadei fak piin khua ka ruat; khua ka ruat lengmang i keimah le keimah kaa halmi cu hihi a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa nih hin a zungzal in maw a ka hlawt ko lai? Ka cungah hin lawmhnak a ngei ṭhan ti lai lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daw ti loin maw a ka um ko lai? Bia a ka kammi cu pakpalawng maw a si ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian nih hin minung cung i zaangfahnak ngeih kha a philh ko hnga maw? Minung cung i zawnruahnak a ngeih tawnmi kha a thinhunnak nih dahra a hloh dih?” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun kaa thawh i, “Ka lungfah bikmi cu — Pathian cu zeizong vialte tuah khotu a si ti lo,” ti hi a si, ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa, thil lianngan na tuahmi kha ka philh hna lai lo i kan hnulei caan i khuaruahharmi thil na tuahmi kha ka lung ah an hung pem ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tuah ciami thil vialte kha ka ruat ṭhan hna lai i ka lung chungin ka tuaktan hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na tuahmi thil vialte hi an thiang dih! Nangmah tlukin a nganmi pathian zeihmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang cu khuaruahharmi thil a tuahtu Pathian na si; na ṭhawnnak cu miphun hna lakah khan na langhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na lianhngannak in na mi cu na khamh hna, na mi Jakob tefa hna le Josef tefa hna cu na khamh hna. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ti nih an in hmuh tikah an thin a phang i rili tawne hna cu an ther.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuadawm nih ruah a surter, van in khua a ri i nimtlau kha a kenkip ah an lek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuari thawng cu a tor in a tor i nimtlau nih vawlei kha a ceuh dih; vawlei cu a hninh in aa hnin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rili cungah na ke in na kal, a thukmi rilipi cu na tan, sihmanhsehlaw na ke neh cu hmuh khawh an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na mi cu tuukhal bangin na hruai hna, Moses le Aaron kha na cawnghter hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka mi hna, kan cawnpiakmi hna kha ngai tuah u, ka chimmi bia kha ṭha tein ngai tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan sinah bia ka chim lai i hlanlio thil khuaruahhar kha a sullam kan chimh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cu thil cu kan rak theihmi le kan rak hngalhmi kha an si, kan pupa hna nih an kan chimhmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ṭhawnnak le amah nih thil lianngan a tuahmi hna le, thil khuaruahhar a tuahmi hna kha, kan fale cu chim loin kan um hna lai lo, kan hmai chan mi kha kan chimh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi kha nawlbia a pek hna, Jakob tefa kha nawlbia a pek hna. Ka nawlbia cu nan fale kha nan cawnpiak hna lai, tiin kan pupa kha a fial hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun hmai chan mi nih an hngalh ve lai i an fale kha an cawnpiak ve hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Pathian zong kha an i bochan lai i a tuahmi thil kha an philh hna lai lo, a nawlbia kha an zulh zungzal hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih cu a hringsortu hna bantuk kha an si lai lo, kha hna kha cu ralthawh hmang, nawl ngai lomi, Pathian fek tein aa bochan lomi, Pathian sinah zumhawktlak in a um bal lomi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Li le thal in ral a tu tawnmi Efraim mi kha raltuk taktak ni ah cun an zam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian sinah bia an i kammi kha an zul lo, a nawlbia kha ngaih an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tuahmi thil kha an philh hna i khuaruahharnak a langhtermi kha an i cinken lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An pupa hna mithmuh hrimhrim ah khan Pathian nih khuaruahharmi thil pakhat a tuah, Zoan lo ah, Izipt ram ah khan a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rili kha a cheu i a chungin a hruai hna; ti cu vampang bantukin a dirter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chun ah khuadawm in a hruai hna i zan ah mei ceu in a hruai hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram car chungah khan lung ngan pipi kha a khuai hna i rili ti zat in din awk ti a pek hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />lungpang chung khan tiva a chuahter hna i ti cu tiva bangin a luanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian cungah cun sualnak an tuah lengmang ko i Cung Nung Bik kha ramcar chungah cun an doh zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan duhmi rawl cu na kan pek hrimhrim lai tiin Pathian cu an hneksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian cu an thangchiat i, “Pathian nih cun ramcar ah cun cabuai cu a hung kho ngai hnga maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungpi cu a tuk i ti cu a chuak hluahmah taktak, asinain rawl cu a kan pe kho ngai hnga maw? A mi cu sa a kan pe kho ngai hnga maw?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cu an chimmi cu Pathian nih a theih tikah an cungah a thin a hung; a mi cu mei in a hrem hna i an cung i a thinhunnak kha a ṭhang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />zeicahtiah amah kha an i bochan duh lo i a kan khamh lai, tiah an zum duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw van kha bia a chimh i a innka kha a hunter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />vancung cun rawl a run pek hna, an ei awk manna changreu kha a run thlak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun vancungmi rawl kha an ei. Pathian nih an ei khawh chung ei awkin a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun nichuahlei thli kha a hranter i a ṭhawnnak in thlanglei thli kha a thawhter,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cun leidip zat in va kha a thlak hna, rili kam thetse zat in a thlak hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an riahhmun laifang ah khan an tla, an thlam velchum ah khan an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuticun mi nih khan an ei hna i an khim; Pathian nih an duh zat in a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an ei lio, a khim hmanh an khim hlanah khan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian cu an cungah a thin a hung i an miṭhawng bikbik kha a thah hna, Israel tlangval ṭha bikbik kha a thah hna!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi vialte khuaruahharnak a tuah ko nain mi cu an sual lengmang ko i a zumh in an zum duh lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />cucaah cun an ni cu thaw bantukin a donghter hna, an nunnak cu chikkhatte ah thil ṭhalo nih a tlunhnawh hna i a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a cheu a thah hna tikah khan, a cheu cu amah leiah an i mer ve; an i ngaichih i amah sinah thla fak piin an cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Annih a hupphengtu hna cu Pathian a si kha an hun hngalh i annih a khamhtu hna cu Cungnung Bik a si kha an hun theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an bia cu lih lawngte a si i an chimmi paoh cu hlennak lawngte a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amah sinah khan zumhawktlak in an um lo, amah sin i bia an i kammi kha an zul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain Pathian cu a mi hna cungah khan zaangfahnak a ngei, an sualnak kha a ngaihthiam hna i a hrawk hna lo. Thinhun kha voi tampi aa sum i a thinlinhnak kha voi tampi chuahter loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Minung an si kha a philh lo, a hung hrang i a lo ṭhan komi thlitu bantuk men an si kha a philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Voi zeizat riamruam dik amah kha ramcar chungah khan an doh; voi zeizat riamruam dik a ngaih an chiatter!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Atu le atu Pathian kha an hneksak, atu le atu Israel Mi Thiang kha a thin an hunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A liannganmi a ṭhawnnak kha an philh; an ral hna kut chungin a khamh hna kha an philh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Izipt ram Zoan lo lak i a liannganmi thil le khuaruahharmi thil a tuahmi kha an philh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tiva kha thi ah a canter hna i Izipt mi nih khan tiva ti cu an ding kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tho kha a thlahhnawh hna i awlok an chonh hna, utlak kha a thlahhnawh hna i an lo kha an hrawhpiak dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An rawl kung eitu ah lunghmul a thlahhnawh hna i an lo hrawktu ah khaubawk a thlahhnawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An mitsur ruang cu rial in a thah hna i an theipi kung cu hawhra in a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An caw cu rial in a thah hna i an tuurun cu ṭek in a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ṭih a nungmi a thinhunnak kha an cungah a thlet hnawh hna i hrawktu vancungmi a thlahhnawhmi hna nih khan harnak tampi an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A thin kha a sum lo i an nunnak zong kha a zuah hna lo; rai in a thah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Izipt ram chung innchungkhar dihlak an fapa upa bik kha a thah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cun tuukhal bangin a mi cu a chuahpi hna i ramcar chungah khan lam a hruai hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Him tein a kalpi hna i zeihmanh an ṭih lo, sihmanhsehlaw an ral hna cu rili nih a vui hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A ram thiang chungah cun a luhpi hna, amah hrimhrim nih a teimi tlang ah cun a phakpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A mi pawl cu hmailei i an hung fon deuh lengmang tikah khan cuka i a rak ummi hna kha a dawi hna; ram cu Israel miphun kha a cheuh hna i cuka ah cun an thlam chung cio ah khan khua a sakter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Asinain Lianngan Bik Pathian kha an doh i an hneksak. A nawlbia kha zulh an duh lo i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />an pu an pa hna bantuk khan ral thawh hmang le zumh awk tlak loin an um ve, aa merhmi likuk in kahmi thal cu a ka a kheng khomi a si lo caah i bochan khawh ding a si lo bantukin annih zong bochan awk a tlakmi an si ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Lawkih biaknak hmun an sermi nih khan a thin a hunter i an serchommi siasal hna nih khan a nah an chuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Cucu Pathian nih a hmuh tikah a thin a hung i cucaah a mi cu a hlawt hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Shiloh khua i a ummi an thlam cu a kaltak, minung sin i a umnak a inn cu a kaltak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Biakamnak kuang kha kan ral pawl cu a tlaihter hna. a lianhngannak le a sunparnak an umnak kuang cu a tlaihter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Amah a mi hna lila cungah cun a thin a hung i an ral kha annih cu a thahter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ral ah tlangval cu an thi lengmang i ngaknu pawl cu vat awk an ngei ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tlangbawi cu vainam in an thi i an nupile nih khan a ngaih hmanh an ngai kho hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A donghnak ah Bawipa cu hngilh i hun i hlauh bantuk khin a hun i hlau; zu nih a tha a pawttermi ralkap ṭhawng bantuk khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ral cu a khirh hna i a tei cikcek hna, ningzak in a thawh in tho kho ti loin a tei hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Josef tefa kha a hlawt hna i Efraim phun kha a thim hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Judah phun tu kha a thim i a duh ngaingaimi Zion Tlang tu kha a thim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Cuka ah cun a biakinn kha a sak, vancung i a inn bantuk a si; vawlei bantuk fek in a ser i zungzal him dingin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A sal David kha a thim i tuu a khalhnak le tuu a cawnghnak khan a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Amah cu Israel siangpahrang ah a ser, Pathian mi hna tuukhal ah a ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />David nih cun a lungthin a dih-umnak in a zohkhenh hna i fimnak in a hruai hna. in a zohkhenh hna i fimnak in a hruai hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, lawkihmi nih na mi hna kan ram hi an rung chim; na biakinn thiang cu an thurhhnawmh i Jerusalem cu an hrawh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mi hna an ruak cu langta ei awkah an hlonh hna i na sal hna an ruak cu saram ei awkah an hlonh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mi hna an thisen cu ti bantukin an luanter, Jerusalem khua pumpi ah thi cu ti bantukin a luang, ruak vuitu ding ahohmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan pawngkam i a ummi miphun hna nih capo ah an kan saih, an kan nihsawh i an kan zawmhtaih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, zei can dah kan cungah na thin a hun lai? Zungzal in maw a hun ko lai? Na thinhunnak cu zungzal in maw mei bantukin a alh ko lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah an bia lomi miphun cu na thinhunnak kha toih hna law nangmah an hlawmi cu na thinhunnak kha langhhnawh ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih nih kan mi kha an thah hna i kan ram kha an hrawh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan pupa hna nih sualnak an tuahmi ruangah cun kannih cu dan kan tat hlah, ruahchan awk zeihmanh kan ngeih ti lo caah zaangfahnak tu kan cungah ngei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na min upatnak ding caah kan bawm tuah, Maw Pathian kan Khamhtu; kan chuah law kan sualnak cu kan ngaithiam ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zeicahdah miphun dang hna nih, “Nan Pathian cu khuazei ah dah a um kun?” tiah an kan ti lai? Na sal kha an thi an luanter hna caah miphun dang pawl dan na tat hna cu kan mit hrimhrim nih hmu seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thongtla pawl cu an aihramnak kha theihpiak ko sawh hna, thah awkin biakhiah cangmi cu a liannganmi na ṭhawnnak in luatter ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, miphun dang pawl cu, nangmah an in zawmhtaih ruangah khan a let sarih in rul hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun kannih na mi, na tuurun chung tuu hna nih hin, zungzal in kan in lawmh lai i kan hmailei hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel Tuukhal, kan bia kan ngaihpiak tuah, Josef kha tuurun bantukin a hruaitu, kan thlacamnak kan theihpiak tuah. Cherubim cungah bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na dawtnak cu kan cungah langhter ko; Efraim le Benjamin le Manasseh phun cungah langhter ko! Na ṭhawnnak cu kan hmuhter, ra law kan khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan kirpi ṭhan ko, Maw Pathian! Na dawtnak kha kan cungah langhter law kannih nih khamhnak kan hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian, zeitik tiang dah na mi hna kan thlacamnak hi let duh loin na kan um lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthli hi ni fate kan ei awk rawl ah na ser i hrai nganpi khat in kan din awkah na kan chiahpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan khua chingchan hna hmaiah ningzak in na kan umter i kan ral nih an lung diriam tein an kan nihsawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan kirpi ṭhan ko, Maw Lianngan Bik Pathian, na dawtnak kha kan cungah langhter law kannih nih khamhnak kan hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ram in mitsur ruang pakhat na chuahpi; miphun dang kha na ṭhawl hna i an ram ah cun cu mitsur ruang cu na phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ṭhan khawh nakhnga hmun kha na thianhpiak i cucaah a hram cu thukpi an pil kho i a ruang cu an zam i ram vialte kha an huh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlang cu thladem a demh hna i sidar kung ngan pipi cu a nge nih a huh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nge cu an zam lengmang i Mediterranean Rili an phan, Zufrates Tiva tiang an phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zeicahdah a kulhnak hau vialte cu na bauh dih? Atu cu aa chawkmi paoh nih a thei kha an fir;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ngal nih an nan dih i saram vialte nih an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Pathian, kanmah leiah i mer ko! Vancung khin run kan zoh law ra law na mitsur ruang hi rung khamh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmah hrimhrim nih na cinmi mitsur ruang hi ra khamh tuah; hi tluk ṭhawng in na ṭhantermi mitsur ruang no hi ra khamh tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan ral nih mei in an khangh i an sam dih; na thinhun in zoh hna law hrawk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah nih na thimmi miphun cu kan huppheng law kan zohkhenh ko, nangmah nih hi tluk ṭhawng in na ṭhantermi miphun cu kan zohkhenh ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah cu zeitikhmanh ah kan in mertak ti lai lo; nungdam in kan umter law kan in thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan kirpi ṭhan ko, Maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian! Na dawtnak kha kan cungah langhter law kannih nih khamhnak k zeitikhmanh ah kan in mertak ti lai lo; nungdam in kan umter law kan in thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kan chanhtu Pathian cu lunglawmhnak in hla in thangṭhat u; Jakob Pathian cu hla in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hla dawh sak cu thawk u law khuang cu tum hna u; tingtang le thonglawi in aw dawhdawh cu tum hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla thar caan le thla lai caan ah, kan puai ah tuu ki cu tum hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hihi Israel ram ah kan phung a si, Jakob Pathian nih tuah a kan fialmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt ram doh awkah aa thawh tikah, Israel mi kha nawlbia ah a pek hna. Ka theih bal lomi aw pakhat kha ka theih i cu aw nih cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nan keng cung thilrit pipi kha kan lakpiak cang hna i nan rianṭuannak bawm kha kan chiahter cang hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harnak nan in tikah nan ka auh i kan khamh hna. Khuadawm chung i kaa thuhnak hmun khin ka run in leh hna; Meribah cerh ah khan kan hneksak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka mi hna, ralrinnak kan pekmi hna hi ngai tuah u; Israel, ka bia hi ngai ko sawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ramdang pathian kha bia hrimhrim hna hlah u, keimah dah ti lo cu a dang zeihmanh bia hna hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si, keimah nih Izipt ram in kan chuahpi hna; nan ka ang u law rawl kan pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Asinain ka mi nih ka bia ngaih nan duh lo; Israel nih ka nawl zulh na duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah nan lung ṭhawn ning bantukin nan lam kha kan zulhter hna i nan duhmi paoh kha kan tuahter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mi nih hin ka bia ngai u law zeitluk in dik ka hei i lawmh hnga! Ka nawl zul u law, zeitluk in dik ka lung a va si hnga!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan ral kha khulrang tein kan teipiak ko hna hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ka huami cu ka hmaiah therphang in an kun lai, dantatnak an inmi cu zungzal in a hmun lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Changvut ṭha bik in ka
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vancung biaceihnak hmun ah Pathian cu a dir i pathian pawl an i pumhnak ah biakhiahnak hi bantukin a tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ding loin biaceih hi ngol hrimhrim cang u, miṭhalo duhdanh kha ngol cang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sifakmi le ngakṭah kha an bia ceihpiak hna u, rethei le bawmtu ngei lo kha hmaan tein ruahpiak hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sifak le retheimi kha chuah hna u, miṭhalo hna kut chung khan khamh hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nan va hrut thiam dah, nan va fim lo thiam dah! Khuamui chungah nan um i vawlei cungah hin dinnak zeihmanh a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nannih cu pathian nan si, Cungnung Bik fapa nan si, kan ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain minung bantukin nan thi lai, siangpahrang fapa an thih bantukin nan thi ve lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ra law vawlei hi uk tuah; miphun vialte hi nangmah ta an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Pathian, um sawhsawh ko hlah; dai zirziar le holh loin um hlah, maw Pathian!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zohhmanh, na ral cu an cawl an cang i nangmah an huatu cu nangmah doh awkah an i tim len ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mi hna tuknak dingah a thli in khua an khang i nangmah nih na huhphenhmi hna doh awk kha an i tim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An i thawh i, “Israel hi a phun hloh in hlo u sih, zungzal in philh si seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An khuakhanmi ah cun lungkhat in an um i nangmah doh awkah cun an ṭang ṭi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cu hna cu, Edom mi, Ishmael mi; Moab mi, Hagri mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal mi, Ammon mi, Amalek mi, Filistia mi le Tair mi an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assiria zong kha an sinah aa ṭom ve, an dihlak in Lot tefa cu an bawmh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midian mi cungah na tuahmi bantuk kha annih cung zongah tuah ve, Kishon Tiva ah Sisera le Jabin cung i na tuahmi bantuk kha an cungah tuah ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sisera le Jabin cu Endor ah na sunghter hna i an ruak cu vawlei ah a rop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oreb le Zeeb cungah na tuahmi bantuk kha an ralbawi hna cungah cun tuah ko; Zebah le Zalmunna na sunghter hna bantuk khan, an uktu bawi vialte cu sunghter ko hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cu uk bawi pawl nih cun an rak i thawh i, “Pathian ram a simi cu kanmah caah kan i lak lai,” an rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka Pathian, annih cu leidip bangin ṭhek ko hna, thli nih a choihmi capawl bangin ṭhek dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mei nih tupi kha a kangh i meizik nih tlang cu a hliau bantukin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />annih cu ṭotho in dawi hna law thlichia in ṭhih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na min lianngan kha an phuan hlantiang, ningzahnak cu an lu cungah khinh luaimai ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sung hna seh law therphang zungzal in um hna seh, ningzak hmaichia in thi hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah lawnglawng hi Bawipa na si le vawlei dihlak uktu, Cungnung Bik na si kha hngal hna seh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa, zeitluk in dah na biakinn cu ka duh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuka i um cu ka duh hringhran! Bawipa biakinn chung tual cu ka ngai hna. A nungmi Pathian cu ka nunnak dihlak in hla in ka thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pithlung hmanh nih bu an i sak i pele hmanh nih anmah innte an ngei; an fano cu na biakṭheng pawngah an chiah hna, maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa, kan siangpahrang le kan Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na biakinn chungah a ummi cu zeitluk in dah an i lawmh, nangmah thangṭhatnak hla a sa zungzalmi hna cu zeitluk in dah an tha a nuam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah sinin thazang a hmumi hna cu zeitluk in dah an i lawmh, Zion Tlang i va kal a duhmi hna cu zeitluk in dah an i lawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ro a carmi nelrawn kha an tan tikah cerhti put tamnak hmun ah a cang; ruahter nih khan tidil in a khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kal tikah an ṭhawng chin lengmang; Zion Tlang ah pathian hna Pathian cu an hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian, ka thlacamnak kha ka theihpiak tuah, Jakob Pathian, ka thlacamnak kha ka ngaihpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan siangpahrang cu thluachuahnak pe ko, nangmah nih na thimmi siangpahrang cu thluachuahnak pe ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na biakinn chungah ni khat um cu hmun dang i ni thong khat um nakin a ṭha deuh. Miṭhalo mi hna inn chung i um nakcun ka Pathian inn kutka hram dir hmanh ka duh deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa cu a kan hupphengtu le a sunglawimi kan siangpahrang a si, amah nih thluachuah a kan pek i vel le thangṭhatnak kan hmuh. A dingmi thil a tuahtu paoh cu thil ṭha kha pe loin a um hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Lianngan Bik Pathian, nangmah an bochanmi cu lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, na ram cu na zaangfah ko, Israel cu a kumvui na ṭhatter ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mi hna an sualnak kha na ngaihthiam hna i an palhmi vialte kha na maimilh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An cung i na thinhunnak kha na damter i na thinlinhnak kha na daihter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Pathian, kan Khamhtu, kan kirpi ṭhan law kan cungah lungsi loin um ti hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan cungah zungzal in maw na thin a hun ko lai? Na thin cu a dam bal lai lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thazang thar kan pe law, na mi nih kan in thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, a fekmi na dawtnak cu kan hmuhsak ko, na khamhnak zong kan pe fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian i a chimmi bia cu ka ngai lai, hruh lam a simi lam, kan lam kha kan zulh ṭhan lo caah a mi kannih hi daihnak kha a kan kamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah a upatmi khamh awkah khan aa tim zungzal ko i kan ram chungah hin a sunparnak cu a um zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dawtnak le zumhawktlak sinak cu an ra ṭi lai; dinnak le daihnak cu an i tong lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minung nih zumhawktlak a sinak kha van leiah a kai lai i Pathian dinnak nih vancung khin a run zoh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nih kumvui ṭha a kan pek lai i kan ram nih rawl tampi a chuahter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa hmaiah khan dinnak cu a kal lai i a lam kha a rak sialpiak lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A derthawmmi le santlai lomi ka si caah ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak law ka let tuah, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah kha an tlaihchanmi ka si caah thihnak in ka khamh ko; nangmah sal ka si ca le nangmah an bochanmi ka si caah ka khamh ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang cu ka Pathian na si caah ka cungah zaangfahnak ngei ko, Maw Bawipa ; chun nitlak in na sinah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu na sinah a kai lengmang caah na salpa hi ka lung ka lawmhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah sin i thla a cammi hna cungah cun na ṭha i ngaihthiamnak le a fekmi dawtnak in na khat, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa, ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak law nangmah bawmh hal in ka aunak hi ka theihpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak kha na ka leh tawn caah harnak caan ah nangmah kha kan auh lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah bantuk pathian dang ahohmanh an um lo, nangmah tuahmi bantuk a tuah khomi pakhat hmanh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmah nih na sermi miphun vialte hi an chuak lai i na hmaiah an kun lai. Na lianhngannak kha an thangṭhat lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zeicahtiah Pathian, nangmah lawnglawng hi a ṭhawngmi na si, nangmah lawnglawng hi khuaruahhar a tuah khotu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa, tuah seh ti na ka duhmi kha ka cawnpiak law na nawl kha fel tein ka zulh lai; ka lungthin a dih umnak in na rian ka ṭuan nakhnga ka cawnpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lungthin dihlak in kan thangṭhat lai, Maw Bawipa ka Pathian; na lianhngannak cu a zungzal in ka chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak cu zeitluk in dah ka caah a ngan! Thlan tawne in na ka khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Pathian, miruamkai pawl nih an ka fuh, nangmah zei i an rel lomi miṭhalo pawl nih thah an ka zalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa, nang cu zaangfahnak le dawtnak in a khatmi Pathian na si; thin a fual i zaangfahnak a ngei zungzal i zumhawktlak a si zungzalmi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keimah leiah i mer law ka zaangfah tuah; ka nu nih a rak in biak bantukin kei zong nih kan biak ve caah, thazang ṭhawnnak ka pe law ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa, na ṭhatnak kha ka cungah langhter ko, cu tikah keimah a ka huami hna nih khan hnangamnak le bawmhnak na ka pek kha an hmuh lai i an ning a zak lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian nih tlang thiang cungah a khualipi kha a sak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua cu, Israel ram chung i hmun dang vialte nakin a dawt deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian nih nangmah kong ah a chimmi bia sunglawi cu ngai tuah, Maw Pathian khualipi; Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka nawl a ngaimi miphun hna cazin kha ka ṭial tikah, Izipt le Babilon kha ka telh chih hna lai; cun Filistia le Tair le Ethiopia zong kha, Jerusalem ta nan si tiah ka ti hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion kong ah cun, miphun vialte kha Zion ta an si dih ti a si lai i Cungnung Bik nih a ṭhawnter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa nih miphun hna cazin kha a ṭial lai i annih cu Jerusalem khuami hna chungah khan a telh chih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlasa mi pawl le milam mi pawl nih khan an dihlak in na thangṭhatnak hla kha an sak lai. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian, ka khamhtu, chun nitlak in ka au i zan ah na hmaika ah ka ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak ko sawh law nangmah bawmhnak hal in ka aunak cu ka ngaihpiak ko sawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Harnak tam tuk nih an ka tlunhnawh i thlankhor an ka phakpi dengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thihnak a phan dengmangmi hna bantuk kha ka si ve i ka thazang vialte a lo dih cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithi hna lakah khan kaltak ka si ko; ral kut in a thimi an thlan chung i a it komi hna bantuk ka si, annih cu na philh diam cang hna i bawmh khawh a si in an si ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlan khor a thuhnak ka ah khan na ka hlonh, a thuk bik le a mui bik khor chungah khan na ka thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thinhunnak nih rit ngaiin a ka nenh i na thinhunnak tilet nih khan a ka khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hawikom kha na ka chuh hna i annih nih a fih in an ka fih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei cu thong ah ka tla i ka luat kho lo; harnak ka in ruangah ka mit zong a rawk dih. Bawipa, ni fate in kan auh i nangmah sinah thlacam in ka kut ka hler.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuaruahhar na tuahmi hna cu mithi caah maw an si? Mithi cu maw a tho hna in nangmah an thangṭhatmi cu an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak cu thlan chungah maw chim a si i zumhawktlak na sinak cu rawhralnak hmun ah cun dah chim a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuaruahharmi thil na tuahmi cu muihnak hmun ah cun maw hmuh an si i na ṭhatnak cu rawhralnak hmun ah cun dah hmuh a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, ka bawm ko sawh, tiin kan auh; zing fate in na sinah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa, zeicahdah na ka hlawt? Zeicahdah na ka thuhtak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ngakchiat lio tein temhnak ka ing lengmang i thihnak ka naih zungzal; dan na ka tatmi ka phorhnak ah hin ka ba cikcek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭih a nungmi na thinhunnak nih khan a ka khuh i na mi tuknak nih khan holh kho loin a ka tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chun nitlak in tilian bang an ka kulh; a kenkip in an ka chuahhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hawikom ṭha bik hna hmanh nih khan an ka chuahtak; ka ca i a tangmi hawikom cu muihnak lawnglawng kha a si ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, a fekmi na dawtnak cu hla in ka sak zungzal ko lai i zumhawktlak na sinak cu ka chim thluangthluan ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun lai ti kha ka hngalh, zumhawktlak na sinak cu van tlukin a fek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naa thawh i, “Ka thimmi sinah bia kaa kam cang; ka sal David cu bia ka kam i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Na tefa pakhat cu siangpahrang a si zungzal lai; na pennak cu zungzal in ka hmunhter lai,’ ka ti,” na ti. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vancung pathian hna nih khin khuaruahharmi thil na tuahmi hna cu hla in an sak hna; Bawipa, zumhawktlak na sinak cu hla in an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa, vancung i a ummi khi nangmah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo, pathian hna lakah hin ahohmanh nangmah tluk an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah cu pathian hna nih an khuakhannak bu chungah khan an in upat i na kiang i a ummi vialte nih khan an in ṭih dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian, ahohmanh nangmah tluk i a ṭhawngmi an um lo; zeizong vialte ah nang cu zumhawktlak na si, Bawipa ;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nangmah nih rilipi cu na uk i a tilet cu na daihter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Limkeng Rahab cu na tei i na thah; a liannganmi na ṭhawnnak in na ral cu na tei hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawlei hi na ta a si, van zong khi na ta a si ko; vawlei le a cung i a ummi thil vialte hi na sermi an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nangmah nih Chaklei le Thlanglei kha na ser hna, Tabor Tlang le Hermon Tlang nih lunglawmhnak in hla in an in thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na lianhngan! Zeitluk in dah na ṭhawn!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pennak cu dinnak le biading cungah a hram bunh a si, na tuahmi thil kip chungah hin dawtnak le zumhawktlak sinak an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hla in nangmah an biami cu milunglawm an si, na zaangfahnak ceunak chung i a ummi cu lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmah thawngin chun nitlak an i lawm i na ṭhat ruangah nangmah cu an in thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah nih teinak ngan pipi na kan pek, na zaangfahnak thawngin teinak cu kan hmu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cu ti kan hmuhnak cu a kan hupphengtu kha nangmah thimmi a si caah a si; nangmah Israel Mi Thiang nih kan siangpahrang cu na kan pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zumhawktlak a simi na sal hna sinah hlan liopi ah langhnak in bia na chim i, “Ralkap min thang pakhat cu bawiluchin ka chinh cang; mizapi hna chungin thimmi kha bawiṭhutdan cu ka pek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sal David cu ka thim cang i nan siangpahrang ah ka ser cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thazang cu a sinah a um zungzal lai i ka ṭhawnnak nih a ṭhawnter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ral nih zeitikhmanh ah an tei lai lo i miṭhalo nih an tei bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ral cu ka rial dih hna lai i amah a huatu cu ka thah hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah cu ka dawt zungzal lai i a cungah zumhawktlak in ka um zungzal lai; ral teinak kha ka pek zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A penmi a ram cu Mediterranean Rili in Zufrates Tiva tiang ka phakter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keimah cu a ka thawh lai i, ‘Nangmah cu ka pa le ka Pathian na si; a ka hupphengtu le ka khamhtu na si,’ a ka ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah cu ka fater ah ka ser lai i siangpahrang vialte lak i a ngan bik ka siter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A sin i bia kaa kammi cu ka tuah zungzal lai i amah he kan biakamnak cu zungzal in a hmun lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tefa pakhat cu siangpahrang a si zungzal lai; a bawiṭhutdan cu van a hmunh chung paoh a hmun ve lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Sihmanhsehlaw a tefa hna nih khan ka nawlbia an zulh duh lo i ka phung ningin an nun lo i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ka cawnpiakmi hna kha zei ah an rel lo i ka chimhmi hna kha an zulh lo ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />an sualnak ruangah khan dan ka tat hna lai i palhnak an tuahmi ruangah khan fungfek in ka tuk hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw David dawt kha cu ka ngol lai lo, bia ka kamhmi zong kha ka tlolh lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amah he bia kan i kamnak kha ka hrawk lai lo, amah sin i bia ka kammi cu pakhatte hmanh ka let ṭhan lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Voi khat ah zungzal ca in bia kaa kam; cu kaa kammi cu: ‘David cu ka hleng bal lai lo,’ ti hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tefa a ngei zungzal hna lai i ni a tlan chung paoh cu a pennak kha keimah nih ka cawnghpiak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thlapa cu van ah khin zumhawktlak tehte a si bantukin cu thlapa bantuk cun a pennak cu a fek lai,” na ti. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw na thimmi siangpahrang cungah cun na thin a hung i amah cu na kaltak i na hlawt cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na sal sin i bia na kammi cu na hrawh i a bawiluchin cu leidip lakah na hlonh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A khua kulhnak cu na chimh dih hna i a ralhau cu rawk relrul in na kaltak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aa chawkmi paoh nih a thil kha an fir i a innpa pawl nih an nihsawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Teinak cu a ral hna tu kha na pek hna i annih cu lunglawm in na umter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A hriamnam cu santlailo ah na ser hna i raltuknak hmun ah na sunghter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A bawifung kha na lakpiak i a bawiṭhutdan cu vawlei ah na hrilh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A kum nih a phak hlanah na tarter i hmaichiatnak nih a zual in a zual. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, zei can dah naa thuh lai? Zungzal in maw naa thuh lai? Na thinhunnak cu mei bangin zei can dah a alh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bawipa, minung cu a nunnak hi zeitluk in dah a tawi ti kha philh hlah; mi vialte cu a thi dingin na kan ser dih kha philh hlah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahodah thi loin a nung zungzal kho lai? Zeitindah mi nih cun thlan cu a hrial khawh lai? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, hlanlio i na dawtnak na rak langhtermi hna kha khuazei ah dah an si dih? David bia na rak kamhmi kha tah, khuazei ah dah an um kun?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Na sal nih nihsawhnak ka in kha philh hlah law Pathian zei i a rel lomi hna nih an ka serhsatnak kha philh sawh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bawipa, na thimmi siangpahrang hi na ral pawl nih an zawmhtaih hringhran ko! A kalnak kip ah khan an nihsawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bawipa cu zungzal in thangṭhat si ko seh! Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah cu kan inn na si zungzal!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlang an sem hlan le vawlei kha na ser hlan in nangmah cu zungzal in, hramthawknak zong um lo donghnak zong um loin Pathian na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minung cu an rak sining ah khan kir ṭhan u na ti hna, vawlei ah na canter ṭhan hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum thong khat hi nang caah cun ni khat bantuk a si; a dih cangmi nizan bantuk kha a si ko, zan khat chung i suimilam caan tawite pakhat bantuk khi a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tilian bantukin minung cu na fenh hna; zan mang bantuk men an si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zinglei ah a hung keo i a hung ṭhang i a par i zanlei ah cun a carmi belh bantuk men an si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thinhunnak nih a kangh in a kan kangh i na thinlinhnak nih kan thin a kan phanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan sualnak cu na hmaiah na chiah hna, a thli tein kan sualnak cu na hmuh dih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thinhunnak nih kan chan a kan tawiter; kan nunnak cu fifik bantuk men in donghnak a phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan chan cu kum sawm sarih a si ko, kan thazang a ṭhawn deuh le sawm riat a si; cu hmanh ah retheihnak le harnak lawng kha kan ing, kan nunnak cu a dih zau i kan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thinhunnak hmual cu aho nih dah fiang ngaingai in an hngalh? Na thinlinhnak nih zei bantuk thil ṭihnung dah a chuahter khawh ti kha aho nih dah an hngalh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan nunnak hi zeitluk in dah a tawi ti kha kan hngalhter law cuticun kan fim deuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, zei can dah kan cungah lung ṭhul loin na um lai? Na sal hna kan cungah hin zaangfahnak ngei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zing fate in a fekmi na dawtnak in kan khahter, cuticun hla kan sa lai i kan nun chung vialte kan i lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harnak kan in lio caan le kum chungah kan cungah na rak tluntermi ngaihchiatnak zat khan atu cu lunglawmhnak kan pe tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kannih na sal rual hi khuaruahharmi thil na tuahmi cu kan hmuhter law kan tefa hna nih a liannganmi na ṭhawnnak cu hmu ve hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian, kan cungah na thluachuahnak cu um seh law kan thil timi kip ah khua awng kan pemhter ko! Kan thil timi kip ah khua awng kan pemhter ko!
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himnak hmuh duh ah Cung Nung Bik kha a fuhmi le Lianngan Bik huhphenhnak chung ah aa dormi nih cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Bawipa, nangmah cu a ka chanhtu le a ka hupphengtu na si! Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si; nangmah cu kan bochan,” an ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmuh lomi thil ṭihnung vialte le thihnak zawtnak vialte chungin him tein an huhphenh hrimhrim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thla in an huh lai i him tein na um lai; zumhawktlak a sinak nih khan an huhphenh lai i him tein an umter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan i a chuakmi ṭihnung kha na ṭih hna lai lo, chun ah ruahpak loin a chuakmi cantiang zong kha na ṭih lai lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mui lak i a ummi rai zong kha na ṭih lai lo i chun ceu i mi a that cuahmahmi ngal-eu zong kha na ṭih lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pawng ah mi thong khat an thi ko lai, na velchum ah thong hra zong an thi ko lai, sihmanhsehlaw nang cu zeihmanh nih an tawng lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu zeitindah dantatnak a in kha na zoh lai i na hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa cu chanhtu ah naa ser i Cungnung Bik cu hupphengtu ah naa ser caah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />harnak zeihmanh nih an tlunhnawh kho lai lo i vanchiatnak zeihmanh na inn a phan lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kalnak kip i nangmah zohkhenhtu dingah Pathian nih a vancungmi kha a chiah hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kut in an in dawmh lai i lung ah na ke kha naa khawng lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chiandeih le rul kha na lamh hna lai, chiandeih ṭih nungnung le rul sivai ṭhawngṭhawng kha na lamh chih len hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian nih, “A ka dawmi cu ka khamh hna lai i a ka hngalmi cu ka huhphenh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An ka auh tikah ka leh hna lai i harnak an in tikah ka umpi hna lai. Ka chuah hna lai i ka upat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laksawng ah nun sau ka pek hna lai i ka khamh hrimhrim hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa sinah lawmhnak hla sak cu zeitluk in dah a nuamh! Cungnung Bik Pathian, nangmah min upat in hlasak cu zeitluk in dah a nuamh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hri tampi a ngeimi tingtang le thonglawi aw dawh he, a fekmi na dawtnak thangṭhat in zingfate in hlasak le zumhawktlak na sinak zanfate in thanh cu a nuam hringhranmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, thil lianngan na tuahmi nih ka lung an ka lawmhter, na tuahmi thil ruangah cun lawmhnak in hla ka sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na tuahmi thil cu zeitluk in dah an ngan! Na ruahnak cu zeitluk in dah a thuk!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihrut nih an hngalh khawh lo i lungtlawmmi nih an theihthiam khawh lomi cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />miṭhalo kha belh bantukin an ṭhan i thil ṭhalo a tuahmi hna kha thluachuah an hmuh hi a si; sihmanhsehlaw rawhralnak an hmu ko lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zeicahtiah Bawipa, nangmah cu uktu ngan bik kha zungzal in na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ral cu an thi lai i miṭhalo vialte cu raldohnak ah an sung lai i an i ṭhek dih lai ti kha kan hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah nih fungtum bantuk ṭhawng ah na ka ser; thluachuahnak na ka pek i ka lung aa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ral an sungh kha ka hmuh i miṭhalo pawl an ai len kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miding mi cu tumkung bantukin an hninghno lai i Lebanon tlang sidar thingkung bantukin an ṭhang lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Annih cu Bawipa inn chungah cinmi thing bantuk, Bawipa biakinn chungah hninghno ngaiin a um i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an tar tik hmanh ah thei a tlai lengmang i a zungzal in hring dildel in a um i a ṭhawng ngaimi bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi nih hin Bawipa cu a ding ti le a ka chanhtu ka lungpi chungah cun palhnak zeihmanh a um lo, ti kha a langhter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si! Rumra in aa thuam i a tai cu thazang in aa sawmh. Vawlei cu a umnak hmun ah khan fek tein a chiah i a hninh in hninh khawh a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa, na bawiṭhutdan cu a hramthawk tein a fek i nangmah cu caan thawk hlan in na rak um cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa, rilipi cu a awn, a tilet cu an awn hluahmah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu vancung ah khin uktu ngan bik a si, rilipi aw thawng nakin a ngan deuh rili tilet nakin a ṭhawng deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, na phunglam cu zungzal in an hmun, na Biakinn cu zungzal in zungzal tiang a thiang taktak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, nang cu phuhlamtu Pathian na si, na thinhunnak kha langhter tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah cu mi vialte bia a ceihtu na si, tho law miporhlaw kha hmuh awk an i tlakmi dantatnak kha pe hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miṭhalo pawl hi zei can dah an i lawmh lai? Zei can dah an i lawmh ko rih lai, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zei can dah ṭhat lonak a tuahtu pawl hi ruamkai in an um rih lai i sualnak an tuahmi kha an i porhlawt rih lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, na mi kha an rial hna, nangmah ta a simi kha an hrem hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuhmei le ngakṭah kha an thah hna i kan ram chungah a ummi khual kha an nawn hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An i thawh i, “ Bawipa nih cun a kan hmuh lem lai maw? Bawipa nih cun a hngalh lem lai maw?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mi hna, zeitindah cu tluk cun nan hruh khawh? Zeitik ah dah nan hngalh khawh te lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan hna a sertu cu Pathian a si, zeitindah hna sertu Pathian nih cun thei loin a um khawh lai? Kan mit a sertu cu Pathian a si, zeitindah mit sertu nih cun hmu loin a um khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun vialte cu amah ukmi an si, dantat loin a um hna hnga maw? Mi vialte a cawnpiaktu cu amah a si, hngal loin a um kho hnga maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa nih an ruahmi cu a hngalh dih ko; zeitluk in dah an ruahnak pakpalawng a si ti cu a hngalh dih ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih na chimhhrinmi, na phunglam na cawnpiakmi hna cu lunglawmmi an si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miṭhalo mi caah thlan cawh a si hlantiang, harnak caan ah dinhnak na pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi cu a hlaw hna lai lo, amah ta a simi cu a zamtak hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biaceihnak hmun ah dinnak kha a um ṭhan lai i miding paohpaoh nih an zulh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahodah miṭhalo a ka dohpitu kha nan si? Ahodah ṭhat lonak a tuahmi hna a ka dohpitu kha nan si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa nih rak kan bawm hlah seh law, mithi khua kha khulrang tein kan rak phan diam ko hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ke kha an nal cuahmah tikah, Bawipa, na dawtnak nih a ka tlaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuaruahhar vansang au in ka um tikah na ka hnemh i ka lung na ka lawmhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa, ziknawh a eimi biaceihtu hna he cun zeitinhmanh in nan i tlak kho lo, dinlonak kha dinnak ah a ser i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />miṭha kha a rawi a phiar i a sual lomi kha thih dantatnak a pemi hna he cun a komh in nan i kom kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kei cu Bawipa nih na ka huhphenh i ka Pathian nih him tein na ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Annih cu an ṭhat lo ruangah dan na tat hna lai i an sual ruangah na hrawh hna lai; Bawipa kan Pathian nih na hrawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ra u law Bawipa cu thangṭhat u sih. Kannih a kan khamhtu Lungpi cu lunglawmhnak in hla in thangṭhat u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lunglawmhnak in amah hmaiah chuak u sih law lawmhnak le thangṭhatnak hla sa u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Bawipa cu a ṭhawngmi Pathian a si, pathian dang vialte cung siangpahrang ṭhawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vawleicung vialte hi amah nih a uk dih, lungkua thuk bik in tlang sang bik tiang a uk dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah nih a sermi rili kha a uk i amah nih a sermi vawlei zong kha a uk fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ra tuah u, kun u sih law bia u sih; a kan Sertu Bawipa hmaiah cun kan khuk i bil u sih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah cu kan Pathian a si, kannih cu a kan zohkhenhmi kan si, a kan cawmmi tuurun kan si. A chimmi kha nihin cu ngai tuah u; a bia cu hihi a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nan pupa hna kha Meribah ah lung hak in an rak um bang khan nannih cu um hlah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an ca i ka tuahmi kha an hmu ko nain khaka ah khan an ka hneksak i an ka zuamcawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawm li chung awlok an ka chonh i, “Annih cu ka nawlbia a ngai duh lo i ka cungah zumhawktlak in a um duh lomi an si,’ ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin a hung i, “Dinhnak ka pek hnanak ding ram chungah cun an lut hrimhrim lai lo,’ tiin chiatser in bia ka chim,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu hla thar in thangṭhat u, vawlei mi vialte hna, Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat u, a kan khamhnak thawng ṭha kha nifate in chim u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miphun hna sinah a sunparnak kha thanh u, mi vialte kha thil lianngan a tuahmi cu chim hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu a lian a ngan i sang piin thangṭhat awk a si; pathian dang vialte nakin ṭih awk deuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miphun dang hna pathian cu siasal men an si, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih cun van khi a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunparnak le rumra cu a velchum ah an um i lianhngannak le dawhnak cu a biakinn chungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vawleicung mi vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u, a sunparnak le a ṭhawnnak kha thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A min he aa tlakmi sunparnak kha Bawipa cu pe u, raithawinak kha rak i put u law a biakinn chungah ra lut u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Thiang Mi cu a hung chuah tikah a hmaiah khan kun u; vawleicung mi vialte hna, a hmaiah cun a ther in ther u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun vialte kha, “ Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si, Vawlei cu a umnak hmun ah hninh khawh loin fek tein a bunh, mi vialte kha dinnak in bia a ceih hna lai,” tiah chim hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawlei le van, i lawm tuah u. Rili le a chung i a ummi thilnung vialte hna, awn u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lo le a chung i a ummi thil vialte hna, i lawm u! Cun tupi chung i a ummi thingkung hna cu lunglawm in Bawipa hmaiah an au lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />zeicahtiah vawlei uk awkah a ra cang; vawleicung mi vialte kha dingte le i ruang tein a uk hna lai. ruang tein a uk hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si, maw vawlei i lawm tuah! Rili chung i a ummi tikulh vialte hna, i lawm u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuadawm le muihnak kha a velchum in an um; a pennak cu dinnak le biading cungah a hram a bunh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmaiah mei cu a kal i a velchum i a ummi a ral kha a kangh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nimtlau nih vawlei kha a ceuh dih, vawlei nih cun a hmuh i a ther.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa hmaiah tlang cu khuaiseng bantukin an ti. vawlei cung dihlak Bawipa hmaiah cun khuaiseng bantukin an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van nih khin a dinnak kha an chim i mi vialte nih a sunparnak kha an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siasal a biami vialte kha an ning a zak dih, an siasal aa porhlawmi vialte kha an ning a zak dih; pathian vialte cu a hmaiah an kun dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih na tuahmi biathlehnak ruangah, Zion mi cu an lung aa lawm i Judah ram khua hna cu an tha a nuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Bawipa, nangmah cu vawleicung dihlak a uktu na si; pathian vialte hna nakin a let tam piin na ngan deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak a huami kha Bawipa nih a dawt hna, a mi kha a huhphenh hna i miṭhalo mi pawl kut chung khan a chuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ceunak cu miding mi hna cungah khan a tlang i lunglawmhnak cu miṭha mi hna cungah khan a tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil ruangah, a dingmi nannih vialte i lawm tuah u. Mi Thiang nih a tuahmi kha philh hlah u law amah kha lawmhnak in thangṭhat u. amah kha lawmhnak in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu hla thar in thangṭhat tuah u, khuaruahharmi thil kha a tuah hna! A ṭhawnnak le a thiangmi a thazang in ral kha a tei hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih cun ral a tei hnanak thawng kha a thanh i a khamhnak ṭhawnnak kha miphun vialte a hngalhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi bia a kamhmi hna kha a zulh i an cungah a fekmi dawtnak a ngei i zumhawktlak in a um. Kan Pathian nih ral a teinak kha mi vialte nih khuazakip ah an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vawlei mi vialte hna, lunglawm in Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat tuah u; lawmhnak hla in thangṭhat u law a au in au u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa thangṭhatnak hla cu sa u, thangṭhatnak hla cu tingtang he ṭhuan hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Muko le tuukawng ki tum hna u law Bawipa, siangpahrang hmaiah cun lunglawm in au u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rili le a chung i a ummi thilnung vialte hna, awn tuah u! Vawlei le a cung i a ummi thilnung vialte hna, hlasa tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw rilipi hna, nan kut beng tuah u; maw tlang hna, Bawipa hmaiah cun lunglawm in hlasa tuah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />zeicahtiah amah cu vawlei uk awkah a ra cang. Vawleicung mi vialte cu dinnak le ruannak in a uk hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si, mi vialte cu an ther dih; cherubim cung i a bawiṭhutdan cungah khan a ṭhu, vawlei cu aa hnin dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu Zion ah lianngan ngaiin a um, miphun vialte kha a uk dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lian a ngan i rumra a ngeimi a min cu mi vialte nih an thangṭhat lai. Amah cu Mi Thiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A liannganmi Siangpahrang, nang cu ahmaanmi thil a duhmi na si; Israel mi cungah ding tein le a tlari in thil na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian cu thangṭhat u; a bawiṭhutdan hmaiah khan amah cu bia u, amah cu Mi Thiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses le Aaron cu a tlangbawi an si, Samuel cu a sinah thla a rak cammi pakhat a si; Bawipa cu an auh i a leh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuadawm tom chungin a chawnh hna, a pekmi hna nawlbia le phunglam kha an zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian, na mi nih na sinah thla kan camnak kha na kan leh; nangmah cu sualnak a ngaithiam khotu Pathian na si kha na kan hngalhter i kannih cu a sual lo ah na kan rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian cu thangṭhat u, a tlang cungah cun amah cu bia u. Bawipa kan Pathian cu Mi Thiang a si!
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vawlei mi vialte hna, lunglawm in Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu lunglawm tein bia u law lunglawmhnak hla he a hmaiah cun ra chuak u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu Pathian a si kha zeitikhmanh ah philh hlah u! A kan sertu cu amah a si i kannih cu amah ta kan si; a mi kan si i a tuurun kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kutka chungah cun lawmhnak he lut tuah u, a tual ah cun thangṭhatnak hla he lut tuah u; amah cu lawm u law thangṭhat tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭha; a fekmi a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun, zumhawktlak a sinak cu chan vialte tiangin a hmun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hla cu dinnak le zumhawktlak sinak kong a si, cu hla cu kan sakpiak lai, Maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka cungah zei khom hmanh tlung seh law, fimnak le soi awk um lo a simi lam kha zulh kaa zuam lai. Ka inn chungah hin lungthiang in khua ka sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thurmi tinhmi zeihmanh ka ngei lai lo; zumhtlaklo si kha a huat in ka huat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hrokhrawlnak lungthin kha ka hlawt dih lai i ṭhat lonak kha a ruah hmanh ruat loin ka um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi congoih a hmangmi kha daihter kaa zuam hna lai i miporhlaw hna le miruamkai hna he cabuai i ṭhut ṭi cu ka hrial lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumhawktlak bikbik kha ka hawikom ah kaa thim hna lai i ka sal cu an nunning soi awk a um lomi kha an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka inn chungah mi thangchiat hmangmi kha ahohmanh an um kho lai lo, ka hmuh khawhnak hmun ah mi lihchim hmang cu an dir kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat hnu ni khat in miṭhalo cu ka daihter hna lai i Ṭhat lonak a tuahtu vialte cu Bawipa khuapi chungin ka dawi dih hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka thlacamnak cu ka ngaihpiak law nangmah bawmhnak hal ah ka aunak cu ka theihpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harnak ka in tikah hin ka thuhtak hlah! Ka aunak cu ka ngaihpiak law khulrang in ka let tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu meikhu bangin a lo, ka pum cu mei bangin a kang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram car bangin ka nunnak cu a uai, rawl ei duhnak zeihmanh ka ngei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Fak piin ka hrum i ka ai, ka ruh le ka cuar lawng ka si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thetse ram i a ummi va bantuk khi ka si, chuahtakmi khua rop i chimbu bantuk ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hngilh kho loin ka um, inncung va, amah lawngin a um i a ci a haimi bantuk ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chun nitlak in ka ral nih an ka nihsawh, nihchuak capo i a ka saitu pawl nih ka min cu chiatsernak ah an hman.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rawl cu vutcam a si i ka dinmi cu mitthli he aa cawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zeicahtiah ka cungah na thin a hun caah a si. Na ka cawi i na ka hlonh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu zanlei sang thladem bantuk men a si; Kei cu ram bantuk ka si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa, nangmah cu siangpahrang na si zungzal ko; chan vialte nih an in philh lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tho lai i Zion cu na zaangfah lai, a cung i zaangfah ngeih caan cu a phan cang; atu hi cu caan cu a si cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hrawh dih cikcek a si ko nain na salle nih kan duh ṭhiamṭhiam, a rawk dih ko nain a cungah zaangfahnak kan ngei ṭhiamṭhiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miphun kip nih Bawipa cu an ṭih lai, vawlei cung siangpahrang vialte nih a ṭhawnnak cu an ṭih lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa nih Zion kha a remh ṭhan tikah Bawipa lianhngannak cu a lang lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kaltak cia a mi kha an thlacamnak a ngaihpiak hna lai i a theihpiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil kha a ra lai ding chan caah ṭial tuah u, cuticun a chuak rih lomi nih amah kha an thangṭhat khawh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa nih a sangmi a hmunthiang khin a run cuanh, vancung khin vawlei cu a run cuanh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cu a run cuanh cu thongtla pawl an aihramnak theih awk le thah awk i biaceih cangmi hna luatter awkah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa min cu mi nih Zion ah an chim lai i Jerusalem ah amah cu an lawmh lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />cucu zeitik ah dah a si lai ti ahcun, miphun hna le pennak hna kha hmunkhat ah an i pumh i Bawipa kha an biak tikah a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka chan ṭim hmanh ti hlanah Bawipa nih ka thazang a ka derter i ka nunnak kha a tawiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka Pathian, atu cu ka la rih hlah, ka tar hlanah cun ka la rih hlah! Bawipa, nang cu zungzal in a ummi na si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hlanpi ah vawlei cu na rak ser cang, Nangmah nih na kut hrimhrim in van khi na ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Van le vawlei cu an lo dih lai, sihmanhsehlaw nang cu na hmun lai; annih cu puan bangin an ṭet lai. Puan bangin na thlen hna lai i an lo lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw nang cu zungzal in nangmah bon na si ko i na nunnak a dong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kan fale cu him tein khua an sa lai i an tefa hna cu nangmah nih zungzal in na huhphenh hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah! Ka sining vialte, a min thiang cu thangṭhat tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat law zeitluk in dah zaangfahnak a ngeih kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sualnak vialte kha a ka ngaihthiam i ka zawtnak vialte kha a ka damter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thlan chungin a ka khamh i dawtnak le zaangfahnak he thluachuah a ka pek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka nunnak cu thil ṭha in a khahter i cucaah ka no peng i mupi bantukin ka ṭhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hremnak a ingmi kha biaceih tikah Bawipa nih a ṭanh hna i an hmuh awk hnga a simi kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses kha aa tinhmi cu a chimh i Israel mi kha thil lianngan a tuahmi cu a hmuhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu zaangfahnak le dawtnak in a khat, a thin a fual i a fekmi dawtnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mawhchiat chih lengmang kha a hmang lo i thinhung zungzal in a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmuh awk kan i tlakning in dan a kan tat lo, kan sualnak le ṭhat lonak kan tuahmi ning zongin a kan lehrul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van cu vawlei nakin a san deuh ngaingai bantukin a dawtnak cu amah a ṭihmi hna caah cun a ngan ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nichuahlei le nitlaklei an i hlat tluk khin kan sualnak cu kanmah he i hlat ah a kan ṭhialpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pale nih an fale an zaangfah hna bantuk khin Bawipa nih amah a ṭihmi cu a zaangfah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zei in dah ser kan si kha a hngalh i leidip men kan si kha a philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minung cu a nunnak hi ram bantuk men a si ko; a hung ṭhang i ramlak pangpar bangin a hung par.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun thli a hung hrang ciammam i a lo ai, ahohmanh nih an hmu ṭhan ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih amah a upatmi hna a dawtnak hna cu, zungzal in a hmun i a ṭhatnak nih chan vialte tiang a nguh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a biakamnak a zulmi le a nawlbia a ngaimi hna cungah cun Bawipa ṭhatnak cu cu bantuk cun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa nih a bawiṭhutdan cu vancung ah khin a hun; zeizong vialte cungah siangpahrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nannih a ṭhawng i a liannganmi vancungmi hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u; a nawlbia kha a ngai i a chimmi a tuahmi vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vancung i a ummi ṭhawnnak vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u, a duhnak a tuahmi a sal vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sermi thil vialte hna, a pennak chung hmun zakip ah Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah u! Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah!
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah! Bawipa ka Pathian, zeitluk in dah na lianhngan! Sunparnak le lianhngannak in naa thuam i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ceunak in naa tuam. Van khi puan thlam bantukin na samh hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cunglei i a ummi ti cungah khin na inn cu na sak. Khuadawm cu rangleng ah na hman hna i thlitu cu an thla cung cit awkah na hman hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thlitu cu na lamkaltu ah na hman hna i nimtlau cu na sal ah na hman hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vawlei cu a umnak hmun ah khan fek tein na bunh i ahohmanh nih an ṭhial kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vawleicung cu rili in puan bangin na khuh i a tlang cu ti nih a khuh hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw ti cu na sik hna tikah an le na au thawng kha an theih tikah an zam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlang cung khan nelrawn ah an vung luang i an ca i na sermi hmun ah khan an um;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an lonh khawh lomi ramri kha na chiah i vawlei kha an khuh ṭhan kho ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nelrawn ah cerh kha na putter hna i ti cu tlang le tlang karah an luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ramlak saram kha ti din awk an pek hna i ramlak laa nih khan an tihal riam in an din hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an pawngkam thingkung cungah vate nih bu an i ser i hla an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vancung khin tlang cungah ruah na run surter i vawlei cu na thluachuahnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saṭil caah ram na khohter, minung hman awk caah thing na khohter cucaah minung nih cun ti-rawl kha an cin khawh hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />an lung a lawmhtertu dingah mitsur hang kha an chuahter; an tha an nuamtertu dingah oliv chiti kha an chuahter i thazang a petu dingah rawl an chuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon Tlang sidar thingkung cu ruah tampi an hmu, annih cu Bawipa nih amah caah aa cinmi thingkung an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuka ah cun vate nih bu an i ser i vaca nih farkung ah bu an i ser ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sathar kha tlang sang ah an um i sahniar cu lungpang ah an i thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thla relnak ah thlapa na ser, ni nih khin tlak caan amah tein aa hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zan kha na ser i mui ah saram kha an chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chiandeih no kha rawl an kawlpah in an awn, Pathian nih a pekmi hna rawl kha an kawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a chuah in an kir i an kua chungah khan an bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun mi cu an rianṭuan awkah an chuak i zanlei tiang an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa, na sermi thil hi an tam hringhran ko! An dihlak in fimnak in na ser hna. Vawlei cu na sermi thil in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ngan ngaingai i a kau ngaingaimi rilipi kha na ser, a chungah thilnung a hme he a ngan he a rel rel cawk loin an um;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a cungah sangphawlawng kha an kal i a chungah Leviathan rulpi kha lente aa celh, Leviathan cu rili chung rulpi nangmah nih na sermi kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An herhmi an rawl hmuhnak ah, an dihlak in nangmah kha an in bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang nih na pek hna i an ei, rawl cu na pek hna i an khim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Naa mer tikah an awlok a chong, na thaw kha na tlaihkanh hna tikah an thi i an chuahkehnak vawlei ah khan an kir ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw thaw na pek hna tikah an nung; vawlei cu nunnak thar na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa sunparnak cu zungzal in hmun ko seh, a sermi thil cungah Bawipa cu i lawm ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vawlei kha a zoh tikah vawlei cu a ther in a ther, tlang kha a tawngh tikah meikhu kha a chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka nun chung vialte Bawipa cu hla in ka thangṭhat lai; ka nunnak a um chung ka Pathian thangṭhatnak hla cu ka sa lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian nih lunglawmhnak a ka pek zat in, ka thangṭhatnak hla nih amah cu a lunglawmhter ve seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Misual mi cu vawleicung hin hloh si hna seh, miṭhalo cu um ti hna hlah seh. Ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko! Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko!
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa sinah lawmhnak bia chim u, a lianhngannak kha thanh u; cun a tuahmi thil kha miphun vialte chim hna u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah cu hla in thangṭhat u, thangṭhat u! A tuahmi thil khuaruahhar vialte kha chim u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kannih cu amah mi kan si caah kan i lawm, Bawipa rian a ṭuanmi vialte i lawm u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawmhnak hmuh awkah amah cu va fuh u, a hmaika ah khan va um zungzal u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sal Abraham tefa hna, Pathian nih a liannganmi khuaruahhar a tuahmi le biakhiahnak a tuahmi kha philh hna hlah u, a thimmi Jakob tefa hna, philh hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan Pathian a si; a nawlbia cu vawlei cung dihlak caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biakamnak a sermi cu zungzal in a zulh lai, a biakamnak cu chan thong khat tiang a zulh lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham le Isak he a tuahmi biakamnak kha a zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nih Israel he zungzal a hmunmi biakamnak cu a ser, Jakob he a biakamnak in aa ṭem chih i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kanaan ram cu kan pek lai, cu ram cu nangmah ta a si lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian mi cu an rak tlawm i cu ram ah cun khual an rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram khat in ram khat ah an vai, peng khat in peng dang ah an pem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw annih cu ahohmanh kha a hremter hna lo i anmah ruangah siangpahrang kha a sik hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aa thawh i, “Ka thimmi ka sal cu tawng hna hlah u, ka profet cu fahnak pe hna hlah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An ram ah Bawipa nih mangṭam a tlunter i an rawl vialte kha a lakpiak dih hna tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mi pakhat kha an hmaiah a rak thlah, cu mipa cu sal i an zuarmi Josef kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ke ah hreng an khenh i a hngawng ah hngawngkual an bunh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A rak chim chungmi kha a tlin hlantiang, Bawipa nawl in hneksaknak kha a ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Izipt siangpahrang nih khan a chuahter, miphun tampi uktu nih khan a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ram uknak nawl kha a pek i a ram vialte uktu ah khan a ser;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />siangpahrang kut tang bawi vialte hna cungah khan nawl a ngei i siangpahrang lungthin cheutu hna cung zongah khan cawnpiaknak nawl a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu Izipt ram ah khan a vung kal i cuka ah cun a vung um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi hna cu fa tampi a ngeihter hna i an ral hna nakin ṭhawng deuh ah a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izipt mi cu a mi kha a huatter hna i a sal hna cungah khan hlennak in rian a ṭuanter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun a sal Moses le a thimmi Aaron kha a thlah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian hmelchunhnak kha an tuah i Izipt ram ah cun khuaruahharmi thil kha tampi an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ram cungah cun muihnak an tlunter, sihmanhsehlaw Izipt mi nih khan a nawl an ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An tiva cu thisen ah a canter hna i an nga cu a thah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram ah cun utlak an khat, siangpahrang inn chung hmanh ah khan an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian nih nawl a pek hna i fikfa le hmaisem nih an ram cu a zual in an zual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An ram ah khan ruah surter loin rial le ṭek lehlam kha a tlakter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An mitsur ruang le theipi kung kha a hrawh hna i thingkung kha a khiah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nawl a pek hna i khaubawk kha an hung chuak, a rel rel cawk loin an hung chuak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />an ram chung thil hring vialte kha an ei dih, rawl kung zong kha an ei dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Izipt mi innchungkhar cio i a chuak hmasa bik fapa paoh kha a thah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cun Israel mi kha a chuahpi hna, sui le ngun kha an i phorh, an dihlak in an ṭhawng i an ngan a dam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Izipt mi nih khan annih cu an ṭih hna caah an kal tikah khan Izipt mi cu an i lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A mi hna cungah cun khuadawm a zar i zan ah ceunak petu dingah mei a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An hal i nimte a pek hna, vancung in rawl khim tein a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lungpi kha a khuai i ti a chuak, thetse ram ah cun tiva bantukin a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A sal Abraham sinah a sermi a biakam thiang kha a philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cuticun a mi cu hlasak pah in a chuahpi hna i lunglawmh au thawng he a thimmi cu a kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ramdangmi an rak umnak ram kha a pek hna i an lo kha a coter hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />zeicahdah cuticun a tuah ti ahcun, ka mi nih ka nawl kha ngai hna seh law ka phunglam kha zul hna seh ti a duh caah a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u! Bawipa sinah lawmhnak bia chim tuah u, zeicahtiah amah cu a ṭha, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aho nih dah thil lianngan a tuahmi vialte cu a chim cawk lai? Aho nih dah zaa lak in an thangṭhat khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah nawl a zulmi cu mi lunglawm an si, a dingmi thil a tuahmi cu mi lunglawm an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mi hna na bawmh hna tikah ka philh hlah, Maw Bawipa , na khamh hna tikah kei zong ka telh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mi hna an ṭhancho cu ka hmuhter law na miphun an i lawmhnak ah cun ka telter ve, nangmah ta a simi hna an hmaihngalnak ah cun kei zong ka hmai ka hngalter ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan pupa hna an rak sual bantuk khan kannih zong kan sual ve, palhnak kha kan tuah ve i ṭhat lonak kha kan tuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izipt ram i a rak ummi kan pupa hna nih khan Pathian tuahmi thil khuaruahhar kha an hngalthiam lo, an cungah a dawtnak voi tampi a langhter kha an philh i Lianngan Bik cu Rili Sen ah khan an doh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw bia a kamh hna bangkhan a khamh hna, cu a khamh hna cu a liannganmi a ṭhawnnak langhternak caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rili Sen cu nawl a pek i a ro, cun a mi cu vawlei ro cung kal bantukin a kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A huatu hna kut chung khan a khamh hna i an ral kut chung khan a chuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An ral cu ti nih khan a phum dih hna i pakhat hmanh an tang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cu tikah a mi nih khan a biakam cu an zumh i hla in an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a tuahmi kha an philh ṭhan zau i amah ruahnak hal hmasa loin rian an ṭuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thetse ram ah khan an duhnak nih a tei hna caah Pathian kha hneksak an del;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />cucaah an halmi kha a pek hna i asinain rai ṭhalo kha an cungah a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thetse ram ah cun Moses kha an nahchuah, Bawipa sal thiang Aaron zong kha an nahchuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cu tikah vawlei nih khan a kaa a an i Dothan kha a dolh; Abiram le a innchungkhar kha a phum hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />anmah a zultu pawl kha mei nih a tlak hna i cu miṭhalo pawl cu mei nih cun a kangh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Horeb tlang ah sui cawfa kha an ser i cu siasal cu an biak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian sunparnak cu ram a eimi saram mui ah an thlen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izipt ram chungah khuaruahharmi thil a tuahmi thawngin Pathian nih a khamh hna, asinain cu Pathian cu an philh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuka ah cun khuaruahharmi thil tampi a tuah, Rili Sen ah cun thil ṭihnung tampi a tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah Pathian nih cun ka mi cu ka hrawh hna lai a ti; asinain a thimmi a sal Moses nih khan Pathian cu a thlauh i a thinhunnak nih khan a that hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram nuam kha zeirello in an um i bia a kamhmi hna kha an zum lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />an thlam chungah khan an um i an zai, Bawipa bia kha an ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cucaah a fakmi ralrinnak kha a pek hna i, “Thetse ram chungah hin ka thah hna lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cun nan tefa cu lawkihmi hna lakah ka ṭhek hna lai i ramdang ah ka thihter hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun Pathian mi pawl nih khan Peor ah cun Baal kha an biak ve i nunnak a ngei lomi pathian hna sinah rai an thawimi sa kha an ei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An thil tuahmi nih cun Bawipa cu a thin a phawh i rai ṭhalo nih a tlunhnawh hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw Finehas kha a dir riangmang i a sualmi kha dan a tat hna caah rai cu a ṭian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cu a tuahmi cu a caah dinnak ah relpiak a si i hmailei caan tiang zongin a si zungzal ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawipa cu a mi nih Meribah Cerh ah khan a thin an hunter i anmah ruangah cun Moses cu a awlok a chong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses cu a thin an hunter tuk hringhran caah a chim awk a si lomi tiang zong khan a chim phah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa nih a fial hna bang khan tuah loin lawkihmi cu an that hna lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />an ṭhit an vat lehlam hna i an ziaza kha an i cawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian mi nih cun siasal kha an biak hna i cucu an rawhnak a chuahtertu kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An fapale le an fanule kha lawkih pathian sinah rai ah an thawi hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a sual lomi an fanule le an fapale hna cu an thah hna i Kanaan mi siasal hna sinah khan raithawinak ah an pek hna; hi ti an thah hnanak nih hin vawlei kha a thurter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An thil tuahmi nih hin anmah cu a thurhnawmhter hna i Pathian sinah khan zumhawktlak in khua an sa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu a mi hna cungah khan a thin a hung i a fih in a fih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Annih cu Pathian bia lomi hna kut tangah khan a kaltak hna i an ral nih khan an uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An ral nih cun an rial hna i cawlcang kho loin an kut tangah cun an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi pawl cu voi tampi a khamh ko hna, sihmanhsehlaw amah doh tu kha an duhmi cu a si i sualnak chungah khan thuk chin lengmang in an pil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa nih cun an auh tikah khan a theih hna i an temhinnak kha a hmuhpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A biakamnak kha a hngalh camcinpiak hna i a nganmi a dawtnak ruangah a lung kha a thlen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Thong i a thlatu hna kha an cungah zaangfahnak a ngeihter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan Pathian, kan khamh tuah, miphun tampi lak i kan i ṭheknak in kan khawm ṭhan law na min thiang kha kan thangṭhat lai i nangmah lawmhnak bia chim in kan i lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Bawipa Israel Pathian cu thangṭhat u sih; atu ah thangṭhat u sih law
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu lawm tuah u, zeicahtiah amah cu a ṭha. a fekmi a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih a khamhmi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u sih. Nan ral kut chungin an chuah hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ram dang in an tlunpi hna, nichuah, nitlak, chaklei, thlanglei in an tlunpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A cheu cu sul le lam a um lonak thetse ram ah khan an vai i an umnak ding khua kalnak lam kha an i hmuh kho lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an rawl a ṭam, an ti a hal i an hnabei a dong cikcek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An harnak chung cun Bawipa kha an auh i an harnak chung khan a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hruai hna i an umnak ding khua ah khan a kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu, an cung i thil ṭha a tuahmi caah khan le a fekmi a dawtnak ruangah khan, an lawmh hrimhrim awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ti a halmi kha an ti hal a riamhter hna i rawl a ṭammi kha thil ṭha in an paw a khimter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A cheu cu lungdong in khuamui lakah an um, thir cikcin he nganfah a ingmi thongtla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />zeicahdah hi bantukin an si ti ahcun, Lianngan Bik Pathian nawl zulh kha an duh lo i a cawnpiak hnanak kha an al caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rian hrang an ṭuannak ah khan an ba i an rilh tikah ahohmanh nih an hlawm duh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu bantuk harnak chung cun Bawipa cu an auh i an temhinnak chung cun a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuamui lakah lungdong in an umnak chung cun a chuah hna i an thir cikcin cu a chahpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu, an cung i thil ṭha a tuahmi caah khan le a fekmi a dawtnak ruangah khan, an lawmh hrimhrim awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dar innkhar kha a khuai dih hna i thirfung kha a tan dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A cheu cu an sual ruangah an zaw, ṭhat lonak an tuah ruangah temhnak an ing;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />rawl kha a mui hmuh hmanh an duh lo i an thi dengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An harnak chungin Bawipa kha an auh i temhnak an inmi chung cun a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nawlbia in a damter hna i thlan chungin a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu, an cung i thil ṭha a tuahmi ruangah khan le a fekmi a dawtnak ruangah khan, an lawmh hrimhrim awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Raithawinak in an lawmh awk a si i a tuahmi thil vialte kha lunglawmhnak hla in an thanh awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A cheu cu rili cungah khan sangphawlawng in an kal i cuticun an paw an i cawm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil kha an hmuh i rili cungah a tuahmi thil khuaruahhar kha an hmuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nawl a pek i thlichia a hrang i tilet a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sangphawlawng cu sang pipi ah a cawi hna i thuk pipi ah a ṭhumh hna; cu bantuk ṭihnung chungah cun mi cu an hnabei a dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />zuri bantukin an sawn i an tlu; an thiamnak vialte cu zeihmanh san a tlai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An harnak chung khan Bawipa cu an auh i an temhinnak chung khan a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlichia cu a daihter i tilet cu an dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tilet a daih caah khan an i lawm i kal an duhnak lawng dinhnak ah khan him tein a phakter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu, an cung i thil ṭha a tuahmi ruangah khan le a fekmi a dawtnak ruangah khan, an lawmh hrimhrim awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A mi hna an i pumhnak ah khan a lianhngannak cu an chim awk a si i upa hna an i pumhnak ah khan amah cu an thangṭhat awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa nih tiva cu a kaoter hna i cerh cu a roter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vawlei ṭhatnak hmun cu, cite vawlei, vawlei ṭhalo ah a canter, zeicahtiah cuka i a ummi hna cu an ṭha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thetse ram kha tili ah a canter hna i ramcar kha cerhti put ah a canter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuka ah cun rawl a ṭammi kha a umter hna i khuasaknak ah khuapi pakhat an ser,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />lo ah khan thlaici an tuh i mitsur ruang kha an phun hna i rawl tampi an vuiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A mi kha thluachuah a pek hna i fa tampi an ngei, an saṭil run kha a lohtlauter hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian mi hna cu, raltuknak ah an sungh i ningzahnak an huah tikah, hremnak le harnak an in tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />anmah a hremtu hna kha ningzahnak a phakter hna i sul le lam a um lonak thetse ram ah khan a vaihter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw sifak retheimi kha an harnak chungin a chuah hna i an tefa cu saṭil run bantukin a karhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Miding mi nih mah hihi an hmuh i an i lawm, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu cipkhap ti ngam loin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A fimmi nih cun hi thil hi ruat hna seh; Bawipa dawtnak fek cu ruat zungzal hna seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lung a hmun ko, maw Pathian, ka lung a fek ko! Nangmah thangṭhatnak hla ka sa lai. Ka nunnak i hlau tuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tingtang le ka thonglawi hna i hlau tuah u! Zinglei cu ka ṭhangh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, miphun hna lakah kan lawmh lai, mi vialte hna lakah kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak cu vancung tiang a phan, zumhawktlak na sinak cu van a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na lianhngannak cu van ah khin langhter law na sunparnak cu vawleicung dihlak ah hin langhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ṭhawnnak in kan khamh tuah; kan thlacamnak kha kan let tuah, cuticun na dawtmi hi kan luat kho lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian nih a hmunthiang chungin aa thawh i, “Shekhem cu ka tei lai i ka cheu lai, cun Sukkoth Nelrawn cu ka mi ka phawt hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead cu keimah ta a si. Manasseh zong keimah ta a si, Efraim cu ka luchin a si i Judah cu ka bawifung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Moab cu ka kut ṭawlnak kheng ah ka hman lai i Edom cu ka kedan chiahnak kuang ah ka hman lai; Filistia cu ka tei lai i ka au lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Pathian, aho nih dah ralhau ngeimi khua chungah a ka luhpi lai? Aho nih dah Edom ah a ka kalpi lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kan hlawt taktak ko cang maw? Kan ralkap cu na kalpi ti hna lai lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minung bawmhnak cu zeihmanh a ṭhathnem lo caah kan raldohnak ah hin nangmah nih kan bawm ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian kan sinah a ṭan caah kan tei hna lai; kan ral cu amah nih a kan teipiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw ka thangṭhatmi Pathian, dai tein um hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miṭhalo le milihchim pawl nih an ka tlakphuat i lih in ka thang an ka chiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ka congoih, thil dawhcah lo ka tuahmi zeihmanh a um lo nain sual an ka puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka daw ko hna na le an caah thla ka cam ko nain an ka doh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭhatnak kha chiatnak in an ka lehrulh i dawtnak kha huatnak in an ka cham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ral cu a bia a ceihpiaktu dingah mihrokhrawl kha thimpiak, cun amah ral lila pakhatkhat nih sual puh hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biaceihnak kha ing seh law, “Na sual,” ti hna seh. A thlacam hmanh kha sual ah relpiak hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nunnak kha dong zau seh law, midang nih a rian kha co hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fale cu ngakṭah si hna seh law, a nupi cu nuhmei si seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fale cu inn ngei loin a vak lengmangmi rawlhal si hna seh; thilchia hlonhnak ah khan um hna seh law, cu an umnak hmun hmanh cun ṭhawl si rih hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangka a rak cawihtu hna nih khan a ngeihmi thil vialte cu, lakpiak dih hna seh law, a rianṭuanmi vialte cu khual nih chut dih hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahohmanh nih a cungah zaangfahnak ngei hna hlah seh, ngakṭah a fale kha aho zohkhenh hmanh tong hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tefa vialte cu thi dih hna seh law hmai chan ah cun a min cu philh dipdep si seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa nih a pupa hna sualnak kha philh hlah seh law a nu sualnak kha ngaithiam hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa nih an sualnak cu hngal zungzal ko seh, anmah belte philh dipdep si ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cu pa nih cun mi zaangfah ruam hi a ruah in a ruat bal lo; sifak, rethei le santlailo mi kha a hrem hna i a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi chiatserh kha a duhmi thil a si — amah cu chiatserh si ve seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Angki hruk a fawi tluk hin a caah chiatserh cu a fawi, a chiatserhnak bia nih cun amah kha ti bantukin ciah seh law a ruh kha chiti bantukin ciah hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A chiatserhnak bia nih cun amah kha puan bangin men seh law taisawm bangin khimh peng seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa nih ka ral cu hitihin dantat hna seh, ka thang a ka chiattu ka ral hna cu hitihin tat hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, bia na ka kamh bang khan ka bawm ko, na dawtnak a ṭhat ruangah ka chuahter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei cu sifak le rethei ka si; ka lung a fak tuk hringhran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zanlei thladem a loh zau bang khin loh kaa zal cang, khaubawk thlitu nih a choih bang khin choih ka si cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rawl khim ei awk ka ngeih lo caah ka khuk cu a ther in an ther i ka pum cu der hrianghruang in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi nih an ka hmuh tikah an ka nihsawh, keimah serhsatnak ah an lu lawng an thing ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, ka bawm tuah; a fekmi na dawtnak ruangah ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ka khamhtu cu nangmah na si kha, ka ral cu hngalhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annih nih cun chiat an ka serh lai, sihmanhsehlaw nang nih cun thluachuah na ka pek lai. A ka hremtu cu sung hna seh law na sal kei tu cu lunglawm in umning.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ral cu ningzahnak nih a khuh in khuh hna seh; hmaichiatnak cu puan bangin i aih hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa cu fak piin ka thangṭhat lai, mi an i pumhnak hmun ah amah cu ka hlawrh lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />zeicahtiah sifakmi a chanhtu hna cu amah a si i thah awkin an bia a ceihtu hna kut chungin a chuahtu hna cu amah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa nih siangpahrang ka Bawipa cu a thawh i, “Na ral cu na ke tangah ka chiah hna hlantiang, ka orhlei kamah hin ṭhu tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion in a rami Bawipa nih, uknak nawl cu an pek tikah, “Na ral cu uk hna,” an ti lai i na nawl ngeihnak cu hmun dang tiangin a karh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ral kha na tuk hna ni ah, na mi nih anmah lungtho tein an in chuahhnawh lai. Na tlangval hna cu zinglei dap bantukin, na sinah tlang thiang ah khan an ra chuak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nih a fekmi biakamnak a tuah i a let ṭhan lai lo, “Nang cu zungzal in tlangbawi na si lai, Melkhizedek tlangbawi a sining in na si lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu na orhlei kamah a um ko; a thin a hun ni ah siangpahrang kha a tei hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miphun kha an bia a ceih hna lai i raltuknak hmun kha miruak in a khahter lai; vawlei cung dihlak ah siangpahrang kha a tei hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lam pawng i a luangmi tiva kha siangpahrang nih cun a din lai, a tha aa hrim lai i teitu a si lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Bawipa cu a mi hna an i pumhnak ah ka lungthin a dih umnak in ka lawmh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil cu zeitluk in dah khuaruahhar a si! A tuahmi thil cung i aa lawmmi hna nih cun an sullam kha hngalh an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuahmi thil cu upatnak le lianhngannak in a khat; a dinnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nih thil khuaruahhar a tuahmi hna kha philh loin a kan umter; amah cu mi cungah vel a ngei i zaangfah a thiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah a ṭihtu kha rawl in a cawm hna, bia aa kammi kha zeitikhmanh ah a philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ṭhawnnak cu a mi hna sinah khan a langhter, ramdangmi hna ram cu a mi kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tuahmi thil kip ah zumhawktlak le miding a si; a nawlbia kha i bochan awk tlak an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zungzal in an hmun; biatak le dinnak in pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mi cu khamhnak a pek hna i zungzal hmunmi biakamnak kha an sinah a ser. Amah cu a thiang i a ṭhawngmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa ṭih hi fim hram i thawh cu a si; cu bantukin a nungmi cu hngalhnak ah an ṭhang, Bawipa cu zungzal in thangṭhat si ko seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Bawipa a ṭihmi cu mi lunglawm an si. A nawlbia zulh a nuam in a theimi cu mi lunglawm an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu bantuk mi hna fale cu ram chungah hin miṭhawng an si lai, miṭha mi hna fale cu thluachuah hmumi an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An innchungkhar hna cu an rum an lian lai i khua awng an pem zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miṭha mi hna caah cun muihnak chungah khan ceunak a tlang, mi cungah vel a ngeimi le mi zaangfah a thiammi le miding mi hna caah cun ceunak kha a tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi chaw a cawih hna tikah siang ngaiin a cawih i a rian a ṭuannak ah lihchim lo tein a ummi cu milunglawm an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miṭha cu an sung bal lai lo, philh an si bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thawng chia theih kha a ṭih lo. a zumhnak a ṭhawng i Bawipa kha aa bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungrethei le thinphang in a um lo; ka ral cu an sung hrimhrim lai ti kha a hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A herh a baumi kha siang ngaiin a pek hna, mi cung i zaangfahnak a ngeihmi cu zungzal in a hmun; amah cu a ṭhawng lai i hmaizah a si ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭhalo pawl nih khan hihi an hmuh i an ing a puang, an hacang lawng an rial ko; an rak i ruahchanmi kha pakpalawng ah a can dih bantuk khan annih zong an lo ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u! Bawipa salle hna, Bawipa min cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A min cu thangṭhat si ko seh, atu in zungzal tiang thangṭhat si ko seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nichuahlei in nitlaklei tiang, Bawipa min cu thangṭhat si ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miphun vialte cu Bawipa nih a uk hna, a sunparnak nih van khi a lonh dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian bantuk hi ahohmanh an um lo, vancung ah siseh, vawlei ah siseh, amah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo, a bawiṭhutdan cu cung sangpi ah khin a hun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />asinain van le vawlei run zoh awkah hin a rung kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sifakmi kha leidip lak i an umnak khan a cawi hna, retheimi kha an retheihnak chungin a chuah hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />siangpahrang fale hawikom ah khan a ser hna; a mi hna siangpahrang fale hawikom ah khan a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fa a ngei kho lomi nu kha upatnak a pek hna i fa a ngeimi lunglawmmi nu ah a ser hna. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! a ser hna. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi nih Izipt ram in an chuah tikah, Jakob tefa pawl nih cu ram cun an chuah tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah cu Bawipa mithiang ah a cang, Israel cu amah ta ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rili Sen nih a rak zoh hna i an zamtak hna, Jordan Tiva cu luang loin a rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlang cu meheh bantukin an i hlok i tuu bantukin an pet i an choi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rili, zei nih dah an zamter? Jordan Tiva, zeicahdah luang loin na um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlang hna zeicahdah meheh bantukin nan i hlawh? Fing hna, zeicahdah tuu bantukin nan peh i nan choi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw vawlei, Bawipa a rat caah cun ther ko, Jakob Pathian hmaiah cun ther ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah nih cun lungpi kha tili ah a canter hna i lungpang kha cerhti put ah a canter hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanmah si loin, na min lawnglawng hi sunparnak pek awk cu na si, Bawipa, zeicahtiah na dawtnak cu a fek i zumhawktlak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zeicahdah miphun dang hna nih, “Nan Pathian cu khoika ah dah a um?” tiah an kan hal lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian cu vancung ah khin a um i a duhmi paoh kha a tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih pathian tu cu sui le ngun in sermi an si, minung kut nih a sermi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaa cu an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw an holh kho lo, mit cu an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw an hmu kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hna an ngei, asinain khua an thei lo, hnar an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw rim an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kut an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw zeihmanh an tawng kho lo, ke an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw an kal kho lo; an hrom nih aw zeihmanh a ser kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siasal a sertu hna le siasal aa bochanmi hna cu an sermi siasal bantuk cu si ve hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Israel mi hna, Bawipa cu i bochan u, amah nih an bawmh hna lai i an huhphenh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian tlangbawi hna, Bawipa cu i bochan u, amah nih an bawmh hna i an huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihmi vialte hna, amah cu i bochan u, amah nih an bawmh hna i an huhphenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nih a kan philh lo i thluachuah a kan pek lai; Israel mi le Pathian tlangbawi vialte kha thluachuah a pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah a ṭihmi vialte cu thluachuah a pek hna lai, a hme a ngan thleidang loin a pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa nih nangmah le na fale cu, tefa in pe ko hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Van le vawlei a sertu Bawipa nih cun, thluachuahnak in pe ko hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vancung khi Bawipa ta a si, sihmanhsehlaw vawlei hi cu, mi kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa a thangṭhattu cu mithi an si lo, holh lo i dai tein umnak hmun ah a vung kalmi nih an thangṭhat kho lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw kannih a nungmi nih amah cu kan lawmh lai, atu in zungzal tiang kan lawmh lai. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa nih ka thlacamnak kha a ka ngaihpiak i a ka theihpiak caah Bawipa cu ka dawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah ka auh fate a ka theihpiak zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thihnak nih a hri in a ka ṭem, Sheol nih a kut in a ka khimh. Ṭihnak le lung retheihnak in ka khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu tikah Bawipa cu ka auh i, “ Bawipa, ka khamh ko sawh,” tiah ka nawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu velngeimi le miṭha a si, kan Pathian cu mi zaangfah thiammi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa nih a awlok a chongmi kha a huhphenh hna, ṭihnung chung i ka um tikah a ka khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka cungah a ṭhat caah, maw ka nunnak, hnangam tein um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih thihnak chungin a ka khamh, ka mitthli kha a ka hnawh i raltuknak ah a ka sunghter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah cun Bawipa hmaiah kaa chawk kho i, a nungmi hna sinah khua ka sa rih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka lo dimdiam ko cang,” ka ti lio hmanh ah, a zumh cu ka zumh peng ko,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin a phan tuk cang i, “Ahohmanh bochan awk tlak an um lo,” ka ti lio zongah, ka zumh peng ṭhiamṭhiam ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka cung i a ṭhatnak vialte ruangah hin zeidah ka pek khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ka khamh caah khan Bawipa cu din awk thawinak ka pekchanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mi vialte an i pumhnak ah khan bia kaa kammi kha ka pek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mi pakhatkhat an thih tikah Bawipa caah zeitluk in dah a fah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa, kei cu na sal ka si; ka nu nih na rian a rak in ṭuanpiak bang khan kei zong nih ka ṭuan ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lawmhnak chimnak raithawinak cu kan pek lai i na sinah thla ka cam lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mi vialte an i pumhnak, Jerusalem khua na Biakinn tual ah cun, na sinah bia kaa kammi kha kan pek lai. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miphun vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Mi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kan dawtnak fek cu a ṭhawng i zumhawktlak a sinak cu zungzal in a hmun. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭhat i a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmunh caah lawm tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi nih, “A dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun,” ti hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian tlangbawi hna nih, “A dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun,” ti hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihmi vialte nih, “A dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun,” ti hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lung sivang in ka umnak chungin Bawipa cu ka auh; ka auhnak cu a ka leh i a ka luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka sinah a um caah zeihmanh ka ṭih lo; minung nih cun ka cungah zeidah an tuah khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ka bawmtu cu Bawipa a si caah, ka ral kha an sungh cu ka hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minung i bochan nakcun Bawipa i bochan cu a ṭha deuh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />bawi i bochannak cun Pathian i bochan kha a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ral tampi nih an ka kulh, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa ṭhawnnak thawngin ka tei dih hna!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kaa kip in an ka kulh, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa ṭhawnnak thawngin ka tei dih hna!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuai zelh in an ka zelh, sihmanhsehlaw hlingbur kangh in an kang, Bawipa ṭhawnnak thawngin ka tei dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fak piin an ka tuk i an ka tei ciaomau, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih a ka bawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka himnak le ka ralhruang a si, amah cu a ka chuahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian mi hna thlam chung i ral teinak au thawng cu ngai hmanh: Bawipa ṭhawnnak a liannganmi nih kan ral cu a tei hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a ṭhawnnak nih teinak a kan pek, a ṭhawnnak a liannganmi nih raltuknak hmun ah teinak a kan pek!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thi lai lo, ka nung ko lai i Bawipa nih a tuahmi thil kha ka chim hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fak piin dan a ka tat, sihmanhsehlaw thih ngaingai cu a ka siang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakinn kutka cu ka hunpiak hna u, ka lut lai i Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hihi Bawipa kutka cu a si, miding mi lawng an lut kho lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih ka thlacamnak na ka theihpiak i teinak na ka pek caah; nangmah cu kan thangṭhat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Inn satu pawl nih santlailo ah an rel i an hlawtmi lung cu, santlai bik lung a rak si ziar ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucu Bawipa tuahmi a si, zeitluk in dah aa dawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa nih a kan pekmi ni hi zeitluk in dah a ṭhat; hi ni ah hin i lawm u si law i nuam u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan khamh tuah, Maw Bawipa kan khamh tuah. Bawipa, thluachuahnak kan pe ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa min in a rami cu Pathian nih thluachuah a pek hna. Bawipa biakinn chungin kannih nih thluachuah kan rak in pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa cu Pathian a si; kan cungah a ṭha. Nan kut in thing nge kha i put in puai cu thawk u law biakṭheng kha vel u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si i kan lawmh; na lianhngannak cu ka thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭhat caah lawm tuah u, a dawtnak fek cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An nunning ah soisel awkj mi lunglawm an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak kha an tuah lo, Bawipa lam kha an zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha na kan pek i zumhawktlak tein nan zulh lai na kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kan pekmi phunglam cu zumhawktlak tein zul kho ning law zeitluk in dik ka va lunghmuih hnga!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na nawlbia vialte kha ṭha tein kaa zohchih hna ahcun ningzahnak ka phan lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na biakhiahnak a dingmi kha ka hngalh hna lai i lung thiang in kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna lai, zeitikhmanh ah ka kaltak hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeitindah tlangval nih thiang tein a um lai? Na nawl ngaihnak thawngin thiang tein a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungthin a dih umnak in na rian ṭuan kha kaa zuam; na nawlbia kha zul loin ka umnak hnga lo ka bawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmah cungah sualnak ka tuah nakhnga lo na nawlbia cu ka lung chungah kaa chiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu kan ṭhangṭhat, na phunglam cu ka cawnpiak ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kan pekmi nawlbia vialte cu, fak piin ka chim lengmang hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chawva tampi ngeih nakin na nawlbia zulh cu ka duh deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kan hmuhsakmi thil kha ṭha tein ka ngiat hna i na kan cawnpiakmi thil kha ka dothlat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu kaa lawmhnak an si, na phunglam cu ka philh hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sal cungah hin ṭhatnak tuah ko, cuticun ka nung lai i na cawnpiaknak kha ka zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na nawlbia chung i a ummi khuaruahhar biatak kha ka hmuh khawh nakhnga, ka mit ka auter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vawlei cungah hin caan tlawmte lawng ka um lai, cucaah na nawlbia kha ka thuhkanh hna hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na biakhiahnak kha ka lung nih chun zan in a ngai ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi porhlaw kha na chimhhrin hna; na nawlbia a pialtakmi cu chiatserhmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmah phunglam kha ka zulh hna caah an ka serhsatnak le an ka nihsawhnak cun ka luatter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uktu bawi hna nih khan, keimah hrawhnak khua cu khang ṭi lengmang hna hmanh seh law, kei na sal cu na nawlbia tu kha ka ruat camcin ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ka cawnpiaknak nih lawmhnak a ka pek; fim a ka chimtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leidip lakah ka ril ko cang, bia na ka kamh bang khan ka nunter ṭhan ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka tuahmi vialte kha na sinah ka phuan dih i na ka leh; na nawlbia kha ka cawnpiak tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na phunglam zulhning kha ka cawnpiak law na cawnpiaknak khuaruahhar cu ka ruat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngaihchiatnak nih a ka hrilh, bia na ka kamh bang khan thazang ka pe ṭhan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lam ping zulh ka dawn law na ṭhatnak thawngin na phunglam kha ka cawnpiak tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na nawl zulh awkah ka lung kaa thlek cang; na phunglam kha ṭha tein ka ruat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa, lam na ka hmuhsakmi kha ka zulh hna, hnabei dong in ka umter hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangmah nih hngalhthiamnak tam chinchin in na ka pek lai caah, na nawlbia cu lunglawm tein ka zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na phunglam an sullam kha ka cawnpiak hna law zeitikhmanh ah ka zulh zungzal hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na phunglam kha fiang tein ka chim law ka zulh lai; ka lungthin a dih umnak in ka zulh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na nawlbia chungah khan lunglawmhnak ka hmuh caah na nawlbia lam cu ka zulhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Rumnak nakin na nawlbia zulh kha ka duhter deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Santlailo thil kha biapi i ka rel sual nakhnga lo ka bawm, bia na ka kamh bang khan ka cungah ṭhatnak tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nangmah an ṭihtu hna sinah biakamnak na tuahmi cu, na sal keimah cung zongah hin tlinter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka ṭihmi thangchiatnak khan ka khamh ko; zeitluk in dah na nawlbia cu a ṭhat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangmah cu na din caah na nawlbia zulh kha ka duh hna; ka cungah ṭhatnak tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na ka dawt kha ka hmuhsak law bia na ka kamh bang khan ka khamh tuah, Maw ka Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cun na bia kha kaa bochan caah, a ka nihsawhtu kha bia ka leh khawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka rak i ruahchanmi cu na biakhiahnak kha a si zungzal caah biatak cu ka chim zungzal khawh nakhnga ka bawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na phunglam cu ka zulh zungzal lai, zungzal in zungzal tiang ka zulh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na nawlbia zulh kha kaa zuam caah luat ngaiin ka nung lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu siangpahrang kha ka chimh hna lai i cu tuah cu ka ning a zak lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu ka duh hna caah na nawlbia zulh cu ka caah a nuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu ka upat hna i ka duh hna; na cawnpiaknak cu ka ruat camcin hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na sal bia na ka kamhmi kha philh hlah, na biakamnak cu ka ruahchannak hrampi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nganfah ka in hmanh ah ka hna a ngam, zeicahtiah na biakamnak nih nunnak a ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mi porhlaw hna nih an ka zawmhtaih, sihmanhsehlaw kei cu na phunglam kha ka kaltak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bawipa, hlan i na rak ka cawnpiakmi kha ka philh hna lo, kha nih khan an ka lawmhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih na phunglam an hrawh ka hmuh tikah ka thin a hung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka inn in lamhlatpi i ka umnak hmun ah na nawlbia kha hla in ka hlawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Bawipa, zan ah nangmah kha kan ruat i, na phunglam kha ka zul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na nawlbia ka zulh hna hi kaa lawmhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nangmah lawnglawng hi kan duhmi na si ko, Maw Bawipa ; na phunglam zulh awkah bia kaa kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka lungthin dihlak in kan nawl, bia na ka kamh bangin ka zaangfah tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka ziaza kha ṭha tein kaa ruat i na nawlbia zulh kha bia kaa kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Rau loin, khulrang in na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih an hri in an ka ṭem, sihmanhsehlaw na phunglam kha ka philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Na biakhiahnak an din ruangah khan zanṭim i ka hun i hlauh tikah nangmah cu kan thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na rian a ṭuanmi hna cu ahohmanh an si ah ka hawikom an si, na phunglam a zulmi hna i an hawikom ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Bawipa, vawlei hi a fekmi na dawtnak in a khat; na nawlbia cu keimah kha ka cawnpiak tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Bawipa, na biakam kha na zulh i na sal ka cungah hin na ṭha ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha kaa bochan hna caah fimnak le hngalhnak ka pe ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Dan na ka tat hlanah cun a pingah ka kal tawn, sihmanhsehlaw atu cu na bia kha ka ngaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na ṭhat i zeitluk in dah vel na ngeih! Na nawlbia cu ka cawnpiak tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Mi porhlaw hna nih lih in ka thang an ka chiat, sihmanhsehlaw kei nih cun ka lungthin dihlak in na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hi mi hna cu hngalhnak a ngei lomi an si, sihmanhsehlaw kei cu na nawlbia ah kaa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Dantatnak ka inmi cu ka caah a ṭha, zeicahtiah na nawlbia kha a ka hngalhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Na ka pekmi nawlbia cu ka caah vawlei cung tangka vialte nakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Nangmah nih na ka ser i nangmah nih him tein na ka umter; na nawlbia kha ka hngalh khawh hna nakhnga hngalhthiamnak ka pe ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Na biakamnak kha kaa bochan caah nangmah an ṭihmi nih an ka hmuh tikah an lung aa lawm lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Bawipa, na nawlbia kha an ding ti ka hngalh i zumhawktlakmi na si caah dan na ka tat cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Kei na sal hi bia na ka kamh bantukin a fekmi na dawtnak nih cun ka lung ka lawmhter ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Na phunglam kha kaa lawmhnak a si caah ka cungah zaangfahnak ngei law ka nung lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Lih in sual an ka puh caah miporhlaw pawl cu, ningzahnak phan hna seh, kei tu cu na nawlbia kha ka ruat ko hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Nangmah an ṭihmi le na nawlbia a hngalmi cu ka sinah ra hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Ral tuknak i sungh ningzahnak khan ka luat nakhnga, na nawlbia cu tlamtling tein ka zulhter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na khamhnak ka hngahnak ah hin ka ba tuk hringhran cang; na bia cu kaa bochanmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />“Zeitik ah dah na ka bawmh lai?” ti lengmang in ka um i na ka kamhmi ka cuanhnak ah hin ka mithram a fak tuk cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Kei cu an hlonhmi saphaw cua bantukin santlailo ka si, asinain na nawlbia cu ka philh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Zei can dah ka ngan a herh rih lai? A ka hremtu kha zeitik ah dah dan na tat hna lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Na nawlbia a zul duh lomi miruamkai pawl nih khan, ka tlaknak dingah khor an cawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu zumhawktlak an si dih, mi nih lih in an ka hrem, ka bawm tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />An ka thah khawh ciaomau, sihmanhsehlaw na nawlbia kha ka daithlanh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Na dawtnak fek ruangah ka cungah ṭha ko, cuticun na phunglam kha ka zulh khawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Bawipa, na bia cu zungzal in a hmun lai; vancung ah khin fek tein a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Zumhawktlak na sinak cu chan vialte tiangin a hmun, vawlei cu a umnak ah na chiah i cuka ah cun a um peng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Nangmah nawlbia thawngin zeizong vialte hi nihin ni tiang an hmun, zeicahtiah zeizong vialte cu an dihlak in na sal an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na nawlbia hi kaa lawmhnak hram rak si hlah seh law, ka dantatnak inmi ah hin ka thi diam cang hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu ka daithlanh bal hna lai lo, zeicahtiah anmah nih cun pei an ka nunter cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Kei cu nangmah ta ka si, ka khamh ko sawh. Na nawlbia zulh kha kaa zuam lengmang ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Miṭhalo pawl nih thah awkah an ka bawh ko, sihmanhsehlaw kei cu na phunglam kha ka ruat ko hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Zei thil hmanh hi a tlingmi a um lo ti kha ka hngalh cang, asinain na nawlbia cu donghnak a ngei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na phunglam cu ka duh, chun nitlak cu lawng cu ka ruat ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Na nawlbia nih a ka umpi zungzal i ka ral vialte hna nakin a ka fimter deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Na cawnpiaknak kha ka ruah hna caah, ka sayate vialte nakin ka hngal deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna caah tar nakin fimnak ka ngei deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Na bia zulh kha ka duh caah ziaza ṭhalo vialte kha ka hrial hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Na cawnpiaknak kha zeirello in ka um hna lo, zeicahtiah a ka cawnpiaktu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na nawlbia cu an thlum, khuaihliti nakin an thlum deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na nawlbia in fimnak ka hmuh, cucaah ziaza ṭhalo vialte kha ka huat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na bia cu ka ke caah meiinn a si, ka lam ah ceunak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />Na ka cawnpiaknak a dingmi, ka zulh hna lai tiah bia kaa kammi kha, ka zulh taktak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka temhinnak hi a fak tuk hringhran, bia na ka kamh bangin ka nunter ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, ka lunglawmhnak thlacamnak cu ka cohlang law, na nawlbia kha ka cawnpiak tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Nifate thinphang zungzal in ka um ko, sihmanhsehlaw na nawlbia cu ka philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Miṭhalo nih keimah foihnak caah rap an chiah, sihmanhsehlaw na nawl zul loin ka um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu zungzal ka ro an si, ka lung a ka lawmhtertu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Ka thih ni tiangin na nawlbia cu ka zulh zungzal ko hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Na sinah zumhawktlak in a um lomi cu ka huat hna, sihmanhsehlaw kei cu na phunglam kha ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nangmah cu a ka khamhtu le a ka hupphengtu na si, na biakam cu kaa bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />Nannih misual mi hna, ka kaltak u, kei cu ka Pathian nawlbia kha ka zul lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Bia na ka kamh bangin thazang ka pe law ka nung lai. kaa ruahchannak ah hin hnabeidong in ka umter hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Ka domh law ka him lai, na nawlbia cu zungzal in ka ruat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Na phunglam a zul duh lomi vialte kha na hlawt hna, zernak in khua an khanmi vialte cu pakpalawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Nang na mit hmuh ah cun vawleicung miṭhalo vialte hi hmunthur men an si dih, cucaah kei cu na nawlbia kha ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Nangmah kan ṭih caah a ther in ka ther, na biakhiahmi hmaiah cun khuaruahhar in ka dir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />A dingmi le a ṭhami thil kha ka tuah, ka ral hna sinah ka chia ta hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Na sal kha, kan bawmh lai, tiah biakamnak ka pe tuah, miruamkai hna nih hin harnak ka pe hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Na khamhnak hi ka mit hram fak in ka cuan, na ka kamhmi luatnak cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak ningin ka cungah ṭuan law na nawlbia cu hung ka cawnpiak ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Kei cu na sal ka si, cucaah cun hngalhthiamnak ka pe law na ka cawnpiakmi kha ka hngalh khawh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Mi nih na phunglam kha an zulh duh ti lo caah atu caan hi na cawlcangh caan a si awk a hau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu sui nakin ka duh deuh hna, sui ṭha bik nakin ka duh deuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Cucaah cun na cawnpiaknak kha ka zulh hna i lam hmaanlo vialte kha ka huat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na kan cawnpiaknak cu khuaruahhar an si; ka lungthin a dih umnak in ka zulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na kan cawnpiaknak fianternak nih khan ceunak a chuahpi, hngalhnak a tlawmmi kha fimnak a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha ka duh tuk hna caah, ka kaa kaa an i ka thaw aa su.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Na dawtmi hna cu na merhnawh hna i an cungah zaangfahnak na ngeih bantukin kei zong ka merhnawh ve law ka zaangfah ve ko sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Bia na ka kamh bantukin tlu loin ka khamh law ṭhat lonak nih khan ka tei sawh hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />A ka hremtu hna kut chung khan ka khamh tuah, cuticun na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Na sal cungah hin na hmai kha tlanter law, na phunglam kha ka cawnpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Mi nih na phunglam kha zulh an duh lo caah an mitthli cu tiva bangin a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Bawipa, nang cu na ding i na nawlbia zong a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />Nangmah pekmi nawlbia cu an hmaan i an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka ral nih na nawlbia cu zei ah an rel hna lo caah ka thin cu meialh in a alh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na biakam cu a hmaan! Zeitluk in dah na sal nih ka duh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Kei cu santlailo le zeirello mi ka si, sihmanhsehlaw na nawlbia cu ka daithlanh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na dinnak cu zungzal in a hmun lai, na phunglam cu ahmaan zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Harnak le lung retheihnak in ka khat, sihmanhsehlaw na nawlbia nih an ka lawmhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na kan cawnpiaknak cu zungzal in a ding, hngalhthiamnak ka pe law ka nung lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka lungthin dihlak in nangmah cu kan auh, Maw Bawipa ka let law na nawlbia cu ka zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Nangmah kha kan auh, ka khamh law na nawlbia kha ka zulh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Ni a chuah hlanah nangmah cu bawmhnak hal duh ah kan auh, na biakamnak kha kaa bochanmi cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Zan khuadei mit cungtang chin loin ka um, cucu na cawnpiakmi ka ruahnak ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />A fekmi na dawtnak thawngin, maw Bawipa, ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak ko, na ṭhatnak thawngin ka nunnak cu ka zuahpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />A ka hremtu mipuarhrang hna nih khan an ka naih chin lengmang, annih cu na phunglam a zul duh bal lomi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Maw Bawipa, nang nih cun lam nai tein na ka umpi i na biakamnak cu a si taktakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Na kan cawnpiaknak cu hlanlio piin ka rak hngalh cang, zungzal hmun dingin na ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka temhinnak hi ka zohpiak law ka khamh tuah, zeicahtiah na phunglam cu zeirello in ka um hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka bia ka chimpiak law ka luatter tuah, bia na ka kamh bang khan ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Na nawlbia kha miṭhalo mi nih cun an zulh hna lo caah annih cu khamhnak an hmu lai lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa na zaangfahnak cu a ngan caah na biakhiahnak bantukin ka khamh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />Ral tampi le hremtu tampi ka ngei, ka luak an chuak, zeicahtiah na nawlbia kha an zul duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Khi mirawitu hna khi ka zoh hna tikah ka luak an chuak, zeicahtiah na nawlbia kha an zul duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Bawipa, zeitluk in dah na cawnpiaknak ka duh cu hngal ko. A fekmi na dawtnak thawngin ka khamh ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na phunglam a chung muru cu biatak a si, a dingmi na nawlbia vialte cu zungzal in an hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Miṭhawng nih ding lo piin an ka serhsat, sihmanhsehlaw na phunglam cu ka hmaizah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Bia na kammi thawngin zeitluk in dah ka lung aa lawmh, ro chaw aa hmuhmi bantukin kaa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Lih cu ka huat hna i ka fih hna, sihmanhsehlaw na phunglam cu ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />A dingmi na biakhiahnak ruangah ni khat ah voi sarih lengmang ka lawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Na phunglam a duhmi cu him tein khua an sa i a tlukter khotu hna zeihmanh a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na khamhnak cu kaa ruahchan i nawl na ka pekmi cu ka tuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu ka zulh hna; ka lungthin dihlak in ka duh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Na nawlbia le na cawnpiaknak cu ka zulh hna; ka tuahmi vialte cu na hmuh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah bawmh hal in ka aunak cu na sin phakter ko. Bia na ka kamh bangin hngalhnak ka pe ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu na hmaika phan seh law bia na ka kamh bangin ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Na phunglam cu na ka cawnpiak hna caah kan thangṭhat zungzal ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu an din caah na phunglam cu hla in ka sak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Na nawlbia cu ka zulh hna caah a zungzal in ka bawm ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah na khamhnak hmuh cu ka duh, Maw Bawipa ! Na phunglam zulh hi kaa lawmhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Kan thangṭhat khawh nakhnga, nunnak ka pe tuah! Na cawnpiaknak nih ka bawm hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Tuu tlau bantukin ka vai; cucaah ra law na sal hi ka kawl tuah, zeicahtiah na phunglam cu zeirello in ka um hna lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Harnak chung ka um tikah Bawipa cu ka auh i a ka leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, lihchim hmangmi hna le hlen hmangmi hna sin hin ka khamh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nannih milihchim hna, nan cungah Pathian nih zeidah a tuah lai? Zeitindah dan an tat hna lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ralkap cantiang le meiṭil sen in dan an tat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nannih lak um cu Meshek khua um tluk in a har, Kedar mi hna lak um tluk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daihnak a huami hna sinah sau tuk ka um cang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei nih daihnak ka chim paoh ah, annih nih dohnak an duh
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tlang khi ka hei cuan hna i, khuazei in dah bawmhnak ka hmuh lai? ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawmhnak ka hmuh dingmi cu Bawipa sinin a ra lai, van le vawlei sertu a simi sin cun a ra lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ka hupphengtu cu i ṭhang peng ko seh law, ka tlukter sawh hlah seh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel hupphengtu cu a ngu bal lo i aa hngilh bal lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih an ven ko lai, nangmah huhphenh awkah na pawngin an umhnawh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chun ah ni nih harnak an pe lai lo i zan ah thlapa zong nih harnak an pe ve lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa nih ṭihnak chungin an huhphenh lai i him tein an chiah lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu in zungzal tiang, na chuahlei siseh, na luhlei siseh, an zohkhenh zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Bawipa inn ah kal u sih,” an ka ti tikah khan ka rak i lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atu cu maw Jerusalem, na kutka chungah kan dir cang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem cu i rem ṭhipṭhep le i dawh cikcek in sakmi khua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuka ah cun Bawipa sin i lawmhnak bia chim awkah, Israel miphun cu an kal tawn, cu lawmhnak bia chim cu Bawipa nih a fialmi hna a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuka ah cun David chung bawiṭhutdan hna cu, an hun hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem daihnak caah thla cam u! “Nangmah an duhmi cu an thluachuak hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kulhnak vampang chunglei ah daihnak um seh law na siangpahrang inn hna chungah himnak um seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka rualchan hna le ka hawikom hna ruangah, Jerusalem cu, “Na chungah daihnak um seh,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian inn ruangah, na ṭhatnak ding caah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah lawng kei cu kan cuan ko, na umnak hmun van lei lawng ka zoh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sal nih a bawipa aa bochan bantuk le salnu nih a bawinu aa bochan bantukin, Bawipa kan Pathian, nangmah lawng kan hun in zoh ko, kan cungah zaangfahnak na ngeih hlantiang kan in zoh ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan zaangfah ko sawh, kan zaangfah ko sawh; an kan serhsat tuk hringhran!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mirum nih sau tuk an kan zawmhtaih cang i miporhlaw nih sau tuk an kan nihsawh cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa kha kanmah leiah rak ṭang hlah seh law, zei huah dah kan rak huah hnga, Israel mi hna ka let tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kan ral nih an kan tuk ah khan, Bawipa kha kanmah leiah rak ṭang hlah seh law
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kan nung in an kan dolh dih hnga, an thinhun ling ah khan an rak kan dolh dih hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kha tikah tilian nih khan a rak kan fenh diam hnga i ti nih khan a rak kan phum diam hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a hlonh in aa hlonhmi tilian nih khan a rak kan phum diam hnga.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan ral nih hrawh awkah a kan siang lotu Bawipa cu lawm ko u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rap chiahtupa rap in a luatmi va bantukin kan luat; rap cu a hrawh i kannih cu kan luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawmhnak kan hmuhnak cu Bawipa sinin a si, amah cu van le vawlei a sertu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa aa bochanmi cu Zion Tlang bantuk an si; Zion Tlang, hninh khawh zong a si lo i ṭhial khawh zong a si lomi bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlang nih Jerusalem khua kha an kulh bangin, Bawipa nih a mi cu a kulh hna, atu thawk in zungzal tiang a kulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian mi hna ram cu miṭhalo nih an uk zungzal lai lo, an uk ahcun, Pathian mi hna hrimhrim hmanh nih khan, ṭhat lonak an tuah sual hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, ṭhatnak a tuahmi hna cungah ṭhatnak tuah ve ko, na nawl a ngaimi hna cungah ṭhatnak tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw anmah lam, lam ṭhalo a zulmi hna cu, miṭhalo dan na tat hna tikah khan, dantat ve ko hna. Israel cungah daihnak um ko seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa nih Zion i a kan kirpi ṭhan ah khan, kan mang bantuk a rak si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zeitluk in dah kan nih kan kheh i zeitluk in dah lunglawmhnak hla kan sak kha! Kha tikah khan miphun dang hna nih, “An caah Bawipa nih thil lianngan a tuah,” an kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan caah thil lianngan a tuah taktak hna; zeitluk in dah kan rak i lawmh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, kan ram ah kan kirpi ṭhan ko, a carmi tiva ah ruah nih ti a chuahpi ṭhan bangin, kan kirpi ṭhan ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthli he thlaici a tuhmi nih, lunglawmh aunak he an zun lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭah buin thlaici aa phorhmi hna nih lunglawmhnak hlasa le facang phal i put in an ra kir lai!
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa nih inn cu a sak lo ahcun, a satu hna rianṭuannak cu santlailo a si; Bawipa nih khua kha a ven lo ahcun, a vengtu hna hngilh loin an umnak cu santlailo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuasak tintuknak caah fak tuk in rianṭuan le tuan tein thawh i tlaipi ah ih lengmang hi santlailo a si, zeicahtiah Bawipa nih a dawtmi cu, an i hngilh karah, an herhmi kha a pek ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fale hi Bawipa sinin kan hmuhmi ro an si, thluachuah a kan pekmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipa nih a no lioah a ngeihmi fapa hna cu ralkap kut chung cantiang bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cu bantuk cantiang a thalbawm khat in a ngeimi cu mi lunglawm a si! Biaceihnak hmun ah a ral kha a ton hna tikah a sung bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihmi cu mi lunglawm an si, a nawl a ngaimi cu mi lunglawm an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rian na ṭuan tikah nangmah pawcawmnak khim na hmuh lai i na lung aa lawm lai i khua awng na pem lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nupi cu na inn chungah a thei a ṭhami mitsur ruang bantuk a si lai, na fapale nih oliv thing tuaino bantukin na cabuai kha an kulh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nawl a ngaimi cu hi bantukin thluachuahnak an hmu hrimhrim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih Zion Tlang in thluachuahnak in pe ko hna seh! Nan nun chung vialte, Jerusalem rumnak cu co ve ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nan tufa nan hmuh hna tiangin nung ko u. Israel cungah daihnak um ko seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel, na no lio tein na ral nih zeitluk in dah an rak in hrem kha, chim tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I thawh law, “Ka no lio tein ka ral nih fak piin an ka hrem zungzal, sihmanhsehlaw an ka tei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka keng cu leithuan in an thuan, leikuang rinkuar sau pipi in an tuah bantuk khin an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a dingmi Bawipa nih saltannak chung cun a ka luatter,” tiah chim tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion a huatu vialte hna cu sung hna seh law kir dih hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn cungah a khomi ram, hleh cut hlan i a carmi bantuk khi si hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu bantuk ram cu ahohmanh nih pumh awkah an sak hna lo i a tom in i phorh awkah an rel hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah an pawng i a kalmi ahohmanh nih, “ Bawipa nih thluachuah in pe hna seh, Bawipa min in thluachuah kan in pek hna,” an ti hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka awlok a chon caah nangmah cu kan auh, Maw Bawipa !
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka aunak cu ka theihpiak law bawmh kan halnak cu ka ngaihpiak ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan sualnak kha cazin chungah na kan khumhpiak ahcun ahodah sual phawtnak cu a luat khomi a um lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw nangmah nih kan sualnak cu na kan ngaihthiam, cucaah nangmah cu kan in hmaizah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa bawmhnak cu i hngahhlang ngaiin ka hngak ko, a bia cu kaa bochan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ralvengtu pawl nih khuadei lai an i ngaih nak hmanh khin Bawipa hon lai cu kaa ngaih deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu a dawtnak kha a fek i mi tlanh kha a duh zungzalmi a si caah, Maw Israel, amah cu i bochan ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mi Israel mi vialte kha an sualnak chungin a khamh hna lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kaa porhlawtnak kha ka hlawt cang, ka ruamkainak kha ka chuahtak cang. Thil lianngan kha biapi ah ka ruat ti hna lo, ka ca i a har tukmi thil kha zei ah ka rel ti hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hna a ngam i ka lung a dai ko. Ngakchia cu a nu ṭang ah dai tein a ih bantukin ka lung cu ka chungah dai tein a um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel, atu in zungzal tiang, Bawipa cu i bochan ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, David kha philh hlah, a rianṭuanmi vialte zong kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa, bia aa kammi kha philh hlah, Israel Pathian Lianngan Bik, na sinah chiat aa serhmi kha philh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cu a biakamnak cu hitihin a si: “ Bawipa caah hmun pakhat ka ser khawh hlan lo, Israel Pathian Lianngan Bik caah umnak inn pakhat ka tuah khawh hlan lo, inn chung zongah ka lut lai lo i a ih zong ka it lai lo, a dinh zong kaa din lai lo i a hngilh zong kaa hngilh lai lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khua ah biakamnak kuang kong kha kan theih i Jaar lo lakah khan cu kuang cu kan hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Bawipa inn ah khan kal u sih, a bawiṭhutdan hmaiah khan amah cu bia u sih,” kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, biakamnak kuang he cun naa dinhnak hmun ah khan ra tuah, na ṭhawnnak hmelchunhnak a simi kuang he cun ra law zungzal in um tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mi na khamh hna kha tlangbawi nih thanh hna seh law na mi cu an dihlak in lunglawm in au hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sal David kha bia na rak kamh, na thimmi siangpahrang kha hlaw hlah, maw Bawipa .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David sinah biakamnak fek pakhat, na let ṭhan lo dingmi kha na rak ser, cu na biakamnak cu hihi a si: “Na fapa pakhat cu siangpahrang ah ka ser lai i na hnuah amah cu uktu bawi a rung si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na fapale hna nih khan ka biakamnak kha an zulh i nawl ka pekmi hna kha an tuah ahcun, an fapale hna zong cu nangmah hnu zulh in siangpahrang an si zungzal lai.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Bawipa nih Zion cu aa thim cang i khika ah a umnak inn kha ser a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aa thawh i, “Hika hi zungzal ka umnak a si lai; hika hmun hi ka uknak ka chiahnak hmun ca i ka duhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion cu a herhbaumi vialte kha tlamtling tein ka pek lai i a misifak hna cu rawl khim tein ka pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keimah nih ka khamh hna kha a tlangbawi pawl ka thanhter hna lai i a mi pawl kha lunglawm in hla ka sakter hna lai i ka auter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hika hmun ah hin Siangpahrang David tefa pakhat cu siangpahrang ngan pakhat ah ka ser lai, hika hmun ah hin ka thimmi siangpahrang uknak cu ka hmunhter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ral pawl cu ningzahnak in ka khuh hna lai, asinain anih cu a cer in a cermi suiluchin kha ka chinh l ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unau rual i rem tein khuasak ṭi hi zeitluk in dah a ṭhat i a nuamh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron luthlung in a khabe ah, a khabe in a angki hngawng ah a vung luangmi oliv chiti bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon Tlang dap, Zion tlang cung i a tlami bantuk a si. Zion Tlang ah cun thluachuahnak kan pek hna lai, tiah Bawipa nih bia a kan kam, zungzal nunnak cu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa sal vialte hna, ra u law Bawipa cu thangṭhat u sih, zan i a biakinn chung i rian a ṭuanmi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlacam in a biakinn chungah nan kut hler u law Bawipa cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van le vawlei a sertu Bawipa nih, Zion in thluachuah in pe ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u. Bawipa sal hna, a min cu thangṭhat u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa inn chungah a dirmi hna, kan Pathian hmunthiang chungah a ummi hna, a min cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭhat caah thangṭhat u zaangfah thiammi a si caah a min cu hla in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob cu amah minung si awkah amah nih aa thim, Israel mi cu amah mi si awkah amah nih aa thim hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Bawipa cu a liannganmi a si kha ka hngalh, pathian dang vialte hna nakin a ngan deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vancung ah siseh, vawlei cungah siseh, rili chungah siseh, rili tangah siseh, a duhmi paoh kha a tuah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanhramdeng in khuadawm kha a ratpi hna, thlichia chungin ṭek kha a chuahter i a thil khonnak inn chungin thli kha a chuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ram ah fater paohpaoh kha a thah hna, minung fater he saram fater he a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Faro le a bawi pawl dantatnak ah khuaruahharmi thil le hmelchunhnak kha a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miphun tampi kha a hrawh hna i siangpahrang ṭhawngṭhawng kha a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cu hna cu: Amor mi siangpahrang Sihon, Bashan siangpahrang Og le Kanaan siangpahrang dihlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ram cu a mi kha a pek hna, Israel mi kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu Pathian na si kha mi nih an hngalh zungzal ko lai; chan vialte nih a philh in an philh lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi cu a zaangfah hna lai, a sal cu a luatter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miphun dang nih an biakmi siasal cu sui le ngun in sermi an si; minung nih an kut in an sermi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaa cu an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw an holh kho lo, mit cu an ngei, sihmanhsehlaw khua an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hna an ngei, asinain khua an thei lo, an kaa chungah thaw a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cu siasal a sertu hna le cu siasal aa bochanmi hna cu, an sermi siasal bantuk ah cun an i cang lai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mi hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u; Pathian tlangbawi hna, amah cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nannih Levi mi hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u. amah a ṭihmi vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu Zion ah thangṭhat u, a inn Jerusalem ah thangṭhat u. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭhat caah lawm tuah u, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawm tuah u, pathian hna Pathian cu, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi vialte Bawipa cu lawm tuah u, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah lawng nih khuaruahhar thil lianngan a tuah khawh, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A fimnak in van khi a ser hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thukmi ti cungah vawlei kha a sak, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nika le thlapa kha a ser hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni cu chun uktu ah a ser, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlapa le arfi cu zan uktu ah a ser hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt mi an fapa upa bik kha a thah hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi kha Izipt ram chungin a chuahpi hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ṭhawngmi a kut le a ban in a chuahpi hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rili Sen kha a cheu, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mi cu rili chung khan a hruai hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro le a ralkap bu kha rili chungah a paih hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thetse ram chungah khan a mi kha amah nih a hruai hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siangpahrang ṭhawngṭhawng kha a thah hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang min thangthang kha a thah hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor mi siangpahrang Sihon kha a thah, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bashan siangpahrang Og kha a thah, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ram cu a mi kha a pek hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel a sal kha an ram cu a pek, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan sungh tikah khan a kan philh lo, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan ral hna kut chungin a kan chuah, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Minung le saram kha rawl a pek dih hna, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vancung Pathian hi lawm tuah u, a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun. a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon tiva hna kamah cun kan ṭhu i Zion kan ruah chel paoh ah kan ṭap tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan pawng i a ummi inhliam kung hna ah cun kan tingtang kha kan bah tawn hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kan tlaitu nih khan hlasak an kan fial i, “Kan i nuamh nakhnga, Zion hla kan sakpiak u,” an kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zeitindah Bawipa hla cu miphun dang ram ah kan sak khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem, nangmah kha kan philh a si ahcun, ka orhlei kut hi car seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nangmah kha kan hngalh camcin lo i kaa lawmhnak sang bik ah kan chiah lo ahcun, ka lei hi ka dang ah i beh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem an tlaih ni ah, Edom mi nih an tuahmi kha philh hlah, Maw Bawipa, “Hrawk dih cikcek u law a hram tiangin kalh dih u,” an ti kha philh hin hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon, hrawh na si cang lai! Kan cung i na tuahmi ruangah, teirul an chamtu cu an i lawm lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nan ngakchia no tete aa lak riangmang i lung cung i a dengtu hna cu, an i lawm lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah cu ka lungthin dihlak in kan lawmh; nangmah cu pathian hna hmaiah kan ṭhangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na biakinn thiang hmaiah ka kun i na min kha ka thangṭhat, zeicahtiah na dawtnak cu a fek i zumhawktlak na si, nangmah le na nawlbia cu a sang bik nan si kha na langhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan auh tikah na ka leh, na ṭhawnnak in na ka ṭhawnter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, vawlei cung siangpahrang vialte nih, na biakamnak kha an theih caah an in thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih na tuahmi thil kong kha hla in an sak lai i a liannganmi na sunparnak kha hla in an thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu hi tluk hin a sang hringhran ko nain minauta kha an zawn a ruah hna i miruamkai kha a hmuh lonak ah an i thup kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harnak nih a kulh in a ka kulh hmanh ah, him tein na ka umter ko, a thin a linh in a linmi ka ral kha na doh hna i na ṭhawnnak in na ka khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ka kamhmi thil vialte kha tlinter ko hna, Bawipa, na dawtnak cu zungzal in a fek ko; na thawk ciami rian cu liim ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, na ka kawl dih hirhiar i na ka hngalh dih cikcek!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tuahmi vialte cu na hngalh dih, lamhlatpi khin ka ruahnak vialte cu na hngalh dih ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rian ka ṭuan ah siseh, kaa dinh ah siseh, na ka hmuh, ka tuahmi vialte kha na hngalh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chim hlan in ka chim ding vialte kha na hngalh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hnulei le ka hmailei in na ka cawngh i ka cungah na kut na zar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ka hngalhnak hi a thuk tuk hringhran, ka ruahnak nih a phak khawh leng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thlarau sin hin khuazei ah dah ka zam khawh lai? Na hmaika hin khuazei ah dah kaa thuh khawh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancung ah khin hung kai ning tiah, cuka ah cun na rak um ko lai, mithi khua ah khin vung it ning tiah, cuka zongah cun na rak um ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nichuahlei ha khin lo diam in hei zuang hnik ning law, asiloah nitlaklei a hlatnak bik hmun zongah khin hei um hnik ning law,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />cuka zongah cun a ka hruaitu dingah nangmah na rak um ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai, a ka bawmtu dingah na rak um ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Muihnak kha, ka thup tuah, ka hei ti ko hnga, asiloah, ka velchum i ceunak kha, zan ah cang ka hei ti ko hnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />asinain cucu zeihmanh a ṭhahnem hlei hnga lo, zeicahtiah muihnak cu nang caah cun a mui lo i zan hmanh kha chun tlukin a ceu ko. Nang caah cun muihnak le ceunak cu zeihmanh an i dang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pum chung thil vialte hi nangmah sermi an si dih; ka nu pawchung i a ka semtertu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi bantuk thil thuk le khuaruahharmi thil ruangah hin nangmah cu kan lawmh: keimah kong i khuaruahhar a simi thil le nangmah nih na tuahmi thil khuaruahhar a simi hna kong ah hin kan lawmh. Nangmah nih na ka hngalh dih cikcek ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pum hi nang caah cun khuaruahhar awk a si lo, zeitindah a thli tein muisam ka hun ken le ka nu pawchung ah zeitindah ka hung ṭhan ti kha nang na caah cun khuaruahhar a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka chuah hlan in na rak ka hmuh diam cang. Ka ca i na sermi ni hna cu na cauk chungah an rak i khumh diam cang, hram an i thawk hlan hmanh khan an i ṭial diam cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na ruahnak cu ka caah zeitluk in dah hngalh a har, na ruahnak cu a tam tuk ah a dongh in a dong kho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rel tim hnik hna ning law thetse nak tam an si ṭung; an dihlak in rel dih dingah cun, nangmah chan can nun a hau hnga!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Pathian, miṭhalo kha cu that ko hna, ti ka duh. Mipuarhrang pawl nih hin ka kaltak hna seh, ti ka duh hringhran ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangmah kong ah thil ṭhalo lawng an chim i na min chiatnak lawng kha an chim lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa nangmah an huatu cu ka huat ve hna, nangmah an dohtu cu zei ah ka rel ve hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huat taktak in ka huat hna i ka ral ah ka rel hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka pur cikcek law ka lungthin hi hngal ko; ka hneksak law ka ruahnak hi hmu ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka chungah hlenthawinak a um sual hnga maw? a um sual ahcun ka hmuhpiak law zungzal hmunmi lam ah khan ka hruai ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, miṭhalo hna kut chung khan ka khamh ko; mipuarhrang hna sin khan him tein ka umter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak khua lawng kha an khang zungzal ko, siknak lawng kha an chuahter zungzal ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei cu rul lei bantuk a si i an bia cu rawchok sivai bantuk a si. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miṭhalo mi hna kut chung khan ka huppheng law, maw Bawipa, ka tluknak ding lawng a tuaktan lengmangmi hna mipuarhrang hna sin khan him tein ka umter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miruamkai pawl nih khan rap an ka chiahhnawh, mihrokhrawl pawl nih khan sur rap cu an chiah i lam ah khan keimah foihnak dingah cun an phah. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka thawh i, “Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si,” ka ti. Bawipa, nangmah bawmhnak hal in ka aunak cu ka theihpiak ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa ka Pathian, nangmah cu ka khamhtu ṭhawng na si, raltuknak hmun ah na ka huhphenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, miṭhalo cu an duhmi thil kha hmuhter hna hlah; thil ṭhalo an khanmi kha tlinter hlah. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ral kha teitu siter hna hlah, an ka tlerhnak cu anmah cung lila ah tlakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meiṭil sen nih tlak hna seh law, chuak kho ti loin khor thuk chungah tla hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lih in midang sual a puhmi cu, mi sual an puhnak hna ah khan thluachuak hna hlah seh; mipuarhrang cu ṭhat lonak nih khan tlak hna seh law hrawk hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa, nangmah nih misifak cu na ṭanpi hna i mirethei cu an hmuh awk hnga a simi kha na hmuhter hna, ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miding nih cun an in thangṭhat taktak lai, na hmaika ah khan khua an sa zungzal lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, nangmah kha kan auh, khulrang in ka bawm tuah! Nangmah kan auhnak ka aw hi ka ngaihpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thlacamnak cu zihmui bangin ka cohlanpiak law ka kut ka hlermi cu zanlei raithawinak sa bangin ka cohlanpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa, ka kaa ah hin ralvengtu ka chiahpiak law ka hmur ah hin cawngtu ka chiahpiak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil ṭhalo tuah duhnak ka ngeih sual nakhnga lo le miṭhalo hna thil ṭhalo tuahnak ah kaa tel ve nakhnga lo, ka lungthin hi nangmah nih kham ko; an puai ah cun a tel in i tel hlah ning!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miṭha nih cun dawtnak in ka si hna seh law dan ka tat ko hna seh, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo nih cun ka lu ah sathau ka thuh hna hlah seh, zeicahtiah cu bantukin ka cungah an tuah ahcun, thil ṭhalo an tuahmi i aa tel vemi ah an ka ser khawh sual ai hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An uktu bawi hna kha lungpang cungin hlonh an si tikah, mi nih ka bia ahmaan kha an hngalh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi nih an tan an cheu i a pel le a pawi ah a cang dihmi thing bantukin, an ruh cu thlanka kamah khan ṭhek dih si hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa Pathian, kei nih cun kan bochan i nangmah chungah dornak kha ka kawl; ka thihter sawh hlah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah foihnak dingah an chiahmi rap cun ka huppheng law thil ṭhalo a tuahtu hna chiahmi thang khan ka luatter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu anmah rap lila ah khan i foih hna seh, kei bel harnak zeihmanh tong loin kal ko ning.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawmhnak hmuhduh ah Bawipa cu ka auh i amah cu ka nawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka harnak vialte kha amah ka chimh dih i ka retheihnak vialte kha ka hngalhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thlarau kha ka chungah a bat tikah, zeidah ka tuah awk a si kha nangmah nih na hngalh. Ka kalnak lam ah khan ka ral nih rap an ka chiahhnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pawngkam kha ka zoh tikah, a ka bawmtu ding ahohmanh ka hmu hna lo, a ka hupphengtu ding ahohmanh an um lo, ahohmanh ka zawn a ka ruattu an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa, bawmhnak duh ah nangmah cu kan auh, Bawipa nangmah cu a ka hupphengtu na si; ka nun chungah hin ka duhmi le ka herhmi cu nangmah lawnglawng na si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnabei donghnak chungah khan a pil in ka pil cang caah ka bawm ko sawh, tiin kan auhnak cu ka ngaihpiak ko. Keimah nakin a let tampi in a ṭhawng deuhmi, ka ral hna kut chungin ka khamh tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na min cu ka thangṭhat khawh nakhnga thong chung hin ka chuah ko sawh. Ka hmuh awk hnga a simi laksawng kha na ka pek tikah a dingmi hna nih cun pangpar ṭhi kha an ka oih lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, ka thlacamnak cu ka theihpiak law kan nawlnak cu ka ngaihpiak ko. Nang cu na ding i zumhawktlak na si caah Ka thlacamnak cu ka let tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keimah na salpa hi na hmaika i biaceihnak ah ka phakter hlah; na hmaiah hin ahohmanh a sual lomi an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ral nih a ka hrem i a ka tei cikcek. A muimi thonginn chungah a ka khumh i hlanpi ah a thi cangmi hna bantuk kha ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cucaah ka celh ti lo i ka hnabei a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A liam ciami ni kha ka hun thei ṭhan hna; nangmah nih na tuahmi thil vialte kha ka hun ruat ṭhan hna i na tuahmi thil vialte kha ka hun hngal ṭhan hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah leiah thlacam in ka kut cu ka hler hna; vawlei car nih ti a ngaih bantuk khin ka nunnak nih nangmah cu an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa, atu ah ka let ko sawh, ruahchannak zeihmanh ka ngei ti lo! Ka thuh tak hlah, na ka thuh tak ahcun mithi khua i a vung kalmi bantuk ka si ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan bochan ko; zinglei ah a fekmi na dawtnak kha ka hngalhter ṭhan ko. Ka thlacamnak cu nangmah sinah an kai, ka kalnak ding lam cu ka hmuhsak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa, huhphenhnak hmuh duh ah nangmah cu kan fuh; ka ral hna kut chung hin ka chanh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka Pathian na si; cucaah na duhnak tuah kha ka cawnpiak ko. Na velngeihnak thawngin himnak lam ah ka hruai tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bia na ka kam bang khan ka khamh tuah, Maw Bawipa ; na ṭhatnak thawngin ka harnak chung khan ka chuahter ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ka dawt caah ka ral cu that hna law a ka dohtu vialte kha hrawk hna, zeicahtiah keimah cu na sal k a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa, ka lungpi cu thangṭhat si ko seh! Amah nih raltuknak kha a ka cawnpiak i ka kutdong kha raldoh a thiamter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah cu a ka hupphengtu lungpi ka ralhruang a si, a fekmi ralvenbuk le himnak hmun a si, kaa bochanmi phaw a si. Miphun dang kha ka ke tangah amah nih a chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, minung hi zeidah a si i a zawn na ruah? Minung fapa hi zeidah a si i biapi ah na rel?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minung cu thaw bantuk men a si ko, a nun chung ni hna cu a liam zaumi thladem bantuk men an si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, van kha run ṭhum hna law kan sinah rung ṭum tuah, tlang kha run tawng hna law meikhu chuah hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimtlau kha a kenkip ah lekter hna law na ral kha ṭhek dih hna; na thal in kap hna law zam dih hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cunglei khan run ka banh law a thukmi ti chung hin ka chuah tuah; ramdangmi hna ṭhawnnak chung hin ka khamh tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />annih cu biatak a chim bal lomi, biatak ka chim lai tiah chiat i serh hnu hmanh ah lih a chim ṭhiamṭhiammi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nangmah cu hla thar in kan thangṭhat lai, tingtang kha kaa tum lai i kan thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu teinak kha na pek hna i na sal David cu na khamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A puarmi ka ral hna kut chung khan ka khamh ko, ramdangmi hna ṭhawnnak chung hin ka khamh tuah, annih cu biatak a chim bal lomi, biatak ka chim lai tiah chiat i serh hnu hmanh i lih a chim ṭhiamṭhiammi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan fapale hna cu an tlanval lioah, a ṭhawngmi thingkung bantuk si hna seh law, kan fanule hna cu bawi inn ṭamhnak tung bantuk si hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan rawl inn hna cu rawl a phunphun in khat hna seh, kan lo lak i a ummi tuu hna nih fa a thongthong in hring hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan caw nih fa tampi hring hna seh law a lotlaumi le a rawkmi pakhat hmanh um hna hlah seh. Kan khuachung lam ah lungfah ṭahnak thawng zeihmanh leng hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi bantukin a ummi miphun cu aa lawmmi miphun an si; an Pathian ah Bawipa a simi hna cu, lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian le ka siangpahrang, na lianhngannak cu ka thanh lai i nangmah cu a zungzal in kan lawmh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nifate in kan thangṭhat lai i a zungzal in kan lawmh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu a lian a nganmi a si, fak piin thangṭhat awk a si; a lianhngannak cu kan hngalh khawh leng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na tuah sernak cu chan khat hnu chan khat thangṭhat a si lai, thil khuaruahhar na tuahmi cu aupi an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi nih na sunparnak le lianngannak kha an chim lai, kei nih thil khuaruahhar na tuahmi kha ka ruat hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi nih thil khuaruahhar na tuahmi kha an chim hna lai, kei nih na lianhngannak kha ka thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih nih na ṭhatnak kha an chim lai, na velngeihnak kha hla in an sak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu dawtnak a ngeimi le mi zaangfah thiammi a si, thinhun a har i a fekmi dawtnak in a khatmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aho cung paoh ah a ṭha i a sermi hna an dihlak cungah zaangfahnak a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa, na sermi thil vialte nih an in thangṭhat lai, na sermi hna nih an in lawmh lai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na pennak a sunpar ning kha an chim lai i na ṭhawnnak kha an thanh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah mi vialte nih thil khuaruahhar na tuahmi kha an hngalh lai i na pennak a sunpar ning le a lianhngan ning kha an hmuh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na pennak cu zungzal in a hmun lai i nangmah cu zungzal in siangpahrang na si lai. Pathian nih cun biakamnak a tuahmi kha zumhawktlak tein a zulh i a tuahmi thil paoh kha an ṭha dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Harnak a ingmi kha a bawmh hna i ṭhumhnak a tongmi kha a cawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruahchannak he na sermi thil nung vialte nih an in zoh i an herhmi rawl kha an herh caan te ah a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kut na samh i an dihlak in an herhmi kha tling tein an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu thil a tuahnak paoh ah hin ding tein a tuahmi a si, rian a ṭuannak paoh ah hin zaangfahnak a ngeimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A autu vialte hna cu an pawng khin an umhnawh hna, lungtak in a autu vialte hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah a ṭihmi paoh cu an herhmi vialte kha a pek hna i an aunak kha a theih i a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah a dawtu cu an dihlak in a huhphenh hna, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu a hrawh dih hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka thangṭhat lai, thilnung vialte nih a min thiang cu zungzal in thangṭhat hna seh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Maw ka nunnak, Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nun chung vialte amah cu ka thangṭhat lai; nunnak ka ngeih chung paohpaoh ka Pathian cu hla in ka thangṭhat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi kha i bochan hna hlah u, nanmah an khamh kho ṭung hna lomi kha i bochan hna hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thih tikah leidip ah an kir ko; cu ni ah cun an khuakhannak vialte cu an dong fawn ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob Pathian kha bawmtu ah aa serhmi cu mi lunglawm an si, Bawipa a Pathian kha aa hngatchanmi cu mi lunglawm an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amah nih cun van le vawlei le rili le an chung i a ummi thil vialte kha a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A biakam kha a tlolh bal lo; hremmi hna ṭanh in bia kha a ceih i rawl a ṭammi kha rawl a pek hna. Bawipa nih thongtla kha a luatter hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mitcaw kha khua hmuhnak a pek hna. Ṭhumhnak a ingmi kha a cawi hna i a dingmi a mi kha a dawt hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi ram chungah a ummi ramdangmi kha a huhphenh hna; nuhmei le ngakṭah kha a bawmh hna, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo pawl khuakhannak cu a hrawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cu zungzal in siangpahrang a si ko lai! Zion, na Pathian cu zungzal in uktu a si lai. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Kan Pathian cu hla in thangṭhat hi a ṭha; amah thangṭhat hi a nuam i ahmaan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih Jerusalem cu a remh ṭhan lai, saltang mi kha a kirpi ṭhan hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungkuai mi kha a damter hna i an hma kha a menpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arfi kha a rel dih hna i an dihlak in min a bunh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Bawipa cu a lian a ngan i ṭhawnnak in a tling, thil a hngalhning hi tah khawh a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi toi i aa dormi cu a cawi hna, sihmanhsehlaw miṭhalo cu vawlei ah a rial hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu hla in thangṭhat tuah u, kan Pathian cu tingtang aw dawh in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van ah khin minmei a zamter; vawlei kha ruah in a cawm i tlang cungah ram a khohter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saram kha rawl a pek hna i lang-ak no nih an awnh tikah rawl a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nih rangtum ṭhawngṭhawng hi biapi ah a ruahmi an si lo, ralkap ralṭhami hi a lawmhmi an si fawn lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />asinain a lung a tongmi cu amah a ṭihmi le a fekmi a dawtnak aa bochanmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem, Bawipa cu thangṭhat tuah! Zion, na Pathian cu thangṭhat tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah nih na kutka kha a fehter hna, na mi kha thluachuahnak a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ramri kha him tein a umter hna i changvut ṭha bikbik in na paw an khimter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vawlei ah a nawlbia kha a thlah i khulrang in a ra phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sahmul tluk chah in hawhra kha a tlakter i leidip bangin dappar kha a ṭhek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rial cu lung tekem bangin a tlakter; kihnak a run thlahmi cu ahohmanh nih an celh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun nawlbia kha a vun chuah i hawhra cu a ti; thli kha a hranter i ti cu a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob cu a bia kha a chimh, Israel cu a nawlbia le a phunglam kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miphun dang hna caah cun mah hihi a tuah hna lo, a phunglam kha an hngal hna lo. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Cung sangpi i a ummi hna, Bawipa cu vancung khin run thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vancungmi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u, a vancung ralkap vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni le thla hna, amah cu thangṭhat u! A ceumi arfi hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Van sang bik hna, amah cu thangṭhat u, vancung i a ummi ti hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An dihlak in Bawipa min cu thangṭhat hna seh! Bia a chim i annih cu ser an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amah nawl pekmi thawngin annih cu an umnak hmun cio ah khan zungzal in an um i a nawl ngai loin an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rili chung thil ṭihnung hna le rilipi thuk hna, Bawipa cu vawlei ah hin thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimtlau le rial, hawhra le khuadawm, a nawl a ngaimi thlichia, nannih nih Bawipa cu thangṭhat ko u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fing le tlang hna, thingthei kung le tupi hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saram vialte hna, inn zuat saṭil le ramlak saram hna, a paw in a lawnmi le vate vialte hna, nan dihlak in amah cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang vialte le mi vialte hna, uktu le bawi vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlangval le ngaknu hna, tar le no le ngakchia vialte hna, amah cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An dihlak in Bawipa min cu thangṭhat hna seh! A min cu min dang vialte nakin a ngan deuh; a sunparnak nih van le vawlei a lonh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A miphun kha miphun ṭhawng ah a ser hna, cucaah a mi vialte nih an thangṭhat, a dawt ngaingaimi Israel mi nih khan an thangṭhat. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Bawipa cu hla thar in thangṭhat u; a mithiang an i pumhnak ah amah cu thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel, nangmah an sertu ruangah cun i lawm tuah, Zion mi hna, nan siangpahrang ruangah cun i lawm tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nan lamnak ah khan a min cu thangṭhat u, amah cu khuang le tingtang in thangṭhat u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa nih a mi cu a zaangfah hna i santlai lomi kha teinak a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An teinak ah cun Pathian mi cu i lawm hna seh law rawl danghnak an tuahmi ah cun lunglawm in hla sa hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vainam a harmi i put in Pathian an thangṭhatnak ah cun a au in au hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu vainam cun miphun dang kha tei hna seh law lawkihmi kha dantat hna seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an siangpahrang hna kha khit hna seh law thir cikcin in hreng hna seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian nawlbia bangin miphun dang cu dantat hna seh. Pathian mi nih an hmuhmi teinak cu hihi a si. Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Pathian cu a biakinn chungah khan thangṭhat u; a ṭhawnnak cu vancung ah khin thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil lianngan a tuahmi ruangah amah cu thangṭhat u! A sang bik a lianhngannak cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Muko in thangṭhat u! Tingtang le thonglawi in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuang le lam in thangṭhat u, tingtang le thonglawi in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sumsel in thangṭhat u! A aw a thangmi sumsel in thangṭhat u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thilnung vialte hna, Bawipa cu thangṭhat u! Bawipa cu thangṭhat u!
  </para>
</usx>
